    long_description:
      "You are bored and looking for something challenging and full of surprise? Then welcome to the thrilling world of Jelly Cube Snake. The rule is simple but really addicting.\n\nJelly Cube Snake is a modern twist of the classic snake and merge games. Control your cube and navigate it around the game area, merge as many cubes as possible to grow longer and more powerful. But beware! Other players are on the prowl, ready to outmaneuver, trap, and eliminate you to claim victory for themselves. \n\nFEATURES:\n- Hundreds of challenging obstacles and fun levels.\n- Merge cubes and defeat enemies to rank at the top leaderboard.\n- Personalize your chain's appearance with a vast array of skins, colors and patterns.\n- Various power-up and boosts scattered throughout the arena will help you gain temporary advantages over your opponents.\nAre you ready to slither, strategize, and dominate? Get ready to become the ultimate merge chain master! Share with your family and friends to experience Jelly Cube Snake together.\n\nTerms of use: https://puzzle.sg/terms-and-conditions/\nPrivacy Policy: https://puzzle.sg/privacy-policy/",
