    long_description:
      "Tacticool  is an action-packed 5v5 top-down shooter, where teamwork and tactics are your keys to victory. Variety of heroes and real-life weapons allow you to play different styles. Immersive locations and moving environments can be your friend or foe. In this game you can break the rules, go crazy, chase your enemies in cars and have a lot of fun.\n\nTacticool offers short  PvP and PvE fights of 2-3 minutes. Play with your real friends online or find new friends worldwide! Create combat tactics, study hundreds of unique combinations of operators & weapons, lead your squad to destroy the enemy. Tacticool is a strong community of tough guys all over the world, who gather in game clans and become true friends. \n\nEnjoy Tacticool playing modes:\nBASIC 5V5 MODES: Capture the Bag, Control, Team Deathmatch.\nSPECIAL MODES: Battle Royale, Operation Descent: war with a horde of zombies in a team of 3 players.\n\nGame Features:\n\nMore than 80 types of weapons: Shotgun, Knives, Grenades, Mines, RPG, C4, Adrenaline, Landau, Gravity Gun, Sniper Gun and more. Take your high-powered guns up on the battlefield!\n\nUp to 30 customizable characters. Every hero has their own unique talents. So be creative, combine presets and play your way. Which operator do you want to be today? Sniper, assaulter, defender or maybe supporter (healer)? It's up to you. \n\n19 different locations and destructible environments. Choose one of 19 game maps with an immersive environment. Everything you see on the map can be used for your goals, throw objects, blow up fences, chase enemies in cars and hit them. The maps are made to make you feel like you're in a real-life battleground. Use auto aiming to arrange cool war games online!\n\nCar fights and exciting gang style combat with your squad. Shoot straight from the car or arrange an accident for an even more dynamic gameplay experience. Watch out for a moving train, it can hit you in seconds!\n\nRegular updates, new events and new cool gun game elements. With Tacticool 5v5 game you`ll never get bored. During events you can get new gameplay experience for upgrading your killing and shooting skills. \n\nPlay online with your friends and make new friends in Tacticool! Clan up, that’s where the game starts! Share your knowledge and communicate with teammates using a voice chat, change tactics in action and express emotions. \n\n\n\nThis 5v5 action game is based on tactics. The third-person view allows you to control the situation on the battleground and develop various tactics. Place a sniper or send a special forces squad, set up a trap for the enemy. Enjoy leveling up your account, improving skills and tactics. The victory based on skills is much better! \n\n\nDeveloped with the support of MY.GAMES.\n\nFollow us:\nTacticool players club: https://tacticool.game\nDiscord: https://discord.com/invite/tacticool\nYT: https://www.youtube.com/@TacticoolGame\nFB: https://www.facebook.com/TacticoolGame\nIG: https://www.instagram.com/tacticoolgame\nTW: https://twitter.com/TacticoolGame\n\n\nPlease contact customer service if you encounter any problems: support@panzerdog.com\nhttps://support.tacticool.game/\n\nBrought to you by MY.GAMES B.V.",
