    long_description:
      "In the year 1023 on the continent, the Z virus was maliciously leaked by an organization with the intent of overthrowing the continent's regime, plunging the world into the brink of panic and destruction. This dreadful evil disaster distorted everything that existed. Life forms infected by bacteria became deranged, attacking everything around them. The entire continent was nearly laid to waste, with only a few cities remaining, fighting against the virus and seeking a cure.\nOne hundred years have passed, and only three surviving cities still struggle to save humanity. The towering Cloudseed City, a colossal airship known as Noah's Ark, was constructed through the collaboration of multiple nations, possessing advanced technology and formidable weaponry. The Lord's Manor, Council, Corps, and Academy within the city work together, dedicated to rescuing humanity from the plague. Ruined Hope City, a ground-level settlement established by survivors, strives to coexist with both technology and magic, persevering for survival. And the clandestine Mystic City underground, controlled by an alliance of magical families, houses members who harness magical powers and specialize in its profound study.\nHowever, the malevolent organization known as the World Serpent, concealed behind the disaster, begins to reveal its wicked intentions. They delve deep into both technology and magic, conducting sinister experiments that spawn numerous mutant creatures. To address this catastrophe, to uncover the experiment reports, people must locate and utterly destroy the World Serpent's main base. The Beta Team is the human-formed counteroffensive unit, forged for survival.\nThe \"Doomsday Vanguard\" awaits your participation, as you become a hero in this world, battling to rebuild civilization. You will join the \"Doomsday Vanguard\" alongside other members, exploring ruins, safeguarding survivors, and conquering monsters. Your bravery and wisdom will make you a hero of this world, contributing your strength to the reconstruction of civilization.\n\nGameplay:\nSimple controls, allowing you to enjoy the game anytime, anywhere. No matter where you are or when you want to play, you can dive into the game easily and at your convenience.\nHundreds of skills to mix and match, allowing you to create your own combat style. In the game, you can select specific skills and abilities to adapt to various battle scenarios and enemies. Different combinations of skills can create various powerful battle strategies.\nCharacter leveling and development, granting you greater power. In the game, you can earn experience points by defeating monsters and completing quests, raising your character's level. Additionally, you can strengthen your attributes and abilities by collecting items and equipment.\nEquipment is your best companion! Choose the right equipment to enhance your combat prowess. Throughout the game, you can acquire various equipment by exploring ruins, defeating monsters, and completing tasks. These items can boost your attack power, defense, and other attributes, making you even more formidable in battles.\n\nHighlights:\nThe game's standout feature is having hundreds of monsters on the same screen, providing an unprecedented sense of thrilling combat. You will face a wide variety of monsters, each possessing distinct special abilities and attack methods. You'll need to utilize your skills and strategies to defeat them while safeguarding the survival of human beings.\nThe game offers multiple difficulty levels, catering to players of different skill levels, challenging them to push their limits. Whether you're a novice or a seasoned player, you can choose the appropriate difficulty based on your abilities and challenge yourself to the extreme. Each difficulty level presents unique challenges and rewards awaiting you.\n\nFacebook:@DoomsdayVanguard\nTWITTER:@devilsurvi32094\nContact Us: DoomsdayVanguard@outlook.com",
