    three_star_ratings: 4,
    four_star_ratings: 53,
    five_star_ratings: 429,
    long_description:
      "Swappy brings the joys of solving jigsaw puzzles on your table to your mobile phone. Enjoy hundreds of curated puzzle pictures!\n\nThis jigsaw puzzle game introduces a unique gameplay mechanic that allows players to utilize a mobile device's intuitive finger controls. Instead of finding each jigsaw piece in a complex environment, Swappy presents a fluid, smooth and immersive gameplay with swap mechanics. Swap jigsaw pieces and complete a puzzle picture while taking a rest from your daily chores.\n\nSwappy has been curated by a professional art team that handpicked each puzzle picture for the players. We compiled a massive library of oil paintings, photorealistic images, artistic drawings, and vector graphics. Your eyes will feast while solving each puzzle picture.\n\nJigsaw puzzles are suitable for cognitive and motor skills. It provides simple brain training and memory refreshing. Our easy controls allow all ages of players to enjoy Swappy with ease. Just download it and begin solving the jigsaw puzzles right away!\n\nLike a magic jigsaw puzzle, the game uses special particle effects and matching pieces to provide a classic jigsaw puzzle and color art. To suit a variety of tile master veterans, block, and crush enthusiasts will feel at home while solving jigsaw puzzles like in real life.\n\nSwappy offers different difficulty levels for both casual and professional players. If you are a veteran who solves 1000-piece puzzles in your free time, you will find the hard levels just for you. But easygoing players can still enjoy and complete the game by finishing the easy levels. On top of these two levels, we have a medium difficulty for players looking for a little challenge while expecting some relaxing gameplay.\n\nFeatures:\n• Different jigsaw puzzle pieces for plenty of gameplay variation.\n• Smooth animations and soothing sound effects.\n• Clean visuals that help the eyes.\n• Different difficulty levels catering all kinds of players.\n• Daily levels for recurrent activity.\n• More than 1000 puzzle pictures.\n• Can be played with one hand.\n• Completely free to download.\n• Can be played offline. WIFI is not required.",
