    long_description:
      "Welcome to the best Video Poker game!\nDownload the game and play for free!\nExplore classic and multi-hand gameplay with fantastic graphics in Video Poker.\nTry your luck and and have Vegas-style fun!\nChoose between classic gameplay or multi-hand mode, where you can play up to 25 hands at once!\n\nGame features:\n• FREE CHIPS – Play the game every day to get free chips!\n• CLASSIC AND MULTI-HAND VIDEO POKER — Immerse yourself in classic and multi-hand Video Poker and enjoy the fantastic graphics!\n• CHOOSE YOUR GAME – Play the most popular video poker games:\n- Deuces Wild\n- Jacks or Better\n- Bonus Video Poker\n• QUESTS – Complete daily quests to get free chips!\n• NO REGISTRATION – Get straight into the action. Choose guest mode to use our free casino app without registering.\n• FAIR PLAY GUARANTEED – Our certified Random Number Generator (RNG) gives you the best and fairest Video Poker experience!\n• YOUR OWN PROFILE PAGE – Track your current status and progress in the game! Get experience and level up. See how many games you've played and achievements you've completed. Get unique properties and display them on your profile. View other players' profiles to see how you compare!\n\nWant more than Video Poker?\nTry our other games for an unforgettable 3D experience:\n• TEXAS HOLD’EM POKER – The most popular casino game among professional gamblers! Test your skills in amazing poker tournaments!\n• BLACKJACK – A simple game of “21”. An exciting 3D game that any blackjack fan is sure to enjoy.\n• ROULETTE – Featuring stunning 3D graphics and three varieties of table: French, American, and European.\n• OMAHA POKER – A more dynamic version of poker with 5 cards in a hand. Have more fun with amazing combinations!\n• SLOTS – Explore our themed slots with lots of unique features!\n• BACCARAT – One of the most popular and exciting card games with superior 3D graphics!\n• CRAPS – The first 3D craps game ever. Make bets, roll the dice, take risks and become the best craps player!\n\nSubscribe to the official Facebook page of the game and be the first to find out about our promotions and news! \nhttps://facebook.com/Pokerist\nFollow us on Twitter and get free chips!\nhttps://twitter.com/KamaCasino",
