    four_star_ratings: 5012,
    five_star_ratings: 36713,
    long_description:
      "Looking for a Solitaire game that offers a fun and challenging gameplay experience, as well as the chance to win real cash prizes? Look no further than Solitaire Smash!\nOur game has been carefully crafted to offer a modern and sleek gameplay interface, incorporating classic Solitaire game elements that we all know and love.\nOur platform is committed to ensuring a secure gaming environment based on fair, social competition for all our players. When you play Solitaire Smash, you will be matched with other players at the same skill level as you, all using the same deck.\nThis ensures that the game is completely fair and based purely on skill.\nSolitaire Smash offers a range of thrilling features:\n* Play in real money tournaments!\n* Secure deposit using PayPal and Apple Pay!\n* Cash-out Safely!\n* Ad-free gaming experience!\n* Daily gifts and bonuses!\n* Multiplayer tournaments with trophies and big prizes!\nAdditionally, we regularly offer special challenges and surprises to keep the game exciting and engaging.\nHow to Play Solitaire Smash:\n1. Put your Solitaire skills to the test in our exciting tournaments. The game is the same whether you are playing for virtual currency or real money.\n2. Build sequences of the same type of cards in the four foundations, which are the piles at the top left corner. Place the Ace you uncover into one of the four foundations. If you find the same card type, in ascending order, place it over the Ace.\n3. To play in the tableau, drag cards to build sequences in descending order and alternating colors. Empty columns can only be filled with a king. If you have no face-up cards to move, tap the stockpile to draw from the top and use the first card. Redraw if needed.\n4. When you're out of moves, you can undo your moves to try a different play. If you cannot find another move, submit your score and take advantage of the bigger time bonus. Timing is key. The faster you clear the board, the higher your score, and the bigger bonus you will get!\n5. The top three players in the Solitaire tournament will win real money or gems. Keep playing to win daily rewards and treats! Enjoy our unique and special events, missions, and challenges.\n\nSo, brace yourself for an addictive experience that will not only sharpen your mind but also provide a relaxing and rewarding experience. With the potential to enhance your solitaire skills and strategies, you'll find yourself getting lost in the fun of becoming the ultimate solitaire player - all while winning exciting cash rewards! Get set to take on this challenge and feel the rush of anticipation!\n\nKindly note: Cash tournaments are not available in the following states: Arizona, Arkansas, Iowa, Louisiana, Maryland, South Carolina, South Dakota, and Vermont.\n*If you reside in a prohibited state, you can still play with our virtual currency for fun.\n\nEnjoy playing our real money solitaire game? Then, please rate and review us, your feedback counts!\nIf you have any questions, feel free to reach out to our support team at support@solitairesmash.com, we are always here to help!\nhttps://www.solitairesmash.com\n!! INSTALL NOW and turn your solitaire skills into real money !!",
