    long_description:
      'Spider Solitaire perfected!  \n\nSpider is one of the most popular types of solitaire in the world and Spider Solitaire Deluxe® 2 is the premium way to enjoy it.  Play any way you like: choose from unlimited winnable or random deals, play with one, two, or four suits… even choose from the best cards and backgrounds in the exclusive Spider store, including our exclusive four color cards that make four suit spider more enjoyable!\n\nRelax and keep your brain sharp with the smoothest Spider gameplay on the App Store!\n\nListen to what our customers say about our Solitaire Deluxe® 2 suite app:\n\n***** “This is by far the best solitaire game in the App Store. Hands down.” -Crazyeightyeight \n\n***** "It’s the only solitaire game I play now.” -Katieibond\n\n***** “The best solitaire app! …none even compare to this one.” -Megaamy\n\n***** “this is seriously the BEST solitaire game ever.” -Jackie Scott \n\n***** "Such an addictive game!!! Cannot stop playing it!!!" -Leeschutte\n\n***** "Good fun, good value, easy to use." -MadMeg2\n\n***** "I could get lost in this game for hours." -DebBers1\n\nSpider Solitaire Deluxe® 2 has the world’s best leaderboards! Play with your friends and neighbors on a team, or compare scores with other players from around the world. \n\nBrought to you by Mobile Deluxe, the company specializing in mobile solitaire since 2003. \n\nPREMIUM SPIDER FEATURES \n\n-Exercise your brain: one, two or four suit Spider games\n\n-Beautiful HD Graphics.\n\n-Exclusive Easy Read® cards – play Spider the right way!!\n\n-Winnable Deals – Nearly unlimited guaranteed winnable deals\n\n-Play with friends on Facebook or play solo.\n\n-In-Game shop for exclusive cards & backgrounds.\n\n-Stickers and ribbons to collect after winning hands of Spider!\n\n-Best-in-class customer care for any questions.\n\nAnd now it’s social: Have fun playing with friends, or play solo. \n\nYour mobile device has advanced… isn’t it time your solitaire did, too?',
