    long_description:
      'Win real cash prizes and play exciting online games like solitaire, bingo and bubble shooter. \nJoin a DuelCash tournament to compete with others, or create your own private games and invite friends.\n\nClassic skill games and endless fun await – jump into a medieval setting filled with top prizes. In DuelCash you can enjoy an exciting twist on popular games with Original Solitaire, Bubble Horror Saga, and Arkadium - Price is Right.\n\nWin money in classic card games and rise up the ranks. Each skill-based game pits you against players from across the globe, with over 500,000 in the ultimate test of skill and wits. Real cash prizes or DuelCash gems – Play to win awesome rewards with every challenge.\n\nExplore over 12 different skill games and accumulate gems. Cash more your thing? Play solitaire or bingo and compete in Cash Game Races for your chance to win big or try your luck with the Spin to Win wheel containing prizes of up to $500,000.\n\nPlay and win your way on DuelCash. Earn prizes and win real money by climbing the leaderboards as you compete in skill games filled with exciting rewards.\n\nDUELCASH FEATURES\n\nDrop Into The Dark Ages With Classic Skill Games\n- Arcade games: Compete in beloved games that will put your skills to the test\n- Solitaire, Bingo, Bubble Shooter, and more – all available in just a few taps\n- Skill-based games: With DuelCash you can show off your arcade prowess in 12+ skill games\n\nEarn Rewards & Win Cash\n- Win real cash prizes in classic games or spin the wheel to try your luck\n- Earn gems and wager them with each game you play for your chance to double your winnings\n- Compete for big cash prizes & Mega Jackpots with Spin the Wheel or Cash Game Races\n\nPractice, Play, Win\n- Practice classic skill games and get your bearings before you compete against players\n- Ready for battle? Hop into online games with players across the globe\n- Play with friends and challenge over 500,000 players on DuelCash\n\nDuelCash is your portal into thrilling, medieval skill games. Enjoy this twist on classic games and climb the ranks as you play Solitaire, Bingo, Bubble Shooter and more!\n\nEarn rewards and get paid in endless fun when you download today!\n\nCash games are not available in Arkansas, Alaska, Arizona, Connecticut, Delaware, Louisiana, Maryland, Missouri, Montana, South Carolina, South Dakota, Tennessee, Illinois, and Vermont. Players in these states can still enjoy free games!',
