    long_description:
      'The most entertaining game of the year is already here! It is your time to shine, dress well to impress everyone, dress to win this clash of fashion battle! The game has already been viewed millions of times on TikTok and has become a popular trend. Dress well according to a specific concept to toast your opponent on the runway. Ever wondered how it is like to be under the spotlights and do a catwalk fashion battle as fashion star Kylie Jenner and Kim Kardashian at a Met Gala? Now is your chance to show your fashion run and shine! You will be selecting realistic shoes and outfits for girls, high heels, clothes, bikinis, date night dresses, even accessories like vintage sunglasses and doll designer bags. Some concepts and genres will be about casual clothing while some will be all about luxury. This baddie game is all on you!\n\nThe greatest thing about the this girl game is you can be a super stylist! Now it is your time to shine, glam and become a part of this dress up fashion stylist for your model. You can be a model, dancer, or cover girl like a fashion nova. No matter if you are teen or adult, you are the designer and this dressing up game is your sketchbook! This is a girl game that has hair challenge, makeup games, barbie games and continuous fashion show. Dress up your fashion super model and become the fashion stylist ever. This pocket styler is the most covet fashion game ever. Fashion games like this have never have been this fun! Find the most stylish possible fashion dress clothes that will rock your high heels or complete your style with a designer bag, all of these are up to you! Join this highly addictive 3D fashion dress up game and be a part of this luxurious adventure!\n\nFor feedback: https://discord.gg/3GRWE2k',
