    long_description:
      "A Fun Water Sorting Puzzle Game is here for you! It’s time to test how smart you are. Test your intelligence by solving this liquid sort water puzzle. Sort them all, This puzzle game stimulates your brain in a very fun and challenging way. Enjoy the mental brain IQ challenge as you stack the colorful waters in the tubes in this water sort game. Let’s see how good you are at juggling the colors in different water tubes in this mind relaxing iq game.\n\nThis water sort is a very easy yet challenging game. All you have to do in this whole logic puzzle game is to use your brain and sort colors correctly in every tube. It's time to get your head in the game and sort color puzzles. There are tubes filled with different colors. Quickly sort the colored waters in the tubes until all the same colors are together in each tube and become a champion of this sort puzzle games.\n\nThere is a fun rule of this sort puzzle relaxing game that you can only pour water of the same color at the top and the tube you are pouring has enough space in it. So be careful while filling up the tube using your colored water.\n\nThink, strategize, predict, and use logic puzzles at every move and look before pouring whether the other tube has enough space or not. Win jewels at the end of every level, use the jewels to unlock more and more hints.\n\nBe careful while solving the puzzle pieces to make sure you don’t get stuck. This water sort game has simple controls, limitless unique levels, and no time limit.\n\nSo what are you waiting for? This water sort game will make sure you enhance your IQ level as well as kill boredom. All in one, isn’t it cool?\n\nFeatures:\nSort the puzzle pieces into respective tubes.\nCollect gems every time you complete a logic puzzle level\nGet free hints in case you get stuck in this brain game\nColorful graphics & exciting water sort color sounds\n\n\nPrivacy Policy: http://tap-nation.io/privacy\nTerm of use: https://www.tap-nation.io/legal-notice/",
