    long_description:
      "Have you ever fantasized about spending at the supermarket? How much can you take away in a limited time? Goods Match 3D, can you take all the snacks, chips, drinks, chocolates from the shelves? Is this just the content? Of course not, come and experience the fun of the level and unlock more interesting 3D items.\n\nGame Features\n\n*More than 1000+ levels\n\n*Hyperrealistic 3d items: CHIP,SNACKS,DRINKS,COCONUT FLAKES,SODA and so on..\n\n*Simple gameplay\n\n*Generous props and gold coin rewards\n\n*Realistic scene changes\n\n*Easy and relaxing time killer game\n\n*Super boosters and hints to help you pass hard levels\n\n*Is it over? There are many more waiting for you to feedback to other guys in the comments!!\n\n\n\nHow to play\n\n- Tap same 3d items to shopping cart\n\n* 3 of same items will be cleared\n\n* Enjoy fun match 3d game and great features like skill card collections\n\n* Complete the different missions and win great rewards\n\n* ATTENTION! Each level has a timer, so you must move fast & reach the level goal!\n\n* Use the boosters to help you pass tricky levels\n\nIf you've seen it all, don't hesitate to try it out and you'll be addicted to Goods Match 3D! I promise",
