    two_star_ratings: 257,
    three_star_ratings: 1079,
    four_star_ratings: 2077,
    five_star_ratings: 11765,
    long_description:
      "Meet FARM JAM, a brilliant mix of a farming simulator and a parking game. Youve just bought a ticket for a farm sightseeing Take your seats, lads, were going to the Ol Sharpeyes farmland.\n\nFARM ADVENTURES\n\nThis farm is my life, folks, and I've been living here since the day I remember myself. My parents got this klondike from their parents, and their parents got it from their parents... you get the idea, huh? So yeah, this ranch has been my ol' property for a very long time. Some important hunks from the city tried to buy this harvest land, but they couldn't fool the Ol' Sharpeye! They laughed at me when I told them about strange things that happened here...\n\nCUTE ANIMALS\n\nYou won't probably believe me, but I've seen some suspicious pig games... Tourists think that those are just cute farm animals - but they aren't, trust me. I believe that it's the pig who's plotting against me. I wish you'd seen his tricky face - his games start soon, I feel that. If you're not a chicken, come and help me someday - we'll stop it. \n\nSSH, KEEP THE NOISE DOWN\n\nHey, you! Yes, you! Don't listen to that old killjoy Fred. He knows nothing about us... Yeah, raise your jaw, I can speak. So, he told you about our animal jam here, right? NO? Oh, thats how things go here, kid. Just like that traffic jam you had on the way here, its not very fun when you have too many roommates in a cell thats called the farm.  You wont leave poor animals in need, right? Good.\n\nDont worry, well do it just smoothly & easily: I have a plan for that. Youll manage this great escape. No, put the smartphone aside  there's no need to make unnecessary calls.  So heres whats waiting for you in FARM JAM.\n\nSHOW TIME\n\nYou should send all animals to the right escape zone in the right sequence. Your main objective is to unblock and release all the animals from the farms paddock. Keep in mind that animals can move both backward and forward. FARM JAM will bring some intricate moments: all animals have different sizes. This prevents all the easy escape routes, so think carefully and dont get caught by Fred. And remember, when the night is coming down, you should act faster. You need to free all the animals before the dark. Watch out for the obstacles. Electric fences, carts, hungry wolf, and old Fred are on the way to animal freedom. Think twice before the move.\n\nAREAS\n\nThe countryside is hiding loads of stories. It is hard to believe, but old Fred had quite a stormy youth. You will find little reminders everywhere. Ready to discover them? Perfect! Open AREAS! Build up all corners of the farm and unveil the secrets. Complete the levels, earn stars, and create the best farm ever. Fred, his beloved Rose, and his faithful dog Bruno will lead you through the countryside journey. At the end of each area, there is an excellent surprise for you. Exciting, right?\n\nBOOSTERS\n\nHINT creates a couple in the stall when you get stuck. \nSHUFFLE mixes all animals and creates new moves.\nCELL adds extra space in the stall.\nREVIVE gives you another try on the level.\nLAMP lights up the field on the levels with a timer.\nTICKER adds more time to the levels with a timer.\n\nFULL FARM FUN PACK\n\n1. Soothing countryside visuals: fields, farms, meadows, forests, and ranches await you.\n2. Join the gang: humorous personalities in this casual game wont just let you go  follow the rules, human, or else.\n3. Form the queue: you should release those animals in a certain order. Otherwise, theyll get stuck and fail the whole escape.\n4. Love is in the air on the farm. Match animals of the same color to make a pair.\n5. A game of challenge: try to slip past the farmer's watchful eye and avoid all the obstacles on the farmyard.\n6. Play it with the sound ON for a fun entertainment experience.\n\nReady to make the escape of the century? Lets do that with FARM JAM.\n\nPrivacy Policy https://docs.appsyoulove.com/policies/privacy-policy\nTerms of Use https://docs.appsyoulove.com/policies/terms-of-use",
