    long_description:
      "Love supermarket shopping and fridge organization? Get ready for an enhanced experience with Match Triple Goods, a match-3 game like no other! Categorize snacks, drinks, and fruits, and dive into 3D match-3 closet organization fun. Drag identical 3D items to match shelves.\nThe gameplay is easy to grasp: drag identical 3D items and match them on their respective shelves.\n\nGame Highlights\n- 1000+ Abundant Levels: A challenge at every turn.\n- Ultra-realistic 3D Items:.From fries and beverages to candies, coconut cookies, soda cookies, and more, explore various items.\n- Easy Controls: Learn in 3 seconds flat.\n- Exquisite Models: Detailed shelf designs for a refined experience.\n\nHow to Play\n- Move the same items to the same shelf.\n- Match 3 identical items to eliminate them.\n- Clear all the shelves to complete the level.\n- Unlock more of your favorite items by completing more game levels.\n- Plenty of item models to keep you entertained during your leisure time.\n- Use power-ups to help you progress through the levels.\n\nIf you're a match-3 or sorting games enthusiast, don't miss out on Match Triple Goods! Ready to dive in? Download now",
