    long_description:
      'Nonogram is a game to solve logic number puzzles by filling or left blank cells according to numbers at the side of the grid to reveal the hidden pixel picture, as known as Hanjie, Picross, Griddlers, Japanese Crosswords, Paint by Numbers, Pic-a-Pix. A pleasant game to train and exercise your brain, also keep your mind active with the basic rules and logic behind the picture cross puzzle.Nonogram is a picture cross sudoku puzzle, you just need to follow the basic rules and logic to reveal the hidden picture. Squares on the board must be filled by number or left blank. Numbers show how many squares to fill. The numbers above the column are read from top-to-bottom. Numbers to the left of the rows are read from left-to-right. According to the numbers, color a square or mark it with an X.\n\n\n\nYou can get a piece of Jigsaw shard in each passed puzzle. You can discover a world of over 3,000 amazing beautiful images with different themes. This is the first nonogram game where you can solve the puzzle and play jigsaw at the same time!\n\n\n\nIn the game, there is not only Nonogram to play, but also unique jigsaw puzzles for players to play! Players will get a piece of puzzle pieces every time they pass the Nonogram game, which can be used to complete a large exquisite picture! A total of ten beautiful big pictures are waiting for you to explore and collect! (P.S: The probability of falling puzzle pieces is different in different chapters. If you do not get the puzzle pieces after winning a certain level, it is normal.)\n\n●Massive Themed puzzle packs in the game\n●Relax in a special jigsaw puzzles by filling jigsaw pieces to gain beautiful photos\n●There are intuitive and effective novice tutorials in the game, easy to learn and quite addictive once you start playing\n●Choose the difficulty level from Very Easy, Easy, Medium, Hard or Very hard that best for you and become the expert!\n●There are many auxiliary functions in the game, such as return to the previous step, get hints, and reset the game\n●Autosave every puzzle, if you stuck you can try another puzzle and come back later\n●Challenge different brand-new missions every week and get generous rewards for game items\n●Special nonogram pro section will offer puzzles with large size 20x20, 25x25, 30x30, 35x35 to bring unique experience.\n\nTake the challenge and enjoy the endless fun of puzzles!\n\nAbout the auto-renewable subscription of Nonogram Puzzles:\nVIP Bonus Subscription for 2.99 USD that offers a weekly subscription for getting Multiple Rewards of coins and diamonds, and removing ADS.\n\nSubscription renewal:\n\n- Payment will be charged to iTunes Account at confirmation of purchase;\n- Subscription automatically renews with the price and duration period as the original “1 week” package unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24-hours before the end of the current period;\n- The account will be charged for renewal within 24-hours prior to the end of the current period at the cost of the chosen package (weekly, monthly or yearly package);\n- Subscriptions may be managed by the user and auto-renewal may be turned off by going to the user’s iTunes Account Settings after purchase;\n- No cancellation of the current subscription is allowed during the active subscription period;\n\nPlease visit http://support.apple.com/kb/ht4098 for more information.\n\nCanceling subscription:\n- You may turn off the auto-renewal of your subscription via your iTunes Account Settings. However, you are not able to cancel the current subscription during its active period;\n\nLinks to our Terms of Service and Privacy Policy can be found below:\nPrivacy Policy: http://www.yunbu.me/ios/privacy_policy.html\nTerms of Use: http://www.yunbu.me/ios/Terms_of_sevrice.html\n\nIf you have any questions, feel free to contact us at\nyunbudraw@gmail.com\n\n* Prices are equal to the value that «Apple’s App Store Pricing Matrix» determines as the equivalent of the subscription price in $ USD',
