    two_star_ratings: 24,
    three_star_ratings: 77,
    four_star_ratings: 378,
    five_star_ratings: 5863,
    long_description:
      'Sort colorful balls and train your brain with this addictive Ball Sort Puzzle game! The original special ball sorting gameplay is more challenging and will definitely make your eyes shine!\n\nAre you a puzzle lover? Then you must not miss this ball sort puzzle game! It’s a simple yet fun puzzle game that challenges your brain and patience while relaxing!\n\nIn this ball sorting puzzle game, all you have to do is sort the colored balls in the tube until all balls of the same color are in the same tube. Sounds easy, right? But don\'t be fooled by the simple gameplay. You can only move a ball onto another ball of the same color or into an empty tube. As you progress through the levels, you will face more and more difficulties and obstacles. You will need to think strategically and plan your moves ahead to avoid getting stuck. But don’t worry, you can always restart the level at any time if you make a mistake or want to try a different strategy.\n\t\nUnlike other Ball Sort puzzle games where each bottle has the same number of balls, in the levels of our color sorting game, each bottle may have a different number of balls from 1 to 7. Likewise, the maximum number of balls a bottle can hold varies from 1 to 7. This unique and original feature sets this Ball Sort Puzzle apart from other color sorting games: more challenging, varied, and thrilling! You will have to think harder and smarter to sort the balls in the right order.\n\n* KEY FEATURES\n\n- Original and unique ball sort puzzles\n- Just one finger to control, tap to sort\n- Simple but addictive ball sort game\n- Rich gameplay and full of challenges\n- 8 ball mode, more balls and more fun\n- Mystery level with question mark ball \n- Absolutely FREE to play this color sorting game\n- Unlimited levels, varying difficulty & infinite joy\n- Various balls, colorful backgrounds, and cute bottles to unlock\n- No time limit, no penalty, so no pressure\n- Play offline, enjoy this Ball Sort game without the internet\n- Family game, suitable for all ages\n- Train your brain in relaxing ball sort games\n\n* HOW TO PLAY\n\n1. Tap a bottle to pick up the top ball, then tap another bottle to drop it there.\n2. You can stack one ball on top of another only if both balls are of the same color.\n3. You can only move a ball onto another ball of the same color or into an empty tube.\n4. The target tube should have room for at least one ball.\n5. In special levels, the number of balls that each bottle can hold differs.\n6. Try not to get stuck - but don\'t worry, you can always restart the level.\n7. Use "Undo" and "Add an extra tube" to help you solve Ball Sort puzzles.\n\nBall Sort Master is a relaxing game that you can play anytime, anywhere. You can enjoy thousands of unique and colorful levels of varying difficulties, from easy to hard. You can unlock new backgrounds and balls to customize your puzzle experience, from cute animals to cool patterns. Its smooth and satisfying gameplay also makes ball sorting a lot more enjoyable. This ball puzzle game is a great way to exercise your brain and train your logical thinking while having fun! You will never get bored with this ball sort game, as there are always new and exciting challenges waiting for you.\n\nIf you like color sorting games, you will love this Ball Sort Puzzle! It’s a game that will stimulate your brain and make you think creatively. It’s a game that will challenge you and reward you with a sense of accomplishment. \n\nDOWNLOAD it now for free and start sorting the balls!\n\nTerms of Service: https://ballsort2.gurugame.ai/termsofservice.html\nPrivacy Policy: https://ballsort2.gurugame.ai/policy.html',
