    long_description:
      "50 million downloads worldwide! Magic Jigsaw Puzzles is the largest jigsaw puzzle game and community online, with over 30,000 HD pictures to enjoy and solve, new free daily jigsaws, and exclusive collections from our collaborators DISNEY, PIXAR, NICKELODEON! Discover why our users solve 50 million jigsaw puzzles every month!\n\nAnd there are more features to discover! You can easily create a unique personalized puzzle using your own photo or image! Plus you can choose the melody you like best from the in-game musi? collection to accompany your relaxing, stress-relieving puzzle sessions!\n\nFEATURES you're bound to LOVE in Magic Jigsaw Puzzle:\n\n- Free puzzle gallery updated daily!\n- More than 30,000 beautiful high-definition puzzles!\n- New puzzle packs with unique works by painters!\n- Create a puzzle with your own picture and share it with friends or with the Magic Jigsaw Puzzles community!\n- 6 difficulty levels with up to 1200 pieces: start as a beginner and become a master!\n- Work on more than one puzzle at a time and see your progress!\n- Preview the finished puzzle to help you solve it!\n- Rotation mode for real puzzle pros! Move pieces in groups!\n- Take part in weekly tournaments and games! Compete with your friends!\n- Great music collection: choose the right musical accompaniment to suit your mood!\n- Simple controls make it easy to solve puzzles!\n\nYou can create your own Magic Puzzles profile and find all puzzle packs you have downloaded in one place, as well as easily restoring packs you may have accidentally deleted.\n\nShare your own best puzzles with friends or with the Magic Jigsaw Puzzles community on Facebook https://www.facebook.com/MagicJigsawPuzzles/\n\nSubscription:\n- When you subscribe, you will immediately receive free access to the full collection of puzzle packs in the Puzzle Shop! All new packs released in the future will also be available to you for free during your subscription period. Exceptions are the puzzle packs which we publish under license from our partners. These packs are located in the Puzzle Shop in special categories.\n- A subscription also allows you to create and solve an unlimited number of your own user-created puzzles, gives you unlimited energy to solve all user-created puzzles from people around the world, and turns off ads in the game.\n- You can choose a subscription plan by price and duration. The prices are $7.99 per week, $19.99 per month or $99.99 per year or equal to the same price tier that Apple's App Store Price Matrix determines in other currencies.\n- Subscription automatically renews unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24-hours before the end of the current subscription period.\nYou can cancel a subscription anytime via the subscription settings in your iTunes account. This must be done 24 hours before the end of the subscription period to avoid being charged again.\n- If you cancel your subscription, you lose all the benefits described above, and all downloaded paid packs will be temporarily blocked. You will be able to unlock them at any moment by renewing your subscription or purchasing them as separate puzzle packs.\n- Any unused portion of a free trial period, if offered, will be forfeited when the user purchases a subscription to the publication, where applicable.\n- Payment is charged to your iTunes account upon confirmation of purchase. Your subscription automatically renews for the same price and duration period as the original package unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24 hours prior to the end of the current period. Your account will be relevantly charged for renewal within 24 hours prior to the end of the current period.\n\n\nTerms of Use: https://puzzlestore.ximad.com/static/docs/terms-en.html\nPrivacy Policy: https://zimad.com/policy/",
