    long_description:
      'Welcome to the Puzzle Competition World! Justine needs your help! Take part in the championship and prove your puzzle-solving skills. Enjoy your favorite hobby and take part in the Jigsaw Puzzle Villa competition with Justine.\n\n\nYour aim is to renovate the Villa: earn coins by solving jigsaw puzzles — you’ll need them to buy modern things for the house. It’s time to turn an abandoned mansion into a stunning villa!\n\nHOW TO PLAY:\n- Put puzzles together within colorful HD pictures\n- Get energy and coins, and use them to decorate the Mansion\n- Use boosters and hints to solve puzzles — design the House as soon as possible!\n- Renovate the first room and go to the next one, which will be even more enjoyable. There are so many rooms in this old house!  \n- Follow the captivating plot of Justine’s puzzle competition story\n- You have a fantastic opportunity to renovate and decorate an old Spanish Villa the way you want!  \n- But remember, solving puzzles is an important mission. You can choose the difficulty level and the number of puzzle pieces. Do puzzles to unlock more furniture for the Mansion!\n\nFEATURES:\n- Compelling puzzles solving competitions\n- A combination of free puzzles and home design gameplay makes the game truly exciting\n- More than 1,000 colorful HD pictures\n- An opportunity to choose puzzle difficulty (more pieces — more coins!)\n- Hints to help with jigsaws\n- Great selection of various furniture pieces and house decorations\n- A huge number of rooms awaiting renovation\n- The inspiring story of Justine and her friends\n- Captivating dialogues\n- Excellent graphics and sound\n- Free game with in-app purchases — make faster progress through the story!\n- Regular updates with new levels and furniture pieces\n\nDo you like puzzles and interior design games? Download Jigsaw Puzzle Villa!  \nSolve more jigsaw puzzles and help Justine win the World Puzzle Championship!\n\nTerms of Use: https://zimad.com/terms-of-use-puzzle-villa',
