    long_description:
      "Embark on a captivating word adventure with Hidden Words! Challenge your word solving skills and expand your vocabulary in this addictive and brain teasing word game. Unravel the mystery word by guessing the correct letters within a limited number of attempts. Sharpen your linguistic power, exercise your brain, and have a blast as you explore the world of Hidden Words\nHidden Words is a new twist on the famous 5-letter word guess game that has been viral all around the world. Whether you are a fan of classic crossword puzzles or not, you will find yourself satisfied and fulfilled. It's perfect for those lazy days when you want to relax on your couch and play a quick free game.\nGuess a word and use the tile colors to help guide your next decision. Each time you get a letter correct, the tile will turn yellow if it is in the word or green if it is in the right spot. You get 6 tries to guess the correct word.\nYou can make your own puzzles to challenge your family & friends too with the games advanced level editor and share features. You can either send a challenge link through your favorite social media/chat app or you can just give your phone to them to solve the word puzzle that you made. Watching your best friend struggling to solve your puzzle will make your day!\n\n Features \n\n\n- Fun for all ages: The best game for family & friends gatherings!\n- Thousands of trendy words\n\n- Great exercise for the brain\n- Gorgeous color themes! Play with more comfort, even in the dark theme!\n- Enhanced statics to follow up on your progress\n- Improve your vocabulary\n- Download this funny game for free\n- Share your result with your friends\n- Fantastic visuals and smooth animations\n- Leaderboard to compete with others\n- Boosters to make puzzles easier\n- The ability to challenge your friends with specific words\n\nIf you enjoy the classic hangman game or Wordle, Hidden Words is also suitable for you. Practice your language skills and vocabulary by learning new words. Whether you'd like to relax or keep your mind active, you can pleasantly pass the time with a free word game!\nKeep track of your stats and compete with your friends!\n\nFrom the creators of Brain Test Tricky Puzzles, Word City, Who Is? Tricky Riddles! and WordFest with Friends.\nAre you up for the challenge? Dive into the captivating world of Hidden Words now and discover just how clever you are with words!\nDownload Hidden Words: Puzzle Wonders today and start your journey toward becoming a true word master.\n\nHave fun!",
