    long_description:
      'Gorgeous art, beautiful animation, a magical atmosphere — this is Art of Puzzles! Immerse yourself in a fantasy universe filled with bright colors, unique characters, and breathtaking scenery! A unique game that combines a jigsaw puzzle and a coloring book: collect the pieces of stunning pictures, where each fragment becomes part of a fairy tale story. \n\nAllow yourself to relax with this game: its exciting gameplay will distract you from the mundane and simultaneously stimulate your imagination, observation, and wit. Enjoy exciting storylines and relaxing music in Art of Puzzles, where every picture puzzle is a work of art. Immerse yourself in amazing fantasy worlds that come to life in your hands and unlock new levels — hundreds of animated images with charming characters await you!  \n\n- Connect the picture pieces, putting each fragment in the right place, and the picture will come to life. \n- With each new level comes a new unique art puzzle — unlock them all!\n- Enjoy addictive and relaxing gameplay with atmospheric music and colorful animation.\n- Train your observation and imagination without fuss and stress — Art of Puzzles is designed for your enjoyment!\n- A short tutorial for beginners will help you get started with this art game.\n- A unique combination of styles: Art of Puzzles has incorporated the best of puzzles and coloring games! \n- The magic of other worlds is waiting for you — bring it to life with your touch!\n\nAllow yourself to relax after a day of work, let your imagination fly, and soothe your soul by playing Art of Puzzles, where each picture is a unique work of art!',
