    long_description:
      'Beth graduated from a prestigious university, but working as a waitress. . . She is good friends with the boy she has a crush on, but she cannot be a lover. . .\n\nBeth are in desperate need of a makeover! She need some change for a new job, and become more confident or try something new. Whatever it is, help her turning her lives around! Choose from fashionable clothes, gorgeous hairstyles, eye-catching makeup! MAKEOVER helpless Beth and give her the confidence to follow their dreams!\n\nSOLVE addictive puzzles with challenging obstacles! Matching puzzles! Solve match-3 puzzles to a makeover fashion style in this fun match-3 adventure! interact with in-game characters & reveal the dramatic romance stories.\n\n\nMakeover to help Beth reach her goals and follow her dreams!\n\nHelp Beth to Makeover now! Are you ready to navigate this challenging match-3 puzzle? We sincerely hope that you like our new match-3 puzzle game! CHOOSE from a variety of fashionable clothes and outfits to create a new look!',
