    long_description:
      'Welcome to 2248: Number Puzzle 2048, a captivating number merge puzzle game that challenges your reflexes and encourages thoughtful number matches. Dive into this addictive numbers puzzle where connecting dots and pops creates an immersive experience. Begin with a base number and merge identical numbers vertically and horizontally to score points in this free and offline number match game.\n\n2248 is an addictive casual core number puzzle and number blast game about connecting the numbers, dots and pops. Connect the same numbers in dots vertically and horizontally to win points in this fun free number blast and numbers game. Begin from a base number. Merge it with the same numbers or twice that number. Create the longest possible links. Reach the highest tiles and achieve the highest score!  Combine the same numbers strategically to create higher and higher numbers, such as 1024, 2048, 4096, and even millions. Once you start, you will be addicted!\n\nThe 2248 game is easy to learn and play. In every move, you must think ahead! This number puzzle game improves your memory, concentration level and reflexes. Once you start playing it, you will absolutely get addicted to this puzzle game. Play without internet - our free game lets you explore new worlds offline. Game from the Creators of 2048 Blast: Merge Numbers 2248 and X2: Number Merge 2048 Puzzle games.\n\nHOW TO PLAY 2248: Number Puzzle 2048\n● Combine the same or consecutive numbers by swiping them in any direction like 1024, 2048 or 4096 (up, down, left, right or diagonally).\n● Get higher numbers when you merge multiple same numbers.\n● Keep combining the numbers to get the highest possible number such as 1024, 2048, and beyond.\n\nWith minimalistic and elegantly designed graphics, this 2248: Number Puzzle 2048 number merge game is a brain teaser and brain game for adults that improves your memory, concentration level, and reflexes. Sharpen your mind as you compete globally on leaderboards and share your scores with friends on social media.\n\nFEATURES of 2248: Number Puzzle 2048\n● Easy to play, hard to master.\n● Minimalistic & Elegantly designed number merge game\n● Special graphic design in this number game.\n● Share your scores and dare your friends.\n● Sharpen your minds\n● Leaderboards that allow you to compete globally.\n● Brain teasers games and brain games for adults.\n● Slide the number up, down, left, right, diagonal in any direction.\n● Search and connect the same numbers on the board.\n● The game ends when there is no connectable number.\n● Adorable fun, and thoughtful game design in this beautiful game about connecting number dots.\n● New games and free games are fun if they helps to improve brain and mind.\n● Free to play for life.\n● Play offline, without Internet.\n● Connect pops and crush in this number game.\n● Smooth & simple controls.\n● Automatic save game\n\nThis free, offline game stimulates your brain and enhances cognitive abilities. Challenge yourself by connecting number blocks and enjoy the delightful gameplay. Download 2248: Number Puzzle 2048 now and succumb to the addictive thrill of this numbers puzzle!\n\nFollow us on Facebook, Twitter, Instagram, and YouTube for updates and more fun games. Download 2248: Number Puzzle 2048 now and get addicted to this puzzle game!',
