    long_description:
      "An addictive puzzle amusement that awakens the brain!\n\nBlock king is a sorting game where you have to manipulate simple shaped figures to win. Complete the mission with no time limit for all types of players! Try Brain puzzle with classic gameplay so it will help you relax in your free time. \n\nBlock puzzle king has several modes\n\nSort mode: sort falling colored blocks in tubes the way all the same colored blocks will stay in the same tube;\nShapes mode: Drag and drop color blocks on the board to solve the puzzle.\n\nFeatures\n- Addictive gameplay with relaxing vibes and no time limit!\n- Various shapes and colors of blocks\n- Cool wood-style design\n- Addictive puzzle levels\n- Gameplay contained of classic drag blocks.\n\nA person's brain needs training as much as their muscles! By solving various logical problems, different puzzle games like Block puzzle king, Cube puzzle and Woody Block stimulate the development of mental abilities and increase the level of IQ. \nThis game is a classic app full of beautiful levels where you want to stay. We created numerous playing types to create a stylish brain puzzle for you to solve. Become a puzzle king in classical gameplay! \n\nDownload a free brain puzzle game and relax all the time.",
