    long_description:
      "Welcome to Merge Mayor match puzzles and town building, the relaxing yet challenging puzzle game where you are the new Mayor of a small town. With the help of your assistant Olivia, you'll solve match puzzles and build, organize, restore, and upgrade your city into a thriving metropolis. Featuring fresh 3D graphics, new items regularly, and satisfying match and craft gameplay, you'll enjoy discovering secret ways to upgrade the town and watch it evolve.\n\n\n- Build, Upgrade, and Organize your own city as the new Mayor in this fun and challenging game!\n\n- Solve Merge 2 puzzles to earn rewards and help grow your town.\n\n- Repair and Renovate homes, discover hidden stories, and unlock new areas.\n\n- Enjoy fresh 3D graphics, fun crafting and power-ups, and ever-expanding content.\n\n- Multiple game modes for casual and challenging gameplay.\n\n- Relax and Challenge your brain with Merge Mayor, the ultimate Merge town building game!\n\n- Featuring Merge, Match, Craft, and Puzzle gameplay, with new items and storylines added regularly.\n\n- Increase your Mayor Points by combining everyday items and unlocking big upgrades.\n\n- Explore hidden worlds and discover Exclusive Rewards, seasonal items, and limited-time events.\n\n- Easy to learn but challenging to master, Merge Mayor is the perfect game for idle time, casual fun, and fans of merge, puzzle, and matching games. \n\n- Get to know the townspeople, uncover their secrets and build relationships as you progress through the game.\n\n- Join limited-time Events and unlock new game modes and mini games as you play.\n\n- With new content and challenges added regularly, there's always something new and exciting to discover in Merge Mayor.\n\n\nTry it today and see your small village evolve into a city…and beyond!\"\n\nQUESTIONS?\nWe love our fan community! Want to shoot us a message? Our door is open at support@starberry.games or join our lovely and helpful Discord channel at\nhttps://discord.gg/8sQjtqX\n \nPrivacy Policy:\nhttps://www.starberry.games/privacy-policy\n \nTerms of Service:\nhttps://www.starberry.games/terms-of-service",
