    long_description:
      'Welcome to Love Water, the most fun and relaxing color sort puzzle game!\nTry to solve colorful levels by matching the same color water in the glasses until all colors will be in their own glass. Exercise your brain, challenge yourself and relax!\n\nFEATURES\n* Thousands of addictive and unique levels\n* Offline mode\n* One finger control\n* No penalties, subscriptions, and time limits\n* Lifetime free\n\nLove Water is free to play game. Play thousands of colorful levels and relax.',
