    long_description:
      "Come play this Mine Rescue! \nA free to play and fun mining puzzle simulator game. \n \nYour miner is trapped! Help him find the way out by guiding him to the exit. Dig corridors, \nmove obstacles, find new adventures and make a path for the miner to get out of the cave. \nHelp him dig for gold. \n\nIntuitive gameplay and full of action!\nUse your fingers to move obstacles, avoid and escape the traps and play with your \nenvironment to create a path for your miner.\n\nIncredible rewards\nThrough your way to the exit you will collect incredible rewards and gold helping your \nprogression.\n\nHundreds of Levels\nWith more that 400 levels, you'll never get bored with the countless hours of gameplay \navailable\n\nPlay Anywhere, anytime\nYou have hours to kill or you're just commuting, Mine rescue can offer you a 5 minutes break \nas well as hours of fun gameplay\n\nChallenge your brain\nEasy to play, hard to master, Mine rescue will challenge your logical skills.\n\nCustomize your own cave\nCollect furniture to transform your cold cave into a cozy home\n\nFind inventive way to save the miner, Play Mine Rescue Now !",
