    long_description:
      'Welcome to a unique puzzle experience !\n\nThe immersive 3D knot-solving game will challenge your mind and captivate your senses. Unveil the secrets of decoding near-impossible knots by mastering the finesse of pin manipulation. \n\nDive into the enigmatic universe of Twisted Tangle, where fresh puzzles await your strategic brilliance every week. The courageous ones are summoned to confront the Boss Levels  , leaving the Hard  and Epic  stages for the chosen few. Do you have what it takes to embrace the challenge and join the ranks of the puzzle-solving masters? \n\n• Your journey through Twisted Tangle is an art form in itself!\n• Embrace the diversity that each level brings\n• Fixed pins demanding surgical precision\n• Octopus pins, each armed with a unique twist\n• And the complex dance of keys and locks\n\nDownload the game and prove you have what it takes to conquer the unconquerable knots, one puzzle at a time. Embark on the journey of a lifetime!',
