    five_star_ratings: 16177,
    long_description:
      "Let's play Toy Triple - a new match puzzle game and enjoy awesome levels and fun challenges that will keep you entertained for hours!\n\nLet your brain active by playing fun matching games and solving puzzles. Improve your sorting skills to become a matching master!\nSpend a relaxing, fun time as you find and match the same objects and complete different missions.\n\nLooking for a fun way to spend your free time? How about playing a cool match game? Improve your brain by playing everywhere and as much as you want offline. Download this amazing puzzle game now and start searching for hidden objects today!\n\nHow To Play:\n* Tap on three identical toys and match them into triples\n* Keep sorting and matching objects until you clear all objects from the screen\n* Complete the goal set at the start of the level and become a master of 3d puzzles games!\n* NOTE! Each level has a timer, so you must move fast & reach the level goal!\n* Use boosters to help you sort through the objects and pass tricky levels\n* Use Shuffle to rearrange the items on the board and\n\nTap to play and discover an addictive puzzle matching game!\nEnjoy unique gameplay that will keep you busy for hours! Put your logic and strategy skills to the test in this amazing Toy Triple game.\n\nFun Features:\n* Amazing boosters to help you along the way\n* Beautifully designed match 3d levels\n* Fun brain training missions\n* Easy and relaxing tile matching game\n* Able to play online or offline, no Wi-Fi or internet connection is required\n\nPlay now and join the fun!",
