    four_star_ratings: 1,
    five_star_ratings: 6,
    long_description:
      'The unique variation of the traditional puzzle-block game called Sea Block 1010 will help you immerse in the relaxing sea floor with the beautiful scene. This amazing variant, which combines colorful fossil blocks with a ocean-themed design, will undoubtedly offer a novel gameplay experience.\n\nThe traditional mechanics of well-known wood block puzzle games are preserved in Sea Block 1010 as well. Similar to playing a different block puzzle game, placing the block with the full line vertically or horizontally will make the block disappear and give you experience score. If your board is filled and you are unable to fill any more blocks, you will lose and cannot go on to the next level. As you go through the stages, collect gems to enable you to buy valuable boosters. In the challenging stage, you may also employ boosters for specialized support.\n\nHow to play Sea Block 1010:\n- Use sea block puzzle blocks to build the line.\n- To advance levels, remove every brick from the grid.\n- Flexibility in how you use the booster to aid you in the challenging mode.\n- Take your time putting the sea block puzzle together.\n\nFeatures of the Sea Block 1010:\n- Various difficulties from Beginner to Master as your score advances.\n- Not your usual block puzzle, but the one that captures your attention.\n- Earn diamonds so you can purchase the booster.\n- A straightforward game that combines relaxing and difficult elements.\n\nTerm of Service: https://puzzle.sg/terms-and-conditions/\nPrivacy Policy: https://puzzle.sg/privacy-policy/',
