    five_star_ratings: 0,
    long_description:
      'Get ready for a new, challenging and original matching pairs brain game.\n\nSliding Match Puzzle Game is a pair matching puzzle game.\nSlide lines left or right, up or down to connect the tiles. Match and remove all the tiles to complete the level.\n\nMatch identical items, sort tiles, and clear the board in this mesmerizing match 2 game. Challenge your puzzle-solving skills as you keep sorting and matching objects until every item is cleared from the screen. It’s not just a puzzle it’s a test of your wit and strategy.\n\n-Features-\n\nShiny visual effects and objects:\nEvery level of Sliding & Match will give you an enjoyable fun experience of matching tile objects on the screen, every move you make will give you a satisfying 3D effect that will elevate your puzzle game experience. Sorting and matching tiles is really relaxing and will definitely have a calming zen effect!\n\nWell-designed brain trainer levels:\nOur puzzle game will make it easier for you to memorize objects and small details by playing our brain trainer levels, you will start to notice your that memorizing abilities getting better with time. Search and connect tiles to beat the level! Master your mind and memory skill with Slidey Match.\n\nPause it whenever you want:\nBecause we know that you are a busy person, and we value your time, we implemented the pause feature where you are able to pause whenever you want, so you can get back to Slidey Match objects anytime you want. \n\nCute animals, sweet yummy food, cool toys, exciting emojis, and much more stuff to puzzle out.\n\nDownload and enjoy the never-ending fun of our free Sliding Match Puzzle Game! Tile match, stands tall among puzzle games as your next brain tester!',
