    long_description:
      'BLOCK GEMS, a new luxury relaxing block puzzle game, is created JUST FOR YOU!\n\nThe game has 2 things you love most: block puzzle and jewel. Match blocks to form lines and trigger beautiful gem power. You will play block puzzles like never before with awesome combos and impressive gem effects. Relax during the long day with this brain health, soothing puzzle game.\n \nFEATURES:\n \n• Wood blocks match with shiny gems\n• Combo, combo, more combos\n• Long progression for you to explore multiple kinds of gems\n• Gem powers will clear rows and blocks for you to place more pieces\n• Aesthetically built with a rustic yet luxury appeal\n• Beautifully easy and simple, no pressure and no time limit\n• Surprisingly challenging to break your own score record\n• Challenge your friends and other players on the Game Center leaderboard\n• 15 achievements to unlock\n\nMade with love in Vietnam. We hope you will enjoy Block Gems as much as we do.\n\nThank you for playing!\n\n-----\nTerms of Use: https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/',
