    five_star_ratings: 0,
    long_description:
      "Card Match is a challenging and original matching game! Don't get scared away. It's very easy to learn how to play for everyone!\n\nSo get ready for a new, original and challenging Card-match game is a combination of the world's most popular games - TriPeaks Solitaire and Mahjong! \nFans and card game fans will love the games also known as Tri Towers, Triple Peaks, Solitaire Tri Peaks, Solitaire Blitz,Castle Solitaire-tripeaks, Solitaire Cube, Farm Adventure, Solitaire Cruise, Tiki Solitaire, harvest Solitaire or Three Peaks.Can you complete all 1000+ levels? Install Now!\n\n\nFind the matching cards on the gameboard and connect the pair. Collect and remove all cards to complete the level. Use boosters and become a matching expert level by level. Plus, it's totally free to play!\n\nFeatures:\n\n- More than 500 challenging and fun levels to play game.\n- Boosters and obstacles give lot of fun while sorting and matching hidden objects!\n- No timer, no pressure\n- Mahjong combi points\n- You are able to pause whenever you want\n- Classic matching puzzle is really relaxing and will certainly have a calming zen effect!\n- Train your brain: concentration, observation and logic. Search and connect card to beat the level!\n- Solve puzzles on every level. Claim your rewards in Daily Bonuses\n- Turn sounds on or off\n- Simple pick-up-and-play controls\n\nChallenging levels:\nLevels get more and more challenging as your Сard Match trip continues. Want to train your brain and improve your memorizing ability? In Сard Match, you will get your brain trained during beating levels! In the matching puzzle game, you need not only good eyesight but excellent memory. Dare to challenge?\n\nPause anytime:\nGet interrupted during matching? No worries! Сard Match has a pause button for you when you need to shift your attention. But don't forget to come back to the unfinished tidying-up to complete the level!\n\n\nCard Match - Mahjong Solitaire - collected the best games you love! Three peaks solitaire, mahjong, matching games, puzzles.\n\nIf you are a fan of matching puzzle games, Сard Match will improve your concentration, train your brain and vision, and relax your mind.\nCome and download Сard Match now! Let's match and pair together!",
