    long_description:
      "Can you solve the ultimate puzzle? Prove it in Card Shuffle Sort – the most addictive game of the year!\n\nCard Shuffle Sort is a smart, color sorting game that will challenge your organization skills and puzzle-solving abilities. In this calming game, your objective is to rearrange the cards on the board to sort them into colored order. But don't be fooled by the simple premise – each level becomes increasingly difficult as you progress, requiring careful planning and strategic thinking to solve. With its intuitive gameplay and beautiful color palette, Card Shuffle Sort is perfect for anyone who enjoys matching games, sorting games, or puzzle games for adults.\n\nThe game features an array of color puzzle levels, gradient sort puzzles, that will test your color-matching abilities. Card Shuffle Sort is one of the best matching games for adults that will keep your mind sharp and your mood relaxed. So if you're looking for a calming game that will challenge your brain and help you unwind, download Card Shuffle Sort today and start sorting!\n\nWith an endless gameplay to master, Card Shuffle Sort offers endless entertainment and brain exercise. And with power-ups and special abilities at your disposal, you'll have all the tools you need to overcome even the toughest challenges. Whether you're a seasoned puzzle game veteran or just starting out, there's something for everyone in Card Shuffle Sort. So download the game today and see if you have what it takes to become a master of logic and strategy!\n\nFEATURES:\n\n- Multiple levels of color-sorting puzzles that increase in difficulty as you progress.\n- Intuitive gameplay that's easy to learn but challenging to master.\n- Beautiful color palette and card designs that make the game visually appealing and engaging.\n- Power-ups that help you progress through difficult levels, including hints, shuffles, and extra moves.\n- Daily challenges and rewards that keep you coming back for more.\n\nWhether you're a fan of sorting games, matching games, or card games, Card Shuffle Sort has something for everyone. So download the game today and put your puzzle-solving skills to the test!",
