      "when you want to pass the time and challenge your brain. This fun game's objective is simple yet engaging.\n\nEpic Blast 3D is a free match-2 game with unique elements and exciting gameplay. With special blocks, boosters, and power-up items, the possibilities are endless. Start playing Epic Blast 3D today to match and collapse colorful blocks, toys, fire crazy rockets, and blast explosive bombs.\n\nMatch and tap colorful block pieces to save cute friends and clear blockers!\n\nDownload now to experience new levels and challenges!",
