    five_star_ratings: 0,
    long_description:
      "Introducing Tile Dreams, the ultimate mahjong triple match puzzle game! Immerse yourself in hours of fun and challenging gameplay as you match tiles to progress through the brainteaser levels. Solve the puzzle and become the ultimate tile master. With its easy-to-learn mechanics and addictive gameplay, Tile Dreams is the perfect game for triple match puzzle enthusiasts of all ages.\n\nPlay Tile Dreams' relaxing puzzle games. As you play the matching games, you'll be tasked with matching three or more tiles of the same color to clear them from the mahjong inspired board. But be careful! The match game levels get progressively harder as you advance, and you'll need to think strategically to overcome obstacles, solve the puzzle, and be the tile master.\n\n- SOLVE THE PUZZLE TO TRAIN YOUR BRAIN - Challenge your brain through thousands of mahjong puzzles. Puzzles start with low difficulty and become challenging fast!\n- Create a Calm Experience - Solve addictive yet always evolving tile matching mahjong puzzles in a unique and calm experience.\n- Relax and Have Fun - Take your time to solve the puzzles and clear the board. They are simply for your entertainment and will relax your brain.\n- Explore - Discover unique and relaxing sceneries that are displayed in the background while you match tiles.\n\nOur new generation mahjong game will have you addicted to solving tile matching puzzles, reaching new levels and becoming the master. There's never a dull moment when you're playing our unique tile-matching puzzle game!\n\nWith hundreds of relaxing puzzle game levels to play through, you'll never run out of new tile puzzle challenges to conquer. And with new levels added regularly, you'll always have something new to play.\n\nThis game is much harder than it looks and absolutely addictive!",
