    four_star_ratings: 458,
    five_star_ratings: 6337,
    long_description:
      "Welcome to Travel Match, where you can solve Match-3 puzzles and travel the world with vlogger Mia! An amazing journey is waiting for you!\n\nUse your talents to solve exciting puzzles and gain extra props. Let's set off now and visit hundreds of fascinating destinations! Meet Mia's friends, pet, crush, and rivals in a story full of twists and turns! Help Mia create more wonderful works and get popular on the Internet!\n\nGAME FEATURES:\n- Thousands of innovative levels for both masters and new players!\n- Tons of powerful boosters and explosive combinations!\n- Unlock unique obstacles such as birds, fridges, ducks, and diamonds!\n- Collect unlimited coins and special treasures in bonus levels!\n- Compete with other players in Team Battle, Golden Cup, and other tournaments!\n- Challenge your friends on Facebook and get to the top of the leaderboard!\n- Most importantly, discover interesting locations such as New York, Los Angeles, London, Paris, Sydney, Montreal, Beijing, and more!\n\n\nPrepare for an unparalleled gaming experience as you delve into the captivating world of Travel Match, the ultimate destination for Match-3 puzzle enthusiasts! Join the vivacious vlogger Mia as she leads you on an unforgettable adventure filled with excitement and discovery.\n\nEngage your strategic prowess as you tackle thousands of innovative levels designed to challenge both seasoned masters and newcomers alike. Utilize a plethora of powerful boosters and unlock explosive combinations to overcome obstacles and conquer each puzzle with finesse. From cascading candy chaos to breathtaking blasts, every level promises an exhilarating gameplay experience that will leave you craving for more!\n\nVenture through a myriad of mesmerizing destinations spanning the globe, including iconic cities like New York, Los Angeles, London, Paris, Sydney, Montreal, and Beijing. Explore each locale's unique charm and unravel its hidden secrets as you progress through the game's immersive storyline. Along the way, encounter Mia's eclectic circle of friends, adorable pets, tantalizing crushes, and formidable rivals, each adding depth and intrigue to your journey.\n\nIn addition to the thrill of solving puzzles, Travel Match offers a variety of exciting features to enhance your gaming experience. Compete head-to-head with players from around the world in thrilling tournaments such as Team Battle and the prestigious Golden Cup. Connect with friends on Facebook, challenge them to beat your high scores, and ascend to the pinnacle of the leaderboard in a quest for dominance.\n\nAs you delve deeper into the game, unlock a plethora of unique obstacles ranging from mischievous birds and stubborn fridges to adorable ducks and dazzling diamonds. Collect unlimited coins and special treasures in bonus levels, and use them to customize your gameplay experience with exclusive power-ups and enhancements.\n\nStay tuned for regular updates as Travel Match continues to expand with new puzzle levels, areas, and chapters, ensuring that your adventure never loses its momentum. Whether you're a seasoned puzzle aficionado or a casual gamer looking for a thrilling diversion, Travel Match guarantees endless hours of fun, excitement, and exploration.\n\nSo what are you waiting for? Embark on the journey of a lifetime and download Travel Match now to begin your epic candy-crushing adventure! Join Mia and her companions as they traverse the globe in search of excitement, friendship, and match-three mastery. Your adventure awaits!",
    screenshots:
      'https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/9b/3b/6d/9b3b6dd1-2974-59c8-1817-8b8c75d757b4/87c982b7-4dc4-495f-884e-816238acf242_travelmatch-20240619-IOS-_U89c6_U9891_U622a_U56fe-_U7ad6_U7248-1242x2208-1.jpg/392x696bb.jpg,https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/3e/bc/5c/3ebc5c01-fe30-fb2b-f11a-fbc52a00a845/bfc7cdaa-aa2f-474e-b89e-189d3801bd9d_travelmatch-20240619-IOS-_U89c6_U9891_U622a_U56fe-_U7ad6_U7248-1242x2208-6.jpg/392x696bb.jpg,https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/a9/e7/50/a9e75041-a07a-f1fe-632a-a62dd2f9cb90/26d795fc-032e-409a-9cca-3b5b826b12bb_travelmatch-20240619-IOS-_U89c6_U9891_U622a_U56fe-_U7ad6_U7248-1242x2208-4.jpg/392x696bb.jpg,https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/6d/17/bd/6d17bd5b-771e-f4b6-2401-ba45d78703cd/b8c153eb-5673-4992-ace6-5c8014280084_travelmatch-20240619-IOS-_U89c6_U9891_U622a_U56fe-_U7ad6_U7248-1242x2208-5.jpg/392x696bb.jpg,https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/85/86/2c/85862ce1-368a-1b10-d0f1-7f3d37a14ad0/00130735-b8bc-4088-8182-05c959c35942_travelmatch-20240619-IOS-_U89c6_U9891_U622a_U56fe-_U7ad6_U7248-1242x2208-2.jpg/392x696bb.jpg,https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource221/v4/92/ff/80/92ff808e-7749-0445-1fd3-bfa827835d29/8f57ff12-8120-4e56-85d7-27dd5a81661b_travelmatch-20240619-IOS-_U89c6_U9891_U622a_U56fe-_U7ad6_U7248-1242x2208-3.jpg/392x696bb.jpg,https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource211/v4/85/3b/31/853b3151-2402-867b-24a7-a6978573ecf0/2829f7d7-97dc-426a-9960-17e8bbe49b2e_travelmatch-20240619-IOS-_U89c6_U9891_U622a_U56fe-_U7ad6_U7248-1242x2208-7.jpg/392x696bb.jpg',
