    long_description:
      'Divinity Arrival is an idle role-play game based on global divinities. \n\nHundreds of glamorous divinities are waiting for you to collect and develop. Come to awake their inside divinity and found your own league. Ready to explore the sanctums around the world and search for the ancient relics with legendary divinities. \n\nIn this adventure, you’ll gradually gain the unrivaled power and create your own legends through challenging the throne of divinities. \n\nBesides, the ingenious strategy is considerable important in each battle. As the leader of divinities, you’re expected to adjust your team according to each divinity’s divine power and links so that your team is invincible while conquering other divinities, even the hell and the heaven. \n\nIn addition, 24-hour idle rewards will be available through dispatching divinities to gain spoils of wars. You will definitely create your blissful garden of Eden in the end.\n\nTerms of Use: https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/\nprivacy policy: https://metajoygames.com/mobile/policy/lang/EN.html',
