    long_description:
      'Dark forces threaten the fate of the monster world! Play as an evil hunter and fight monsters in an epic war against the shadows! Summon a squad of mighty heroes and create your own dream team of legendary dinosaurs. Form your own legion of legendary dinosaurs. Recruit snails, chickens and other monsters in the forest, upgrade your dino skills and unlock more legends to destroy evil knights, warriors, warriors and demon slayers.\n\nDinosaur Legend: Idle RPG is an action role-playing game. It is a role-playing game with elements of arena and online idle RPG games. The game offers an excellent item system, hundreds of weapons, and defenses divided into many different levels.\n\nThe automatic combat system is combined with the idle click game, allowing you to continuously earn more gold coins to improve the attack power, blood volume, recovery power, attack speed and experience acquisition efficiency of dinosaurs, making your adventure easier. Engage in idle wars in this free role-playing game and enjoy the best mobile gaming experience.',
