    short_description: '',
    thumbnail:
      'https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple122/v4/8f/33/8e/8f338e6a-eb4c-d480-7ded-099234edbda3/AppIcon-1x_U007emarketing-0-5-0-85-220-0.png/512x512bb.jpg',
    rating: 4.76736,
    downloads_min: 0,
    downloads_max: 0,
    website: 'https://www.tap-nation.io',
    app_size_kb: 575310,
    contains_ads: 0,
    iap_min: 0,
    iap_max: 0,
    user_ratings_count: 4720,
    privacy_policy_url: '',
    content_rating: '12+',
    one_star_ratings: 141,
    two_star_ratings: 59,
    three_star_ratings: 102,
    four_star_ratings: 153,
    five_star_ratings: 4265,
    long_description:
      "Have you heard the expression \"Hell is empty and all the devils are here.\"? The words of the great classic turned out to be prophetic. For centuries, a brotherhood of immortal heroes held back the passage between the world of the living and the dead. But dark forces have risen from hell and filled the dungeons of an ancient castle on the outskirts of London. Werewolves. Vampires. Demons. All the dark forces crave a bloody reign throughout the world. All your brothers-in-arms are in custody. You are the only immortal hero who can clear the dark dungeons teeming with evil spirits.\n\nAn adventure filled with many challenges, battles and demonic bosses awaits you. The world is on the brink of death. Only you depend on the fate of all mankind, because you are a hereditary hunter of evil. Let the demon hunt begin!\n\n· IMMORTAL HEROES\nYou have the right to create your own hero! You know yourself like no one else. Choose what's closest to you. You can become a vampire, an arsonist, a master of poisons or electricity. Each hero has a unique mastery and skills. This is what will help you in the fight against evil.\n\n· HUNTER EQUIPMENT\nEvery hunter should have a good outfit. What will you choose to use: a winchester, a revolver, or a Tesla gun? Or maybe you decide to use a crossbow? It's up to you. You can test your strength in the Arena against other players. You won't be left alone in battle. A gargoyle, a dragon or the spirits of fire, ice and death can come to your aid.\n\n· IDLE MERCENARIES\nAbilities, outfits, weapons and assistants need to be improved. To do this, you will need a huge amount of rubies. There's an easy way to earn them. After freeing the imprisoned heroes, you can recruit them. Rubies will accumulate even when you are not playing.\n\n· DUNGEON LIBERATION\nYou have to go through many quests. Explore every corner of the dungeon, because many dangers can lurk in the dark. You never know in what part of the ancient castle you will meet the next boss. You have to be prepared for that. You can find yourself in battle with both the Soul Eater and the Vampire Lord.\n\nHero Adventure is a game that will immerse you in the Victorian era and give you the opportunity to become a real hero of the century. The fate of all mankind is in your hands. Use all the possibilities, calculate the moves, destroy the evil spirits and do not let it fill everything around. Keep the balance of light and darkness in the world.\n\nIf you have any questions, comments or suggestions, you can always write to us!\nOur mail: help@pgstudio.io\n\nSee you in the dungeon, hunter!",
    screenshots:
      'https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource116/v4/a4/10/6f/a4106f8d-f270-eb86-9e0d-3830839c0fbf/0f23dfee-a9a8-443f-91de-199fd11a77c9_ios_01_5.5.jpg/406x228bb.jpg,https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource126/v4/1d/37/ee/1d37eead-43ca-fc50-e26b-a5010c1d3abc/c1e6756c-7a0e-4323-b6af-0a908e0bcb79_ios_02_5.5.jpg/406x228bb.jpg,https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource116/v4/29/fa/bc/29fabc90-9c9f-0c29-aed2-8f749b913f9b/5b2236a7-b3ff-4973-a2cb-d3e7ffab8821_ios_03_5.5.jpg/406x228bb.jpg,https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource116/v4/10/dc/4f/10dc4ff7-1abb-9b2b-4259-3f0b6c58afab/7fcba82a-6343-438b-9073-b84aa1a1f262_ios_04_5.5.jpg/406x228bb.jpg',
