    long_description:
      'Embark on an epic journey in "Superheroes: Idle RPG," the ultimate incremental RPG where superheroes unite effortlessly to battle the forces of evil! Dive into a world of endless possibilities as you unlock new heroes through a thrilling gacha system, strategically assemble your dream team, and discover awe-inspiring combo attacks to defeat increasingly formidable foes.\n\nAssemble Your Dream Team: Choose from a diverse roster of superheroes, each with unique powers and abilities, all acquired through exciting gacha draws. Create the perfect squad to take on every challenge.\n\nPowerful Upgrades: Constantly empower your heroes with the resources collected during your idle adventures, unlocking new skills and unleashing devastating enhancements to crush your enemies.\n\nEpic Boss Battles: Face off against legendary supervillains in thrilling showdowns that will test your team\'s mettle, all while enjoying the hands-off, idle combat experience.\n\nAre you ready to become a legend in "Superheroes: Idle RPG"? Join the ranks of the mightiest heroes and vanquish the darkest of foes without breaking a sweat. Download now and embark on an adventure like no other! The world needs your heroics!',
