    long_description:
      "Introducing Pizza Ready, the ultimate pizza restaurant simulation game! \nAre you ready to become the master of your own pizza empire? This pizzeria game will immerse you in the world of a pizza shop and teach you everything about running a pizza business, from cooking and serving to cleaning and even managing staff!\n\n Run your own Pizza Restaurant!\nAs the boss of a pizza restaurant, you'll be responsible for everything from making and serving pizzas to managing store and hiring & upgrading your ability. Your goal is to make your store the top-selling pizza shop and become rich!\n\n Two Sales Windows: Counter and Drive-Thru! \nExperience the thrill of taking orders not only at the counter but also at the Drive-Thru! Serve your hungry customers efficiently and witness your pizza business flourish. With two sales windows, the possibilities for success are doubled!\n\n Grow Your HR Skills, Hire, and Upgrade Employees!\nUnleash your inner HR guru by hiring talented employees and upgrading their skills. Build a dream team that will help take your pizza business to new heights!\n\n Unlimited Expansion, Chain Stores in Every State!\nPizza Ready offers boundless opportunities for expansion. Not only can you expand your store, but you can also establish chain stores in every state! Become a nationwide pizza tycoon and dominate the industry like never before.\n\n Endless fun & Completely Free!\nPizza Ready is all about fun and enjoyment. It's completely free to play, ensuring that everyone can join in on the pizza-making excitement.\n\nDownload Pizza Ready now and experience the joy of running your own pizzeria!\nWhether you're a fan of idle games, cooking, or simply love pizza, this game is for you. Solve your craving for excitement, challenge, and delicious food all in one! Get ready to serve the world, one slice at a time!\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------\nTerms of Service: http://corp.supercent.io/TermsofService",
