      "Fishing season is here!\nFishing mastery begins here, let's catch them all\n\nUpgrade your fishing rod so you can go further and catch more fish as you explore the depths of the ocean.\nThe deeper you go into the ocean, the more types of rare fish you'll find\n\nMore than a hundred unique fish species for you to catch.\nTry to catch them all!\n\nIdle Furry Fishing Features:\n- Simple and addictive gameplay: Just Hold and Drag to fish!\n- Idle Gameplay: The fishing rod earns you money while you are away!\n- Become the Furry Fishing Master: Over 100 fish species for you to catch!\n- Fish gallery: see if you can catch them all!\n\nThis new Casual game is getting people addicted all over the world and being praised as the next top game!",
