    long_description:
      'Are you bored with so-called life simulation games in which the choices you make has no point? Then give Life Choices a try!\n\nUnicoville needs your help as the town needs repairs and restoration. Bring new people to the town, play their lives, complete objectives and see the town reborn before your eyes.\n\nBecome anyone and express yourself freely in this game of life simulation. Create dozens of characters, live their whole life from birth to death, and make difficult choices along the way. Live all the bits of life.\n\nLife Choices is a fun, interactive and interesting life simulation game filled with surprises. There are more than 1000 choices for you to make as you shape your characters’ lives and decide their fates. Start from the beginning as a baby and grow into an old person.\n\nBUILD YOUR SKILLS!\nWork on your intelligence, strength and art as you fight the hardships of life. Each choice affects your skills and your skills affect the outcome of your choices. Will you be a mindless brute? Or a weak artist? Or someone who is perfect? It is all up to you!\n\nBUILD A TOWN!\nRebuild the houses of Unicoville and see the town flourish again. Pick from different house variations and establish your style. Enjoy the gorgeous 3D rendered town graphics. \n\nBUILD A HOUSE!\nStart with a small house and unlock bigger ones as you play. Customize dozens of rooms to your liking and pick furniture from a vast library of selections. All objects are beautifully rendered in 3D.\n\nCHOOSE A JOB!\nThere are several jobs and career paths to choose from. Work as a doctor, police, scientist, president, mafioso or cook. Finish college to get better job opportunities. You can even go into crazy careers and become a superhero or a monarch. If you don’t like working, you can live as an unemployed and earn money through some side hustles.\n\nHAVE A FAMILY!\nYou can find love with your character and get married. As you develop your bond, you will have opportunities to make a child as well. See your child grow in front of your eyes. Make extremely hard parenting choices.\n\nBECOME GOOD or EVIL!\nThis game is not a stairway to heaven. You are not forced to be a good person. You can choose to become evil as well. Fight your way up into the top spots at Karma Leaderboards as someone who is good or evil. \n\nMAKE TOUGH CHOICES!\nWith the dilemma system, your characters will be faced with tough choices from time to time. You need to decide carefully, as the consequences are serious and effective. \n\nPLAY STORY LIVES!\nLife Choices allows you to create your own unique characters, but you can also play the story characters and help them achieve their life goals. Help Meredith to become an astronaut, or help Jeff to take his revenge.\n\nFeatures:\n● Free to download, free to play, and free to enjoy. No hidden fees.\n● More than 1000 choices to make.\n● Dozens of different character sets.\n● Name your own characters.\n● Family friendly gameplay with no explicit content.\n● 3D Town and House visuals.\n● Customize the town to your liking. Design your own houses.\n● Customize your house with lots of options.\n● Play the story lives filled with exciting events.\n● Humorous situations and surprising events.\n● Create unlimited amount of characters.\n● Fight for the Karma Leaderboards.\n● All choices matter.\n● Find your romance.\n● Get rich with the wealth system.\n● Dozens of different endings.\n● Addictive and relaxing gameplay.\n● Play without the internet.\n● Simple and highly addictive game play.\n● Play offline.\n\n Have fun!\n\nIf there is questions contact us unico@unicogames.co\n\nPrivacy Policy and Terms of Use\nPrivacy Policy: https://unicostudio.co/privacy.html\nTerms of Use: https://unicostudio.co/terms.html',
    screenshots:
      'https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple116/v4/88/f7/a7/88f7a720-8562-96a9-d06a-09c4a8e52550/f891f070-8d4f-433c-a52c-38987d246c27_1.jpg/392x696bb.jpg,https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple126/v4/91/47/73/914773dd-fcf7-9f11-1c3d-f03c3378a3da/d3d58d2b-245e-4778-b101-f1c3de8c6480_2.jpg/392x696bb.jpg,https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple116/v4/af/e3/05/afe30520-7ae5-3c1c-50bf-87e83bab001c/d95e629e-05ab-4676-b709-04dbea78a45b_3.jpg/392x696bb.jpg,https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple126/v4/c2/b6/15/c2b6157f-b48e-6723-1981-0834b17c4d58/af428514-a492-4105-948c-520fa72e151f_4.jpg/392x696bb.jpg,https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple126/v4/54/ac/b3/54acb392-ee14-46e9-5b30-f5eb5ce47e8a/133324a1-9103-4012-8c57-e982b5e56c6b_5.jpg/392x696bb.jpg,https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple116/v4/be/47/3c/be473cf0-b42f-b148-a3df-8bdd97a0452f/01a25330-4b9b-41b7-b8f2-6bdebb47e6d0_6.jpg/392x696bb.jpg,https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple116/v4/4c/2e/df/4c2edf2a-631a-eed8-a1b4-a0303464088f/1251e0b2-0697-4a92-95e7-28227f07d7df_7.jpg/392x696bb.jpg,https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple116/v4/aa/d9/85/aad985a6-acb8-bec1-3488-49523dc9e135/9c289003-d638-4be4-a248-2ea1a6e5093b_8.jpg/392x696bb.jpg,https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple116/v4/85/04/93/85049323-21ea-7ba0-dd1b-39a74d0e5c92/6a9338bf-bfaf-42ce-815f-714da991a105_9.jpg/392x696bb.jpg,https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Purple126/v4/30/fd/e3/30fde35d-43bf-7365-fb8f-97e63e712a19/b8b6b0d2-eba8-44c7-b9d1-a096d3c98462_10.jpg/392x696bb.jpg',
