    long_description:
      "The game is simple but challenging. Build up the island by crafting some primitive tools to keep more survivors alive... Develop your own territory and population and keep your inhabitants from starving. Make sure the bonfire burns to dispel the fog, or everyone will get sick. The night was dangerous, and no work was performed. Work hard to fix the ship and get out of here.\n\nSurvivor's story: \nA party of adventurers had been carried to this misty island by a great wave. Dangerous and strange flora and fauna are all over the island. Wait! They found a dilapidated ship. It appeared that some one had been here before, and had met with misfortune. They decide to use the ship as a camp and gather more survivors to work together to repair it and get out of this weird place...\n\nFeatures:\n1.  The combination of SIM and survival\n2. Balance of resources and building islands.\n3. Rescue the survivors and assign them work\n4. Build towers, train soldiers, defend against danger.\n5. Free placement, planning a home\n6. Idle and offline mode\n7. Simple and easy graphics with a 3D style\n8. Explore the map and challenge a variety of living environments.\n\nIf you like strategy survival games, you will love this game! Play this brand new survival simulation game now!",
