    user_ratings_count: 30567,
    privacy_policy_url: '',
    content_rating: '12+',
    one_star_ratings: 336,
    two_star_ratings: 301,
    three_star_ratings: 1662,
    four_star_ratings: 4104,
    five_star_ratings: 24164,
    long_description:
      "Doomsday: Last Survivors is a zombie survival strategy game with multiplayer online competition and real-time strategy elements. Set in a near future where zombies have taken over the world, survivors must fight for their lives and for the future of humanity. As the Commander, it's your duty to lead your fellow survivors to build their Shelter, explore fog-filled areas, and fight against the zombies and rival factions!\n\n[Game Highlights]\nNew Tower Defense Gameplay\nSkilled survivors will join you to explore this fallen world that's festering with the infected. Stay sharp, set up ideal Hero formations, and construct fortifications to survive the zombie invasion! \n\nSurvival of the Fittest\nLead troops and civilians in your Shelter! Exterminate zombies to survive the apocalypse, or raid other Shelters to sustain your own. You can also form an alliance and fight enemies with your allies. \n\nA Realistic Doomsday Experience\nRealistic spherical terrain system with convenient zoom controls that enable close-up Shelter views to satellite views. An immersive survival experience with hideous zombies, an ever-looming crisis, and a cruel world where it's kill or be killed.\n\nStrategic Battles\nUtilize everything you can find to survive the apocalypse. Train multiple troop types, and execute diverse battle strategies with Hero skills and attacks to outlast the zombie hordes.\n\nUnique Heroes\nRealistic and interesting Hero designs portraying survivors from different walks of life. Recruit talented Heroes to help lead your troops and defend your Shelter!\n\nCommander, are you ready to survive the apocalypse with your wit and strength?\n\n===Information===\nOfficial Facebook Page: https://www.facebook.com/DoomsdayLastSurvivors\nOfficial Discord: https://discord.gg/bZErQs6CkN\nCustomer Service: help.doomsday.apple@igg.com\n\n===Subscription Details===\n\nSubscription (US$4.99/month)\n- Subscribe to get: Research Speed +2%, Training Speed +2%, Stamina Recovery +2%, EXP from Zombies +10%, and daily rewards.\n\nNote:\n1, Payment will be charged to your iTunes Account upon purchase.\n2, Subscription will automatically renew unless auto-renewal is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current subscription.\n3, Your account will receive confirmation of the next renewal and price within 24 hours before the end of your current subscription.\n4, You may manage/turn off your subscriptions and auto-renewal by going to the Account Settings after purchase.\n\nTerms of Service (EULA): https://policies.igg.com/view/?id=1 \nPrivacy Policy: https://policies.igg.com/view/?id=2",
