    long_description:
      'Welcome to the hottest PvP Mech sport the future has to offer! Play custom matches against your friends or get them in a team to shoot down players from around the world in live 5v5 and 2v2 matches. Battles take just 5 minutes and its totally FREE.\n\nJust select a Mech from dozens of options, equip it with the perfect weapon loadout, and take on all comers in the arena. Then, customize your Mechs looks and performance as you rise up the divisions to reach the top. With instant match-making, you can go from pocket to live battle in less than a minute.\n\nMake your name as the greatest competitor in the Mech Arena League today. Shoot smart the world is watching!\n\n| FEATURES |\n\nGAME MODES GALORE\n\nVie for territory in Control Point Clashes, test your teamwork in 5v5 Deathmatch mode, or go toe-to-toe in 2v2 Deathmatch combat. Whatever you choose, youll need to strategize with your team to come out on top.\n\n25+ UNIQUE MAPS\n\nAre you a stealthy sniper? Or do you prefer getting up close and personal? Every map favors different tactics and Mechs. Play under the neon lights of the Forbidden City, or take your combat to the stars at Elon Station Gray. Explore and master them all!\n\nENDLESS MECH BUILDS\n\nWith over a dozen distinctive Mechs and more than 35 Weapons to play with, you can prepare for whatever the opposing team throws at you. Upgrade your favorites and trick them out with 500+ Skins to express yourself in the arena!\n\nSPECIAL MECH ABILITIES\n\nBlind your opponents with targeting jammers. Shoot forward at ramming speed. Deploy energy shields, repair fields, jump jets, proximity mines, and more. Know when and where to use your Abilities if you want to win.\n\nSTAR MECH PILOTS\n\nHire from a cast of expert athletes to give stat boosts and other bonuses to your Mech. Figure out your favorites, level them up just by using them, and enhance them further with advanced implants that can give your Mechs the edge in matches.\n\nFUN CUSTOM MATCHES\n\nPlay your game by your rules: pick the map, mode, and players you want in a Custom Match. Hone a killer new tactic, set up a tournament for bragging rights, or try out some new Weapons. The choice is yours!\n\nEXCITING TOURNAMENTS & EVENTS\n\nHit all your objectives in weekly Events or fight through heat after heat in competitive Tournaments to show that youre a cut above the rest. Prove your worth to win big, and write your name in Mech Arena history!\n\nPOINT-AND-SHOOT SIMPLICITY\n\nIntuitive controls make it easy to get the hang of things even in your first PvP battle. Want to play it your way? Customize your controls the way you want them.\n\nNO WIFI? NO PROBLEM\n\nMech Arena is designed to run smoothly on most 4G/LTE networks. So, you can enjoy matches on-the-go, wherever you are. With short matches lasting a few minutes, its perfect for a quick break!\n\nPLEASE NOTE:\n\n Items are available for purchase in this game. Some paid items may not be refundable depending on the type of item.\n Mech Arena is available in English, French, German, Italian, Chinese (Simplified & Traditional), Japanese, Korean, Portuguese (Brazilian), Russian, Ukrainian, Spanish, Turkish, Tagalog, Thai, Vietnamese, Indonesian, and Malay.\n\nOfficial Website: https://plarium.com/\nSupport: arena.support@plarium.com\nCommunity: https://plarium.com/forum/en/mech-arena/\nPrivacy Policy: https://plarium.com/en/legal/privacy-and-cookie-policy/\nTerms of Use: https://plarium.com/en/legal/terms-of-use/\nPrivacy Request: https://plarium-dsr.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/requests/new',
