    user_ratings_count: 25555,
    privacy_policy_url: '',
    content_rating: '12+',
    one_star_ratings: 247,
    two_star_ratings: 173,
    three_star_ratings: 1035,
    four_star_ratings: 3559,
    five_star_ratings: 20541,
    long_description:
      'Unleash the power of cavalry with Mounts!\nEmbark on an exciting adventure with your very own Mount! Mounts are formidable allies in battle, capable of helping you overcome challenges and vanquish your foes.\n\nValhalla is calling!\n\nPlay as the leader of the Vikings and lead your Tribe to conquer Midgard! Embark on your quest alongside famous Heroes from Viking history.\nIn this competitive global game, what enemies will you encounter? What friendships will you gain?\n\n[Viking Rise] is an online multiplayer, real-time war strategy game. You play as a Viking ruler, guiding your Tribe throughout Valhalla in the uncharted world of Midgard. Explore, plunder, hunt, and fight your way across Valhalla to accrue massive wealth, fame, and power. Form alliances with other players, protect one another, and defeat all enemies to conquer Midgard!\n\nFeatures\n\n▶ Audiovisual Masterpiece ◀\nExperience realistic seasonal changes and explore the vast Nordic landscape. Immerse yourself in the world of Midgard with an original soundtrack composed by the renowned Mikolaj Stroinski.\n\n▶ Global Multi-Player Battles ◀\nChallenge players around the world or fight alongside allies. Balance strategy, diplomacy, or warfare as you stake your claim on Midgard and build your empire in Valhalla.\n\n▶ Design Your Territory ◀\nConquer Valhalla and recruit talent to expand your territory and grow your Tribe. Personalize your territory with Viking-style structures. Develop your land into a commercial trading center, an area of rich resources, or a powerful military fortress.\n\n▶ Naval Combat ◀\nLead your Vikings across unknown waters to seize new lands in Valhalla! Use the sea to your advantage to ambush enemies and plunder their resources, set sail for strategic territories, or use your ship to retreat from unfavorable situations. Combine your navigational and naval combat skills to invent greater strategies!\n\n▶ Real-Time Combat ◀\nFight your enemies in real-time on a massive world map. Survey your battlefields and give commands in real-time. Form alliances and adjust your strategy to devastate your foes and become the strongest in Midgard.\n\n▶ Fight Alongside Viking Heroes ◀\nRecruit legendary Viking Heroes to join you! Summon Ragnar, Bjorn, Ival the Boneless, Snake-Eyed Sigurd, Harald Bluetooth, Rollo, Valkyrie, and other famous figures from Norse mythology to fight for you.\n\n▶ Tame the Ancient Dragon ◀\nSend your Heroes to hunt down raging beasts from Norse mythology. Seek treasure in mysterious ruins and caves. Tame the mighty mythical dragon and obtain a powerful combat boost!\n\n===Information===\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/vikingrise\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/vikingrise\nYouTube: https://www.youtube.com/@viking_rise\nDiscord: https://discord.gg/vikingrise\nTikTok: https://www.tiktok.com/@vikingrise\nTwitter: https://twitter.com/vikingrise_en\nCustomer Service: help.vikingrise.apple@igg.com\n\n==Subscriptions==\n[Blessed Offering]\nA one-month subscription with automatic renewal at US$9.99 (per month). Get a one-month free trial with your first subscription.\nPurchase this subscription to enjoy the following benefits:\n1. Exclusive Decor Items from the Prayer Bellflowers series\n2. All rewards in [Distant Voyage] for free\n3. Exclusive buffs: Energy Recovery Limit +500, Research Speed +10%, Construction Speed +10%, Training Speed +10%, Healing Speedup +20%, Trap Point Recovery Speed +30%\n4. Worker Exploration time reduced by 10%\n5. Conquest Quest refresh attempts increased by 1\n\n==Disclaimer==\n1. Your iTunes account will be billed upon confirming the subscription\n2. Your subscription will automatically renew unless canceled at least 24h before the current cycle ends\n3. You will receive confirmation of the purchase and the pricing within 24h before the current subscription cycle ends\n4. You can cancel automatic renewal in your Apple account settings\n\nTerms of Service: https://www.igg.com/member/agreement.php',
    screenshots:
      'https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource116/v4/f7/a9/67/f7a96797-c08b-be99-39b2-445c3242ef8e/65c1719a-ca12-4e17-89d4-1f65b55763a6_01.jpg/406x228bb.jpg,https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource116/v4/c5/d1/39/c5d139ae-31c5-ed41-6c2f-53e4b3d54536/23335a36-c960-46b8-9f06-7dc994a25fb5_02.jpg/406x228bb.jpg,https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource126/v4/4e/5f/68/4e5f6820-d5d3-cea9-45c9-45ad4597e98f/a59d2702-f0ee-4591-a6a1-ddc1ccd89c5f_03.jpg/406x228bb.jpg,https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource126/v4/8d/6b/41/8d6b419b-447e-0c01-8e14-d70993fe7893/37e2d032-9393-43ec-aa4a-0cff8770f6c9_04.jpg/406x228bb.jpg,https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/PurpleSource116/v4/b4/b1/06/b4b1065d-cb29-108d-1984-b0edfbf7a007/a8e3302f-d3d4-4967-9914-d90fc39d3c21_05.jpg/406x228bb.jpg',
