    long_description:
      "Play insanely fun brain games & brain puzzles that'll force your mind to think outside the box. Smart Brain games consist of 250+ levels of brain teasers, tricky puzzles, and emoji quizzes to test your IQ.\n\nSmart Brain is the ultimate brain game for all puzzle fans. For some puzzles, you’ll utilize your logical mind while others will test IQ; for some, you’ll need observation skills while for others, a knack for trivia games; for some you’ll tap your creative thinking while for others simple common sense. And all these fun and unique brain games come with fantastic visuals and interactive gameplay giving you the best casual gaming experience. And this epic experience is what makes Smart Brain a top-rated game for brain.\n\nSmart Brain — Addictive Mind Games For All Ages.\n- Hundreds of tricky puzzles, brain games, brain teasers to solve.\n- The best brain puzzles for your pastime.\n- Challenge and test your friends and family’s intelligence with brain games\n- Unlock exciting new game modes.\n- An ideal free casual game.\n- Out of the box game answers for puzzles and quizzes.\n- Unique and quirky levels that you’ll find nowhere else.\n- Work your creative problem solving and pump those logical muscles.\n- Boost lateral thinking and challenge your IQ.\n- Questions that make you focus on minute details, enhance observation.\n- Problems that blow your mind with out-of-the-box solutions.\n- Challenging enough to make grown-ups think.\n- Fun enough to make everyone laugh.\n- Stimulate your brain for a healthy mind.\n\nHoly cow — this sounds exactly like the brain game you were looking for!\nWho is this brain game for?\nIf you like logical games, riddles, math games, jigsaw puzzle games, word search games, quiz games, and trivia games then Smart Brain game is just for you. Download Now for FREE.\nSmart Brain is not your regular easy game — it's the ultimate brain test.\nYou’ve to break free from normal thinking, come up with something absurdly creative, something that pops your brain out, something that makes your brain sweat, something that makes your neurons wiggle — you gotta have a smart mind.\nCan you do it? Are you a “Smart Brain”? Yes, you are?!\nSo just play the game and prove your intelligence to the world.\n\nFeatures:\n• Tricky puzzles\n• Funny game answers.\n• Fun for all ages: The best game for family & friends’ gatherings!\n• Download this funny game for free.\n• Great exercise for the brain.\n• Simple and highly addictive gameplay.\n• Play without the internet.\n• Play offline.\nHave fun!",
