    long_description:
      "Saint Seiya: Legend of Justice is the first Saint Seiya Idle RPG adapted from the original Saint Seiya series and under the original writer Kurumada Masami's supervision! Classic plot revived with high-quality pictures.\nMain Feature\nOfficial authorization to revive the original manga\nFeel the Nostalgic experience of the original Story of Seiya's journey alongside other Bronze Saints such as Ikki, Shiryû, Hyôga, and Shun. Enter the Sanctuary and challenge the 12 Gold Knights\nAll Knights are awaiting your command\nOver 100+ Knights under Goddess Athena assembles. Gather your favorite Bronze Knights, Silver Knights, and even Gold Knights to protect the Goddess.\n\nEnriched strategy, Lineup variety\n5 Classes, 6 Elements, Unlimited combinations to strengthen your team. See if you can dominate the Galaxian Wars and the Twelve Palaces. How you form your formation will decide the outcome of the battle!\nOne Tap, Massive Rewards\nNo Knights will stop fighting, even when you're sleeping, your massive rewards will await you when you return. Become a Top Player Effortlessly.\nOriginal CV, Revive your Memories\nIshikawa Kaito, Kaji Yuuki, Sakurai Takahiro, Hanae Natsuki, and Sugita Tomokazu. Their voice will lead players back to the sanctuary and burn Cosmo together!\n\n???? Official Website: https://noctuagames.com/games/saintseiya \n???? Developer Website: https://noctuagames.com \nOfficial Community Saint Seiya: Legend of Justice SEA\n???? Official Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/seiyaLoJSEA\n???? Official Group: https://www.facebook.com/groups/514660110422243\n???? Official Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/noctua.saintseiya/\n???? Official Twitter: https://twitter.com/SaintSeiyaLoJ/\n???? Official Discord: https://discord.gg/xDAmCNDjfb",
