    long_description:
      'Catch Them All! Whose Monster is the strongest?\n\nRush towards the monster battle arena, collect Monster Balls to catch Monsters and build a team. Pump up their power to Train and Evolve Monsters and battle against monster trainer in fight games.\n\nTeam up and take down the rival trainers in team battles monster games. Collect Monster Balls while running through obstacles with your new monster friends. Catch and collect all the battle monsters. Get ready for monster fight games!\n\nCatch Them All!\nUnleash the power of your pocket monster, build your battle team and power up  to become legend monsters! Collect, and evolve monsters to take down opponents in monster fight games. Select your monsters, Build a strong team and get ready for monster battle!\n\nMonster Legends!\nBuild your fighting force and face other Monster trainers in fight games. Become a real trainer and complete challenges in monster fight games. Catch monsters, power up and evolve them to build a strong team and conquer the monster battle games!\n\nGame Features:\nRush towards the Battle Arena\nCollect Monster Balls\nCatch Monster\nEvolve the Monster\nBuild a Strong Team\nCompete in Monster Battles\n\n---\nReviews\nPlease rate Monster Squad Rush and leave us a review! We love hearing from our fans! If you have suggestions or queries, please email us at support@tap-nation.io',
