    long_description:
      '????? Mech Arena is a FREE multiplayer fighting game with explosive PvP battles, deep tactics, and limitless customization. Perfect for FPS fans!\n\nUnleash havoc in Free-For-All mode, play custom matches against your friends, or team up to take down shooters from around the world in 5v5 and 2v2 matches. With maps designed for fast PvP combat, battles take only 5 minutes!\n\nJust select a mech, equip it with the perfect weapon loadout, and take on all comers. Then, customize the looks and stats of your robots as you rise up the divisions to reach the top. With instant multiplayer match-making, you can go from pocket to live battle in less than a minute!\n\n| FEATURES |\n\nPvP GAME MODES GALORE \n\nVie for territory in Control Point Clash battles, test your teamwork in Deathmatch mode, or let loose in Free-For-All combat. Whatever you choose, you’ll need to strategize to win. This isn’t like a regular FPS!\n\n25+ UNIQUE MAPS\n\nAre you a stealthy sniper or a short-range shooter? In this fighting game, every map favors different mechs and tactics. Play under the lights of the Forbidden City, or take to the stars at Elon Station Gray. Explore and master them all!\n\nCROSS-PLATFORM PLAY\n\nPlay on mobile, or try Mech Arena on a bigger screen to enjoy FPS-like intensity with our zoomed-in TPS view! Your mobile and desktop accounts can sync, so you can pilot your robot anywhere. \n\nENDLESS MECH BUILDS\n\nWith over 20 distinctive bots and 60+ weapons, you can counter any tactic. Upgrade your favorites and trick them out with 500+ skins to express yourself in the multiplayer PvP arena! \n\nSPECIAL MECH ABILITIES\n\nJam your rivals’ best shooter, ram into their robots, deploy shields, and more! Know when to use the abilities of your mechs if you want to win.\n\nSTAR MECH PILOTS\n\nHire Pilots to give stat boosts and other bonuses to your Mech. Figure out your favorites, level them up just by using them, and enhance them further with advanced implants to give your robots the edge.\n\nFUN CUSTOM PVP MATCHES\n\nPick the map, mode, and players you want in a Custom Match. Prepare a killer new tactic, set up a multiplayer tournament, or try out some new weapons. The choice is yours.\n\nTHRILLING TOURNAMENTS & EVENTS\n\nHit objectives in weekly Events or battle through multiplayer PvP Tournaments to show that you’re a cut above the rest. Prove your worth to win big! \n\nPOINT-AND-SHOOT SIMPLICITY\n\nRobot fighting games have never been this effortless. FPS-style intuitive controls make it easy to use your robots even in your first PvP battle. Want to play it your way? Customize your controls to fit your needs.\n\nNO WIFI? NO PROBLEM\n\nMech Arena runs smoothly on most 4G/LTE networks, so you can enjoy combat on-the-go. With short battles lasting a few minutes, this robot game is perfect for a quick break for FPS and TPS fans alike!\n\nPLEASE NOTE:\n\n• Items are available for purchase in this fighting game. Some paid items may not be refundable depending on the type of item.\n• Mech Arena is available in English, French, German, Italian, Chinese (Simplified & Traditional), Japanese, Korean, Portuguese (Brazilian), Russian, Ukrainian, Spanish, Turkish, Tagalog, Thai, Vietnamese, Indonesian, and Malay.\n\n| LINKS |\n\nWebsite: https://plarium.com/en/game/mech-arena-robot-showdown/\nSupport: arena.support@plarium.com\nCommunity: https://plarium.com/forum/en/mech-arena/\nPrivacy Policy: https://plarium.com/en/legal/privacy-and-cookie-policy/\nTerms of Use: https://plarium.com/en/legal/terms-of-use/\nPrivacy Request: https://plarium-dsr.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/requests/new',
