    long_description:
      'Defense Clash – Shoot down all the enemies! A great action game that’s fun to play for 5 minutes or hours on end. \n\n>> Strategy’s Selection!\n     Routes should be planned before you start a new level, or you will be defeated by monsters!\n\n>> Upgradeable Guns with Fantastic Skins!\n     Intelligent mechanics, upgradeable guns, gorgeous skins and tactical challenge gameplay promise that you will be addicted in a few seconds! \n\n>> A Different Type of Action Game!\n     New thrilling action game that you can dodge, run, and find to take cover in a limited room. By the way, rooms also could be enlarged! Make your defense and gear stronger by defeating all the exciting levels to get awesome rewards.\n\n>> Endless Defense Game!\n     Your challenge journey will never end – unique levels which keep updating. Tactical approaches and ingenious strategy should be adopted to every different level. Nearly 20 different bosses with various abilities provide extra challenges with excitings and awesome rewards for your elite agents.\n\n>>  Exciting shooting sounds & Clear Graphics!\n     Defense Clash boasts simple but stylish graphics that are light enough to play on any device. Also, here’s a fantastic and atmospheric soundtrack to enhance your experience of action and adventure.',
