    long_description:
      "v7.2 is updated! New S-rank battlesuit Fenghuang of Vicissitude debuts!  \nMain story Part 2 warm-up begins! Play to get Crystals and more!\nFeatured event Wild Phoenix Chase is available! Play the event to get Reverist Calico's new outfit, Crystals and more!\n\n\n[New Version Content]\n\n[S-rank Battlesuit | Fenghuang of Vicissitude]\nRemove all troubles and break free from all pains to understand the coming and going.\nThe heart is like a piece of porcelain that becomes shinier the more it is exposed to fire.\nNow, the blaze that has been burning for tens of thousands of years has flared up once more.\nNew S-rank battlesuit Fenghuang of Vicissitude debuts! As a BIO-type S-rank melee Fire DMG dealer, she has great survivability and can switch between Punch Stance and Kick Stance to fiercely attack enemies in battle. When casting Ultimate, she uses herself as a furnace for phoenix fire, and burns away her life to deliver an unparalleled blow.\n\n[New Event | The Star Which the Moon Gazes Upon]\nImagine if he was fortunate enough to learn the humanity of today is finally treading the path he'd been yearning for — how do you think he'd react?\nNew event story now available! Play the event to get Crystals and more!\n\n[Featured Event | Wild Phoenix Chase]\nWhat happened, you ask? Isn't it obvious? I was just out cycling and singing with Old Timer when out of the blue, our camper got hijacked by Phoenixes!\nFeatured event Wild Phoenix Chase begins! Travel with Fu Hua, Herrscher of Sentience and others to collect marbles and souvenirs during the journey. Use marbles to defeat enemies and take back the camper!\nPlay the event to get Reverist Calico's new outfit Meowtose Macchiato, Crystals and more!\n\n[New Event | Realms of Battle]\nThe realms of battle unfold. It is time to push past the limits and charge toward victory.\nNew event stages available. During the event, clear themed stages and defeat final bosses to get Crystals, Einstein's Torus and more.\n\nEquipment Updates\nUnleash unprecedented power! Fists Torch of Eons, its PRI-ARM, and stigma set Flavors of Time are now available!\n\nMore Outfits\nSugary Starburst's outfit Tonight's My Time! and Reverist Calico's outfit Meowtose Macchiato debut!\n\n----\n\"Like before, I will always be here.\"\n\n\n[Game Introduction] \n\nHoYoverse's flagship product and Genshin Impact's companion action roleplay game!  \n\nHyperion command system ready. Processing login request... Verified. \nAttention, all units! Safety catches unlocked! Download engine transferring high concentrations of energy. Login countdown: 10, 9, 8...\n\"Captain on the bridge.\"\nWelcome to Hyperion, Captain! From today onwards, you are our Captain!\nCome fight for all that is beautiful in the world with us!\n\nHD cel-shaded graphics, infinite combo, ultra-tight controls... Experience next-gen real-time action!\nEpic storyline spanning works, immersive stage dialogues, celebrated VA lineup... Become the center of the legend!\nMore elements including Valkyrie customization, open-world adventure & exploration, base building, racing, shooting, and co-op raids spice up the game like never before!\n\nGet along with a diverse cast of Valkyries and their bonds will become your strength!\nJoin Valkyries in the war against Honkai to save the fantastic Honkai-verse!",
