    long_description:
      "You are bored and looking for something challenging and full of surprise? Then welcome to the thrilling world of Jelly Cube Run 2048. The rule is simple but really addicting.\n\nJelly Cube Run 2048 is a modern twist of the classic snake and 2048 games. Control your cube and navigate it around the game area, merge as many cubes as possible to grow longer and more powerful. But beware! Other players are on the prowl, ready to outmaneuver, trap, and eliminate you to claim victory for themselves. \n\nFEATURES:\n- Hundreds of challenging obstacles and fun levels.\n- Merge cubes to reach beyond 2048 and defeat enemies to rank at the top leaderboard.\n- Personalize your chain's appearance with a vast array of skins, glasses and masks.\n- Various power-up and boosts scattered throughout the arena will help you gain temporary advantages over your opponents.\nAre you ready to slither, strategize, and dominate? Get ready to become the ultimate 2048 merge chain master!\n\nPrivacy Policy\nhttps://seaweedgames.com/privacy.html",
