    long_description:
      "Ready to SMASH? Get set, SMASH LEGENDS!\nSMASH LEGENDS is free and fun PvP Action MOBA fight and supports 1v1 clash & Duo fight & 3vs3 & MOBA brawl action on mobile and online.\nPlay SMASH LEGENDS offering solo (1v1, Battle Royal) or with friends (Duo, 3v3, Moba) while creating the ​​most outstanding team in free, fun and co op games. \nSmash your opponents in SMASH LEGENDS on mobile and online, while unlocking and upgrading Legends.\n\nSimple Controls in Free and Fun PvP Action Brawl Fight on Mobile and Online\nAdopt simple slide-and-touch controls to have fun enough on mobile and online! Let’s smash it!\nExperience what SMASH LEGENDS offers on mobile and online; 1v1 & Duo fight & 3v3 & MOBA brawl action with simple controls. \n\nUnique Personalities Legends in free PvP Action Brawl Fight & fun co op games  \nMeet Legends from fairy tales from around the world and train your Legends in SMASH LEGENDS.\nCollect skins for your Legends and show them off to others in 1v1 & Duo fight & 3v3 & MOBA brawl action.\nMake one-of-a-kind by customizing Legends with fashion items in a fun action PvP brawl game on mobile and online.\n\nSmash your opponents across the world in free PvP Action Brawl Fight & fun co op games  \nSmash your opponents and test your skills in PvP offering, 1v1 & Duo fight & 3v3 & MOBA brawl fight on mobile and online.\nSmash others, hone your skills and become the world’s greatest Legends. \nCreate your team to smash others in PvP with duo fight & 3vs3 & MOBA brawl fight.\nRemember! Duo fight & 3vs3 & MOBA brawl action requires teamwork to smash them.\n\nDiverse Maps and Modes in Free and Fun PvP Action Brawl Fight on Mobile and Online\nDive into fun PvP action brawl offering 1v1 clash & Duo fight & 3vs3 & MOBA brawl fight & battle royale on mobile and online.\n\n- Dominion (3v3 MOBA): Capture a contested area with your team to win and smash your opponents.\n- Battle Royale (MOBA, free-for-all): Fight in an 8-player battle royale and become the last one standing.\n- Team Touchdown (3v3 MOBA): Push one of the two escort targets at the center to the opponent’s base wins.\n- Duo Touchdown (2v2 Duo PvP): Shares the same ruleset as Team Touchdown but with only 1 escort target.\n- Duo Deathmatch (2v2 Duo PvP): In this 2v2 team play mode, the first team to earn 7 points wins.\n- Duel (1v1 PvP): Pit yourself against another player head-on.\n\nKeeping up with SMASH LEGENDS' upcoming updates, including new Legends, Skins, Maps, Special Fun Events, and Game Modes both mobile and online. \n\nBest fit in SMASH LEGENDS: Free and Fun PvP Action Brawl Fight on mobile and online\nEnjoy free and fun PvP Action MOBA Brawl Fight & co op games on mobile and online.\nEnjoy free and fun PvP Action MOBA with 1v1 clash & Duo fight & 3vs3 & MOBA brawl action & battle royale.\nLike interacting with friends across the world on mobile and online MOBA brawl fight.\n\nPlease read SMASH LEGENDS' Privacy Policy and Terms of Service to enjoy Free and Fun PvP Action Brawl Fight on mobile and online.\nSMASH LEGENDS Privacy Policy: https://smashlegends.com/privacypolicy_en/ \nSMASH LEGENDS Terms of Service: https://smashlegends.com/tos_en/",
