    long_description:
      "Looking for a family adventure game? Try our Bermuda Adventures free farming games about village life in paradise cove! Harvest and enjoy adventures in island game.\n\nImagine that a big family gets together to celebrate Grandma’s birthday on a tropical paradise island! But suddenly something went wrong, a plane lost control and made an emergency landing down in Bermuda Island of adventure and family members were scattered in all directions. Now they must not only learn to live on a farm on a tropical lost island, but also find all the relatives lost during landing in our free farming games.\n\nMain features of Bermuda Adventures Farm Island:\n\n🔹 A lot of characters with unique stories and behaviors in farm family adventure time games;\n🔹 Travelers from the past and other interesting neighbours in forest island game;\n🔹 Huge territory of the island farm land and paradise cove for tropic escape in our farming game;\n🔹 Foods cooking for island family adventure and trading in free farm games;\n🔹 Unique township farm free animals, plants and buildings in our family village games. Let's farm together!\n🔹 Dozens of farming games for free with expeditions on islands of adventure and farm;\n🔹 Regular quests and unique events in family adventure app;\n🔹 Customization of characters' appearance in big farm family game;\n🔹 Tons of humor and island farm games for free!\n\nFamily farm adventure is beginning! Help family members arrange their everyday life, teach them how to harvest land, build farms and big farm town, grow plants and cook food in these free adventure games. Be amazed with them at the secrets and unusual finds that Bermuda monkey Island of adventure hides in our farm game. And soon you won't want to leave your township farm in these jumanji games!\n\nBuild a big cozy villa and farm town, harvest land, extract resources and produce everything you need for exciting expedition quests, construction and trading with other inhabitants of the Bermuda Triangle with our land games. Raise animals, harvest land, find coral island questaway, trade with neighbours and have fun with new adventures in this trade island game!\n\nSet up your family farm, raise animals, harvest crops, cook food for your family and trade with your neighbours and for your family members peace island survival will become the castaway paradise cove in our simulation games! Have fun with this fantasy island adventure game and our other free farming games!\n\nEscape from mundane daily routine, play the farming game and other family farm adventure games free, and become an explorer on the farm island! Welcome to Bermuda Adventures island games!\n\nTerms of Service:\nhttps://belka-games.com/terms-of-service/\n\nPrivacy policy:\nhttps://belka-games.com/privacy/",
