    long_description:
      '# Super cool Idle RPG\n# High-quality Retro Pixel RPG\n\nAn unknown crack in the dimension brought demons into this world... The world is in need of a hero, a SLAYER to put an end to the chaos. Become a Slayer and protect the world!\n\n▶ ENDLESS IDLE GAME\n\nGet rich rewards by being AFK!!\nJust 10 minutes a day is enough to explore the fantasy world.\n\n▶RETRO PIXEL INDIE GAME\nRaising Slayer is a RPG story filled with adventure and action. \nIn the adventure, beautiful Elves and wandering Swordsman are waiting for you. \n\n▶DYNAMIC HERO UPGRADE \n\nLevel up, boost your gear, unlock magic talents\nDevelop your strategy and tactics to empower your hero using the system of combining element skills! \nFind the most powerful combo and the best strategy to slay the enemies. \n\n▶ENDLESS FREE GIFTS\nAn immersive Idle clicker RPG experience for all!',
