    long_description:
      'Royal Domino, the card game Indonesians love to play. There is a large selection of card games that give fun and excitement. Download and play Royal Domino now!\n \nAll games in one app:\n \n1.\tDomino\nThe most popular type of game is Royal Domino. Take turns building off the tiles on the board with the tiles in your hand. Players may only play a tile that has a number showing at one end of the domino chain or the other. Play with a different sensation in Royal Domino now!\n \n2.\tQiuQiu\nGet the best possible combination of cards that are ranked higher and win over other players. One of the exciting card games that players can only get at Royal Domino.\n \n3.\tRemi\nBeat other players using the strategy and analysis you have. 52-card deck with Kings on top and Aces on the bottom. The player with the most points wins the game. Be the winner and enjoy the fun that is waiting for you in Royal Domino.\n4.\tTexas\nOne of the most popular variants of the card game. Two cards, known as "hole cards," are dealt face down to each player, and then five community cards are dealt face up in three stages. Join and play the game at Royal Domino.\n \nDownload Royal Domino now! You will feel the pleasure of the victory in every game that is easy to get.\nHigh graphics and a good design style. Play Royal Domino and share the fun with your friends. When else will you be able to enjoy the sensational game found only in Royal Domino?\n \nNotes:\n•\tLog in with a Facebook account or as a visitor to play on a different device without losing your game progress.\n•\tThis game is only a game to entertain and fill your spare time, it is not a gambling only entertainment game and also does not offer an opportunity to win real world prizes.\n•\tPlaying or winning in this game cannot be interpreted as success in the future.\n\nPlease note: This game is intended for an adult audience only (18 years and over) and is for entertainment purposes only.\nThe game does not offer real money gambling or an opportunity to win real money or prizes.',
