    privacy_policy_url: '',
    content_rating: 'Everyone',
    one_star_ratings: 4801,
    two_star_ratings: 2938,
    three_star_ratings: 6694,
    four_star_ratings: 8688,
    five_star_ratings: 49232,
    long_description:
      "Get ready to swallow the world in our exciting and satisfying sorting games and black hole adventure with Hole and Fill: Collect Master! \n\nIn the sorting games you'll control a powerful hole that collects all the objects in sight -food, sweets or makeup to fill the fridge.  \n\nAs you progress, you will become a sorting games master as you upgrade your hole io to make it bigger, faster, and more powerful, unlocking new levels of stationary, money, makeup, food, etc. will allow you to complete each level quickly and efficiently and to swallow and eat more yummy objects down the hole.\n\nExplore a variety of environments in the sorting games, each with its unique hole games challenges and collectibles for your fridge. Do grocery shopping and devour everything. \n\nHole games are all about collecting items, but Hole and Fill adds a sorting games layer, use your hole io, collect the food and make up, and fill the fridge!\n\nRefill makeup while shopping for cosmetics - eyeshadow, lipstick, foundation, blush, makeup mirror; Or do stationary shopping - notebook, paper, pen, whiteboard, sticky notes. Then do satisfying part of sorting games, unpacking the groceries, makeup and stationary - organize, sort yummy and tasty grocery in the fridge, makeup and stationary on shelf.\n\nExperience engaging sorting games gameplay, just like in attack hole and hole io games, unique endings, and multiple achievements as you conquer each level and finish to fill up fridge or shelf. \n\nHole and fill: Collect Master with it's addicting sorting games gameplay will make you an master who fill the fridge, that will swallow the world and eat all the objects in it! \n\nFill the fridge with all of the groceries of the sorting games that you will collect , It’s satisfying to organize fridge food, cosmetics shelf, stationary and then fill the fridge. Whole lines of food are awaiting to swallowed and organised in the fill up fridge of yours.  These sorting games are as satifying as diy makeup, fill up fridge and many other girl games, but with some cool hole games features.\n\nKey Features:\n\n- Collect and eat objects to grow your hole games and complete levels in record time and fill the fridge with yummy groceries from the sorting games.\n- Discover diverse environments and challenges in each level, and don't forget to fill the fridge!\n- Upgrade your hole for enhanced hole games speed, fridge size, and sorting games power.\n- Unlock quirky objects for your hole io and pull off crazy stunts to collect them in your fridge.\n- Earn achievements and become a true sorting games master.\n- Enjoy addicting gameplay like in hole io and hole games.\n\nEmbark on a thrilling journey and use your sorting games skills to collect, swallow the world using your hole io and eat objects to dominate each hole games level. \n\nUpgrade your hole io, fill the fridge faster and relax as you play the sorting games ahead of you! You can collect food, sweets or make up to complete all the hole games.\n\nCan you become the ultimate sorting games, fridge and hole games master? Download Hole and Fill: Collect Master! now and prove your hole io prowess!",
    screenshots:
      'https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/fQetiDJnW7PVtMY3T7tC1kcNa87DjUYyTJ_agywM6na5iPbsrUgyRj5ZeLCkMwVaqiro,https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/iLTRPG3NmWBOijE4MBdmxgiC8l-tNUxW28V7YccF8aA_T4GM_qdfzQNT-zYj7aTdCQ,https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/VKeRZw1sx1-2YyaudK6ouL6DtX-OWiVl0oNC05-t_N4hrVqai1O5JffC48DKDBtI6OM,https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ab3S3IvTtrqyieXxUfJU3KANT2Mv3Jb0KbCh5bqmKl1E_ivPDnPgSC7UnHi9PMxWb97B,https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/mHLWR4upy55yRd_5bt-Qhih5-tU7CCbl3OHXoyaZeGjYoLwHWnc6GYfFdvsR3xSU,https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/NAyPb_vWGOd4E7BJx1hL8emINtWBasVf706V8SLWrgtpXSEJYHXtmUEzm6dOCzApFVY,https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ZYdQ8_II1N918Wjr2A2Sa0ym95DfK1RxU4ZK3gsixe8v9gpMxpWujZP6iAAw7BTiSmk,https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/r6Ny5hobfLVOkfVxlvBRnxeEug4gahZLZ-mJN5GZmj8cnypurZmiXyNCm4wMcEOv41o,https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/SQG9JCX3KYwEXT5fZ4bP-PPG3-1K8SaCNuW5fROkVytbHVq5G7CydgCqmWE-EqwLvw,https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/28TY_dedRdADfTrc-An88z8K2UaIb46COgTbVPVGGppNUVHiLaL_of-kB6B1ARLiqwg,https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/CdlfGwVEgZvQlngPC0DwmcfgTWTbsztV7rH5H9ByqDova3MrSmX1oLoA-mSrlbgfsus,https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/COoMn-0FIslWHW0owwLfoPYWfPCglSrRsWWG_qsU2hPGrKM0lvX3-RzVdNvYqFZdVzQM,https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/w-UOxHhNd7nM1q04WCe7yS6U8Qeo-O1qq7TFLZVYRxOOYUZQ_Az6GvkD9ix-PpU7caU,https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/c6fCB7eb7rw4KE8Yp9GRSubvaD0S3PgI_MaeIqyozwkzmeJcpp6smPYl_JP_hRSAEhU,https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/FS9lbXj0qDw14vD_aC75wCZ322I0-XTKs329S3ka-BTtJ6k8WNsYoK4XxJrH11EcNfq0',
