      'Burst beauty, color therapy shooting game, color ball blasting!\n\nThe prettier the better.\n\nAn interesting explosion, such as a cannon with a paintball explosion\n\n- Color ball: Full of blasting fun, color ball blasting\n\n- Cannon: With precise upgrades, bomber power brings paintball explosions back to life.\n\n- Skin: more color, more feeling. Enjoy the Rainbow Ball Blast!\n\n- Extra Level: More exciting colorful ball explosions!\n\nEasy bomber explosion anytime, anywhere\n\n- One finger can shoot your cannon in an explosion of colored balls!\n\n- Enjoy a pinball explosion with every bomber around the world!\n\nNo need for wifi in a chromosphere explosion. No matter where you are, you can blow up the ball!',
