    long_description:
      "Enjoy Dominoes board game on your mobile device! \nIt's a great option if you are looking for a fun classic board game.\nThis is easy to learn strategy game with excellent graphics and convenient UI. \n\nThere are several different types of this board game. Play ALL FIVES, DRAW GAME, BLOCK GAME, ALL THREES, CROSS and KOZEL domino online with friends or against challenging computer opponent. You can choose play online board games or offline (no internet, no wifi). Join our Dominos community and meet new friends. \n\n? Features: ?\n\n• six classic Domino board games in one app\n• intuitive user interface with easy controls\n• 2 to 4 players in any game in real-time\n• play Dominos online with your Facebook friends or random players\n• challenging computer opponent knows how to play Dominoes\n• detailed stats for both online and offline game\n• leaderboard will show who is real pro in Dominos board games ????\n• get bonus coins every few hours\n• choose your favorite domino tiles\n• All Fives score hints\n• send gifts to your opponents, while playing Dominoes game\n• ask your friends for free coins and receive free coins from them\n• chat with opponents, while playing Dominos multiplayer\n\n???? If you like classic tile-based games you will love our Domino!\nDownload one of the most popular tabletop games Domino - Dominoes online free and take your way from the Beginner to Master! Play Dominos free anytime, anywhere!",
