    long_description:
      "Fond of matching games? Bravo, you’ve made the right choice - we have excellent mahjong right here! Get ready for your epic tile match adventure. Tile games will show you the way to the amazing matching tiles universe. Start your legendary journey with 3 TILES now.\n\nUltimate relaxation kit is always at hand for you\n\n3 TILES is the best fun game. As all matching puzzle games it helps to switch your mind, de-stress, and relax. Long waiting for an appointment or a flight? It won't bother you anymore. You can easily make that time enjoyable with free match games. Match three tiles now and you will see how your troubles are fading away and peace comes to your mind. \n\n3 TILES will remind you of good-old Mahjong from your childhood. We’ve taken the familiar zen match mechanics to a completely new level. Believe, you already know the rules. It will be easy and simple for you to pick up tile link gameplay. At the same time 3 TILES match game is exciting, catching, and intriguing to play.\n\nHOW TO PLAY MATCH GAMES\n\n🎯 Your goal is to clear the board. \n🧩 Match 3 identical tiles. Just tap to place them into the stack. You are looking for a triple match, for instance, three strawberries 🍓+🍓+🍓.\n🥇 When you clear the board, you win! Keep practicing to become a real tile master one day. \n😰 You get stuck and fail, if you don't get a merge for seven tiles. Remember: You have a maximum of seven moves to make one triple tile match. Each tile connect move matters. \n\nMatching games for adults are all about having fun\n\nConnect games can be tricky, but normally they always have some similar classic match mechanics. After all, you still need to match tiles with pictures, right? This is pure tile fun. Play level after level to make your mind happy. 3 TILES matching-game knows how to make you smile.\n\n3 TILES AMAZING FEATURES:\n\n🎊 Fascinating time-limited events with unique settings and little marvels for special occasions. Celebrations are always special with our 3-match game.\n🎡 Numerous stunning matching game themes from fruits and flowers to space and Wild-Wild West. By the way, if you have a theme idea, feel free to tell us. And your idea will turn into new colorful zen tiles.\n🖼 Discover our collections. Each theme in our tile kingdom has a surprise for you. Play and find the hidden parts of a puzzle. Make an exclusive card complete! Also available on time-limited events. \n🧚‍♀️ Each mahjong match level has a completely unique distribution on the board that surprises with variety - you have an extremely diverse fun puzzle games’ flow for each new level. Also look for secret tiles and jokers. Play and find out how they work. \n🧘‍♀️ You can play tile matching games the way you like. Whether it’s a fast-paced combo-rush or a meditative and thoughtful approach like in zen games, you’ll find exactly what you want. The match tile 3d suits all playing styles.\n🛰 Offline availability. No need to worry about those free memory games that require constant Internet or Wi-Fi connection – you can play tile puzzle pair matching game in offline mode whenever you want it.\n👨‍👩‍👧‍👦 3 TILES is one of the best free matching games for adults. The simple rules and relaxing gameplay mean that anyone can match tiles 3d and enjoy a round of a game. \n\n3 TILES is one of the unique connecting games that is always there for you. Enjoy catching gameplay, beautiful graphics, and fun challenges. \n\nStart your tile matching adventure! Play 3 TILES now  🥰+🥰+🥰\n\n💞 Get all the latest news about 3 TILES on our official social media pages:\n\nInstagram ✔️\nhttps://www.instagram.com/3tiles_game/\n\nFacebook ✔️\nhttps://www.facebook.com/3Tiles.game\n\n💌 If you have any questions or suggestions contact our Customer Support by sending an email to info@appsyoulove.com",
