    long_description:
      'Millions of people all over the world are in love with Numberzilla - the TOP number game! The best brain teaser from our childhood with good old familiar rules now has come back with a brand new witty look. People say this super addictive and relaxing puzzle game helps their mental health as well as lets them relax especially after a hard day. Enjoy daily achievements and unlock cool badges which will definitely cheer you up!\n\nTHE FAVORITE BRAIN TEASER\n\nYou will meet our cute mascot Numberzilla and friends - Smart Croissant, Sassy Avocado, Watermelon Warrior, and others. They will be happy to guide you through the rules in our zen number match game and will keep track of your achievements. You will receive funny badges with characters, for breaking time records, collecting game points, and completing the logic games. \n\n  We told you, Numberzilla really stands out from other logic and maths games! \n\nHOW TO PLAY\n\n🔹Find and cross out the pairs of the same numbers (4-4, 2-2, 9-9) or those which add up to 10 (2-8, 3-7, etc). Two numbers can be removed by tapping on them one by one. \n🔹In the Numberzilla number puzzle, the pairs must be located side by side. You can cross them out vertically, horizontally, and also you can make a pair when one number stands in the last cell in the line and another stands in the first cell in the line below. \n🔹There can also be empty cells between the 2 matching numbers. \n🔹The goal is to cross out all the numbers and clear the board. \n🔹When there are no more numbers to remove, press ➕ to add numbers below. \n \n3 GAME MODES\n\n❤️CLASSIC is an "endless" fun mode: you have unlimited time and field to set a score record! If you run out of moves - just add extra lines to the bottom by pressing ➕.\n\n🧨SURVIVAL. The field is limited, and a number block drops down, similar to the "Tetris" game. When the board is full - you lose! \n\n🔥DYNAMIC. Once you complete the level, you will get the button 🔀 shuffle.  Press 🔀, it will multiply your points and bring you to the next level. Turn on your cross logic!\n\nDAILY CHALLENGES AND GIFTS\n\nFor extra fun, we have prepared something special for you. Guess the code daily challenge. Guess the number code, crack the safe and earn daily bonuses. Every day you will have one new safe code to guess.  \nYou can also get free rewards, exciting promos, and discounts! Subscribe to our push notifications to find out more about free gifts!\n\nPOPULARITY OF NUMBER PUZZLE GAMES\n\nThis easy mind game is also known as Numberama, Take Ten, or 10 Seeds. Back in the day, it was common to play it on a sheet of paper, but nowadays, we definitely prefer mobile versions of number puzzle games, which you can play on the go:) Solving a puzzle a day will help you with logic, memory, and maths skills training! \n\nBOOSTERS IN THE GAME\n\nBoosters will help you to speed up playing puzzle games and get more chances to clean the board. You can use:\n💡 HINTS. Do you think about what to do next? Use hints to simplify the game process\n💣 BOMBS. This useful booster helps you to get rid of extra numbers in one tap. Just move the red area to choose the target. As a result, you will blow up 9 numbers at once! \n🔄 SWAPS. Use this booster to change the positions of any chosen two numbers in a number match game.\n\nNUMBERZILLA SHOP\n\nCheck out the Numberzilla Shop, where you can buy any boosters whenever you need without having to watch the ads for rewards. You can also buy “NO ads” and enjoy the non-stop playing fun. \n\nPREMIUM ACCESS\n\n You can definitely play Numberzilla for free, but with Premium access, we will take you to a whole new level: \n👑 Unlock unlimited amount of hints, swaps, and bombs.\n👑 No ads will ever interrupt the puzzle-solving process.\n\nCome over and enjoy our magical relaxing number matching game! Numberzilla is always there for you!💞\n\nJoin us on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/numberzilla/\nJoin us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/Numberzilla',
