    four_star_ratings: 675,
    five_star_ratings: 11129,
    long_description:
      'This Solitaire Collection includes the best classic solitaire card games: FreeCell Solitaire, Spider Solitaire, Klondike Solitaire and Pyramid Solitaire.\n\n\nMagic Solitaire Collection:\n\n\n? Solitaire is a single player card game for adults and kids.\n\n\n? The game includes detailed statistics for each solitaire card game, for each difficulty. Advanced players and fans of solitaire blitz will enjoy the game with timers and scoring.\n\n\n? Classic solitaire card games do not give 100% winnings. But Magic Solitaire Collection is a player-friendly game full of various booster packs.\n\n\n? Solitaire collection has daily quests for random solitaire card games that can be changed if needed.\n\n\n? HD graphics allow you to play on your phone or tablet.\n\n\n? Control is carried out both by the classic movement of cards, and by a simple click on them.\n\n\n? No Wi-Fi connection required to play. Autosave will take care of your game progress even when offline. Play our classic card games without internet whenever you want.\n\n\nLearn more about each solitaire card game\n\n\nThe most popular in the world and called Classic Solitaire or Patience - Klondike Solitaire:\n\n\n? In Klondike Solitaire, the main goal is to collect a deck of cards of the same suit from Ace to King.\n\n\n? Klondike Solitaire has different difficulties - a game of 1 card or 3 cards\n\n\n? Vegas is an advanced patience solitaire blitz mode that is played with in-game gold obtained by victories.\n\n\nFreeCell Solitaire is very similar to Klondike Solitaire, but remember:\n\n\n? FreeCell - This is not an easy solitaire game, even with all cards open and four squares, where you can place any card for a period of time\n\n\n? There are no difficulty levels of solitaire, which is compensated for by the dependence on the random distribution of cards\n\n\nOne of the most popular solitaire games, a classic that has millions of fans around the world - Spider Solitaire:\n\n\n? This card game is played in 2 decks - you need to collect 8 stacks from ace to king of the same suit.\n\n\n? Spider Solitaire is divided into 3 difficulties - 1, 2 and 4 suits.\n\n\n? One of the most difficult and interesting solitaire games - Spider Solitaire in 4 suits.\n\n\nPyramid Solitaire, which is similar neither to Klondike , nor to FreeCell, nor to Spider:\n\n\n? The goal of the game is to free the playing field of cards. If you win, the deck may remain.\n\n\n? In Pyramid card game, King has 13 points, Queen has 12, Jack has 11, and Ace has 1.\n\n\n? Connect 2 cards with a sum of points 13. King does not need a pair.\n\n\n? Like Freecell, Pyramid Solitaire is not an easy game.\n\n\nSolitaire card game is an intellectual puzzle game that develops logic, thinking and the brain in general. Play card games: Spider Solitaire, Klondike Solitaire, FreeCell Solitaire and Pyramid Solitaire are the classic solitaire collection.',
