    long_description:
      "The Official World Series of Poker App\nSpice up your holidays with WSOP’s free poker games\nGet 1,000,000 free chips from Santa when you download!\n\nHold on to your seat (and some eggnog) and start playing the only game that’s cooler than Christmas snow - The game of poker. Take on poker pros in the official WSOP app, compete in free poker tournaments, learn pro secrets from world-renowned poker experts and build your Poker legacy!\n\nRing in the new year with an exciting chase for legacy rings and bracelets. Better get those awesome poker hands ready!\nMeet the dealers: Monica, Aric & Bella are waiting to take you on a legendary poker ride!\nPlay Texas Hold’em or Omaha, regular poker games or special tournaments\nCollect WSOP album cards, based on legendary poker wins, to complete the album and win tons of free poker chips\nSpread some holiday cheer on the Mega Bonus wheel to win free poker chips\nEnjoy customized quests based on your skills and get the poker snowball rolling!\nLearn poker basics and pro poker moves in the WSOP Academy! Academy videos will unlock as you play\nPlay poker 24/7! Play anytime, anywhere - warming up by the fireplace or while you commute, by yourself or with family and friends, the WSOP app takes a Play As You Wish approach, come rain or shine\n\nPlay Texas Hold’em poker 24/7- Win Free Poker Games for Bracelets, Rings and More\n\nPlay your poker cards right! Wanna hit the tables like a pro? Make a new year’s resolution to pro up!\nGet all the poker goodies you can dream of when you play real WSOP poker games\nPlay circuit poker tournaments: Compete in free Texas Hold’em poker game tournaments, with fast gameplay and magnificent prizes - be the shining poker star of the ho-ho-holidays!\nFill your stockings with chips! Get free poker chips every 3 hours AND more free perks & benefits\nHit the holiday jackpot for a chance to become CHIP RICH!\nGet your Facebook connect bonus (250,000 free chips!) by connecting your WSOP app to your Facebook account\n\nLove Playing Texas Hold’em Poker? You’ll love our Poker Game Free Online\nTexas Hold’em or Omaha? A full house, or a solid poker hand? Don’t be left out in the cold! Play awesome free poker games - your cards, your way!\nExclusive WSOP players’ clubs: Think you have Texas Hold’em Poker skills? Prove it. Earn your place in the exclusive players’ clubs for elite benefits\nTexas Hold’em or Omaha: Your choice of a card game! Crush the tables with holiday spirit and become the poker king of Texas Hold’em & Omaha poker!\nPlay live with your friends: Invite your friends to play free Texas Hold’em poker games and make it a poker card night around the fireplace\nSeamless, cross-device play: Play free poker on your phone or tablet and continue on PlayWSOP.com with the same poker bankroll. This way, you can take the poker game free online experience anywhere this holiday season might take you!\nGuest mode: Rock the tables and play Texas Hold’em or Omaha anonymously\nStay real around the holiday table - bluff it out around the poker table! Don’t be afraid to get sneaky, that's what the game of poker is all about!\nSpin those slots! Spin and win poker chips and holiday gifts in between legendary poker hands.\n\n'Tis the season to give Feedback!\nConnect with us on Facebook (http://bit.ly/WSOP_Fanpage) and on Twitter (http://bit.ly/TwitterWSOP) to tell us what you think and get free chips\nCall information is required for our support elves to provide you with the ultimate service!\n\nThis product is intended for use by those 21 or older for amusement purposes only.\nPractice or success at social casino and poker gaming does not imply future success at real money gambling.\nThis product does not offer real money gambling or poker or an opportunity to win real money or prizes.",
