    long_description:
      'Spider is one of the most popular types of solitaire in the world and Spider Solitaire Deluxe® 2 is the premium way to enjoy it. \n\nPREMIUM SPIDER FEATURES\n\n-Exercise your brain: one, two, or four-suit Spider games\n-Beautiful HD Graphics.\n-Exclusive Easy Read® cards – play Spider the right way!!\n-Winnable Deals – Nearly unlimited guaranteed winnable deals\n-Play with friends on Facebook or play solo.\n-In-Game shop for exclusive cards & backgrounds.\n-Stickers and ribbons to collect after winning the hands of Spider!\n-Best-in-class customer care for any questions.\n\nAnd now it’s social: Have fun playing with friends, or play solo.\n\nYour mobile device has advanced… isn’t it time your solitaire did, too?',
