    developer: 'Betta Games',
    platform: 'Android',
    package_name: 'com.island.card',
    preview_url: 'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.island.card',
    app_title: 'Solitaire Home Design',
    short_description: 'Solve solitaire puzzles and bring your dream home into reality!',
    thumbnail:
      'https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/oDUsyxzXcVcxL0LnsAx7z5fj5xzsGEbabnRMVYMW5bGBPaId-_ZTqm-KAYn_7I1pYQ=s180',
    rating: 4.72787,
    downloads_min: 1000000,
    downloads_max: 5000000,
    website: '',
    app_size_kb: 82837504,
    contains_ads: 1,
    iap_min: 0.99,
    iap_max: 99.99,
    user_ratings_count: 113199,
    privacy_policy_url: 'https://privacy.betta-games.net/',
    content_rating: 'Everyone',
    one_star_ratings: 2589,
    two_star_ratings: 1628,
    three_star_ratings: 4140,
    four_star_ratings: 7265,
    five_star_ratings: 97569,
    long_description:
      'Solitaire Home Design, a NEW free-to-play challenging solitaire game, has finally arrived!\nSolve solitaire puzzles to renovate and decorate rooms in the mansion!\n\nIn Solitaire Home Design Games, the story of the two protagonists, Lori and Eddie, will unfold as they take on the daunting journey of transforming and renovating an entire island into a beautiful paradise. Joining them are a colorful cast of characters with their own amazing stories to tell. At the same time, you’ll enjoy solitaire games to exercise your brain and become smarter. \n\nSharpen your solitaire skills and play clever combos to earn rewards and progress Lori and Eddie’s tale!\n\nSolitaire Home Design Game Features?\n- Build and Renovate: Fix up your estate and choose from multiple different styles of furniture to create the home of your dreams.\n- Exciting Solitaire Card Games: Play solitaire games with a twist! Solve puzzles to see the next part of the story! \n- Interesting Solitaire Stories: A unique and fun storyline with tons of compelling characters and twists will keep you glued to your screen! \n- Fun Events: Celebrate holidays with fun events and great rewards! \n- Dress Up: Lori and Eddie are ready to dress-to-impress! Mix and match different clothes to create your own stylish ensemble!\n- Cute Pets: Whether you like dogs or cats, this game has cute pets galore! \n\nIn Solitaire Home Design Games, you’ll earn coins and clovers in classic solitaire games, but this isn’t just the basic and bland solitaire games you may have played on your computer! Play interesting and relaxing solitaire games with a variety of different modes and features. Use powerful items to assist you in conquering levels and unlocking the next part of the story! You can also customize the look of the game with different backgrounds and card styles. \n\nTwo complete strangers find themselves together on Dream Island. Why did they decide to live together? And why did they start renovating the island? Could romance bloom as they overcome challenges together?\n\nExperience the fascinating tale of Lori and Eddie, play fun and relaxing solitaire games, and design your dream home all in Solitaire Home Design Games! So download the new solitaire games and enjoy!\n\nWe love to hear your feedback or suggestions, so please send them to our email at the following\nEmail?dreamislandoffical@gmail.com\n\nOr follow our Facebook page to share your experiences with Solitaire Home Design https://www.facebook.com/disolitaire/\n\nBusiness cooperation?yangxue1@fotoable.com\nwebsite: https://betta-games.net/',
