    long_description:
      '​​​​Classic Solitaire is the best way to play the classic card games you know & love! \n\nThe most popular card game in the world, classic Solitaire, also known as Patience, is great to relax & train your brain. With beautiful card decks, fun animations, & free, offline play, basic Solitaire is the best card game to pass time. Winnable Solitaire decks & beautiful card decks, Classic Solitaire is one of the most addicting card games in the world\n\nLooking for fun games to unwind? Want to test your patience with card games? Classic Solitaire is perfect! With beautiful card decks & smooth gameplay, play for hours. Choose from multiple game modes, including classic, Spider, & Freecell. Plus, the Classic Solitaire cards app is customizable - personalize the look & feel of your Classic Solitaire & Patience games. Download Classic Solitaire now & start playing our addicting card games!\n\nDo you have the perfect strategy for Classic Solitaire? Endless deck of cards in this addicting card game. Or, play unlimited card games & winnable solitaire decks! Test your patience & play your way with 1 card or 3 card draw, & choose between classic Solitaire or Vegas scoring. Try our daily Solitaire challenges & customize your Patience cards, table, & Solitaire games mode to play your way! These addictive card puzzles will hook you on Classic Solitaire card games!\n\nClassic Solitaire Games Features:\n♣ Classic Solitaire card games\n♣ Unlimited deck of cards - There are always a new Patience card game to play\n♣ Classic Solitaire Games Playable offline - Test Your Patience Any Time!\n♣ Solitaire card games player statistics\n♣ Addicting card games & classic Solitaire challenges\n♣ Endless deck of cards, patience hints & undo which help you learn how to play Solitaire\n♣ Customizable basic Solitaire card & table design\n♣ Vegas & Classic Solitaire card games scoring modes\n♣ Cumulative Vegas scoring\n♣ Classic Games -  Addictive card puzzles & Patience games\n♣ Card games & Winnable solitaire decks\n♣ Left-Handed Solitaire Mode\n♣ Addictive card puzzles & classic Solitaire games\n♣ Beautiful HD Graphics On Every Winnable Solitaire Deck, addicting card game & Patience puzzle\n♣ The Classic card game you know & love\n\nHow To Play Classic Solitaire Games:\nNever heard of the classic Solitaire card games, addictive card puzzle, or other solitaire collections before? Solitaire uses a standard 52 card deck. The aim of the addicting card game is to expose all the playing cards & move them to the 4 foundation piles which are built in suits from Aces to Kings in winnable Solitaire decks.The classic game & addictive card puzzle is easy to learn so get started straight away! A Daily Solitaire card game is great for relaxing!\n\nIn basic Solitaire card games (Patience or Classic Solitaire) 7 columns are built downward in alternating colors. The aim of the basic Solitaire game is to clear the rows of playing cards.\n\nAlready know how to play solitaire card games? Strategy card games like Classic Solitaire can train your brain & improve problem-solving skills! Return to the addictive card puzzle & timeless classic card game & play patience and other solitaire collections anytime, anywhere!\n\nOur classic Solitaire card games teach you how to play Solitaire collections. Find an addictive card puzzle, test your patience with solitaire games. Play classic games like easy winnable Solitaire games or Patience. Enjoy addictive card puzzles & daily Solitaire. Playing cards has never been better!\n\nThanks for playing Classic Solitaire. If you have any suggestions for our classic card game let us know at solitaire-support@tripledotstudios.com\n\nThere’s endless classic Solitaire & Patience strategy card games to play. Play the SOLITAIRE card game NOW! Winnable Solitaire games & addictive card puzzles 24/7! \n\nAlready a Solitaire card game fan? \nLike us on Facebook, play our strategy card games Classic Solitaire & find the latest news:\nhttps://www.facebook.com/Solitaire-398627873927679/',
