    long_description:
      "Join your Facebook friends and millions of players around the world in attacks, spins and raids to grow your Lucky Buddies team to the top!\n\nAre you Master in Casual games? Do you have what it takes to be the Lucky Buddy? Travel through mysterious lands to battle it out to be the best Warrior, Coin Master, Team leader, Loot Explorer or Raid master!\n\nSpin to earn your loot\nSpin the wheel to get more coins, attack time, loot, shields or energy. Be the Coin Master! Win your coins by fighting with Pi-Rats so you can grow the strong Buddy through the game and move up in levels. Win shields to guard your team from other Buddies trying to attack you. Become the Lucky Buddy with the strongest team and the most loot!\n\nAttack and Raid fellow Buddies!\nThe slot machine isn't the only way to get loot, you can steal it too! Attack or raid friend and foe to save enough coins to build your team. Fight back and come out victorious against your enemies. Take revenge on those who have attacked your Lucky team and take their coins! Bring your Loot Dozer and get rich again! You never know what treasures you can find in someone else's team!\n\nCollect all the Cards!\nIt's not always about the loot or coins, it's about the heroes too! Open new cards to get more Buddies in your great Team and move on to the next level. With every level you go your wins will be greater\n\nPlay with friends!\nJoin our fast growing interactive Facebook community to meet new Lucky friends, earn big rewards, and trade treasures!\n\n? Battle your way to be the Luckiest Buddy with your friends by your side.\n? Join in millions of players worldwide!\n? Lucky Buddies is free on all devices with in-app purchases.\n\nFollow Lucky Buddies on Facebook for exclusive offers and bonuses!\n\nFacebook: www.facebook.com/luckybuddiesgame \n\nAre you having problems?\nPlease contact via email us at support@everybuddygames.com",
