    long_description:
      "Yandex Games is a one stop launcher featuring an extensive catalog of video games. Feel free to take your pick from any of the available options.\n\nSmart feed.\nThe Smart Feed algorithm suggests options based on your interests.\n\n\nCross-device synchronization.\nWith cross-device synchronization, you'll always be able to continue where you've left off, no matter where you are and what device you're using.\n\n\nYou will find categories like:\nWord Games.\nWord search and crossword puzzles are the perfect way to put your vocabulary to the test. Delve into the word hunt with your friends, and see if your brain can take the advanced word play! Can you guess the answer?\nBoard Games.\nUp for some multiplayer chess online? Alternatively, you can just play some casual dominos, bingo, or classic checkers with friends. If that is not something you'd like, you can always choose to play bingo at home, ludo, or even backgammon. Try out some mancala, connect four in a row, and do puzzles.\nCards.\nThere's nothing more satisfying than shuffling a deck of cards while sipping on a glass of your favorite beverage at home, an old-school formula. Treat yourself to a round of classic solitaire if you're home alone, play klondike solitaire with friends online, or enjoy some classic spider solitaire. Plus, you can also create a collection of your favorite card games and play spades with friends on your cell phone.\nArcade.\nPlenty of fun games await in a classic arcade style. Test your reflexes in brick and ball games, amaze your friends in a bubble shooter match, and rise up to the competition in the retro snake game space, both online and offline. \nAction.\nStrike fear in the hearts of your opponents in ninja combat, fight your way through war games, or become a legendary street fighter! Modern shooting and army games will test your reflexes in a battle. Show everybody your fighting skills and destroy the whole army with just one sword. Immerse yourself in a fantasy online world, try on the role of an assassin, a superhero, or even a samurai. Bring justice and master the art of warfare. Battlefield awaits!\nMusic.\nDance to the rhythm of music maker beats, tap the piano tiles to create wonderful melodies, or form a garageband with your friends and make your first song together. Grab some virtual drums, tune a guitar, and let the musical magic begin! Or participate in a beat battle and show everybody what you've got! You don't need a real studio to make music. Our apps will help you learn how to perfect your sound and become a maestro. Whether you like pop, hip hop, or rock, you'll definitely find something for your taste.\nPuzzles.\nHow big is your brain? Test your wits by solving intricate riddles and playing some classic jigsaw puzzle games. Puzzles are also a great way to pass the time if you're waiting for someone.\nTower Defense.\nProtect your civilization against the enemy onslaught! Battle strategy is all about prioritizing and resource management. Crush with your enemies, command the vikings and conquer new territories. Build up your empire, create a league of heroes, or participate in a crazy defense. This is a quest, an ultimate clash of legends, and legions rely on your bravery. Discover new worlds just with the help of your cell phone. Defend the castle and the royal kingdom will forever be in your debt!\nFamily.\nPlaying games is a perfect way to spend some quality time with your loved ones. You can draw a cartoon dog, a cat, or any other animal in drawing and coloring games. Create your own zoo or grow a virtual puppy with your friends. Or maybe you want to color by number to create a beautiful painting? You can even learn a language or adopt a talking pet. The possibilities are endless and we can make learning fun! And you don't need to download various apps to find something you like, we have already compiled a huge selection of options for you.",
