    long_description:
      'Play sports, racing, adventure, casual games like Don’t crash- car racing, bubble shooter, candy burst, fruit chop, box tower, rise up, run ninja, happy jump, save panda, earth hero, knife hit, etc. online all in one super app: GameChamp.\nPlay popular multiplayer games online with friends and challenge top online player and win prizes!\n\nGames on GameChamp App:\nGameChamp offers games across 3 categories:\n•\tCasual, Adventure and Racing Games: Play Don’t crash- car racing, Bubble Shooter, Run Ninja, Knife hit, Save Panda, Happy Jump, Fruit Slash, Candy burst, Earth Hero, Fruit Chop, and more.\n\nGameChamp is perfect for Casual Gaming\n•\tPlay with multiplayer and challenge other players\n•\tA smooth gaming experience\n•\tReal-time Scores and fast games\n\nPlay Online Bubble Shooter Game:\nPlay classic bubble shooter game on GameChamp. Shoot, Match and blast the bubbles in this bubble shooter game which is popular around the world. Play bubble shooter game, shoot and match 3 or more bubbles of same color and clear levels. Train your brain with this classic game. Put your skills to the test, compete against friends and family and see who can win. Earn coins while you play and use them. Easy and fun to play yet challenging to master.\n\nPlay Don’t Crash- Car Racing Game:\nA fun and addictive racing game. In this game you challenge you logical, critical thinking skills. Accept challenges, compete with friends and challenge your brain with this tricky game now!\n\nPlay Fruit-Slash Game:\nPlay a very classic game “Fruit Slash” on GameChamp and challenge your brain. Multiple game modes, more than 10 kinds of fruits to slice. Slice more & more fruits but remember one thing don’t slice the bomb. Play Fruit Slash with your friends and family and show how good are you in slicing fruits.\n\nPlay Happy Jump Game:\nHappy Jump game on GameChamp is simple and interesting, happy jump is a popular casual puzzle game, the player can control the jumping distance of its avatar in the game. Great and fun to play with friends and family! Play and find out who can jump the highest in Happy Jump Game on GameChamp. \n\nPlay Save Panda Game:\nSave Panda puzzle game, a very fun to play game. Train your brain while playing the Save Panda game on GameChamp. It will be more fun to play with your family! \n\nPlay Candy Burst Game:\nCandy burst is an easy yet fun puzzle game. If you are a fan of matching games, Candy burst is the perfect game for you. \nHow to play Candy burst game on GameChamp: Tap on two or more candy of same color and design to make them crush, submit scores to leaderboard and compete with top player and improve your brain memory while playing Candy burst on GameChamp.\n\nAbout GameChamp\nGameChamp provides racing games, and casual games where players can play',
