    long_description:
      "Join your friends on Facebook and millions of other coins masters around the world in this online multiplayer game Age of Coins: Master of Spins! Organise attacks, spin the wheel and raid, and develop your epoch!\n\nWelcome to Age Of Coins: Master Of Spins - a puzzle, dice and adventure game that will guide you through the most powerful kingdoms and epochs in history. Can you cross the annals of time and the lands of magical countries, the lands of dreams, to become the best pirate, hippie, king, warrior or coin master that we have ever known?\nPlay this game solo and spin the wheel to win coins or join your friends on a quest to your kingdom greatness in one of the most addictive coin games of your dreams! The more spins you make, the more coins you will win!\n\nSpin the wheel\nSpin the wheel to collect your loot and discover what fate has in store for you in this game, be it attack, raid, shield or coins. Earn the coins by falling on coins or bags of gold, and you can build great epochs and become the coin master. Collect shields to protect your epoch from other players who want to attack you. Become the coin master and create the strongest kingdom of dreams where the biggest loot hides!\n\nGo on attacks and raid your friends\nCollecting coins through the spins is not the only way to collect loot, you can also steal it from other kingdoms! Attack or raid your friends and enemies to accumulate enough coins to develop your epoch. While theyre having dreams, take revenge on those who attacked your epoch and claim what is rightfully yours! Who knows what treasures you'll find in another player's epochs!\n\nCollect puzzles\nLoot is not everything! Collect puzzle pieces from different epochs to get bonuses and extra coins. Find puzzle pieces in magic chests, ask your friends for them or complete special tasks. For each completed puzzle, you can get a valuable bonus.\n\nRoll the dice\nDreams come true with the coins you earn by rolling the dice. Build amazing kingdoms and earn amazing bonuses in the dice game.\n\nDownload Age Of Coins: Master Of Spins for free today and start imposing your dominance! In this game, adventure, wealth and glory await you!\n\nNeed help ? We are always here for you at support@kometagames.zendesk.com",
