    long_description:
      "Welcome to Daub Farm, a completely free and fun-filled Bingo game! We bring you the most popular farm-themed Bingo game of the moment, allowing you to enjoy the fun of the farm anytime, anywhere, whether you're at home or on the go. If you're a fan of farm themes, you can't miss out!\n\n*The rules of the game are very simple\nJust choose randomly appearing or numbers you hear in a 5x5 grid. When the numbers you've chosen completely fill a row, column, or diagonal, you get Bingo! Get generous gifts, level up, and unlock more exciting farm-themed activities.\n\n*We have:\n-Exquisite and detailed farm graphics, lifelike farm animals, and plants.\n-Diverse farm tasks and challenges to help you win more prizes.\n-Global social interaction: communicate, compete, and collaborate with other farm players.\n-Easy-to-understand game rules suitable for players of all ages.\n\n*We have prepared many fun activities and rewards for you, allowing you to enjoy endless fun while having the opportunity to win more gifts. \n-Daily login gift: Just log in to Daub Farm every day to draw your lucky number, and a big gift awaits you! \n-Task system: Plan out what you need to accomplish for the best gaming experience and great gifts! \n-Gift system: A variety of gifts await your selection, unexpected surprises await you! \n-Invite Friends: Bring along people around you to join the game, experience the fun of the game anytime, anywhere, and get great gifts!\n\nWhether you're a farm enthusiast or a Bingo game lover, this farm-themed Bingo game will bring you endless fun and excitement. Download now and start your farm adventure!\n\n*It is a free game and does not offer real-money gambling or opportunities to win real money or prizes. \n\n*There's no monetary value on any of the prizes, only in-game currency.",
