    long_description:
      'Elena and her sister Aria are now move to a humble and dust house. Now is the chance for you to help them to design, decorate and renovate their home to transform into spaces that you are dream of. Dcor Merge is a game that combine and fusion merge and interior home design with a blend of unfurnished rooms which are given you to create, decorate, renovate and furnish.\n\nMerge and combine two identical elements in the puzzle game board to create new items and tools to renovate variety rooms such as living room, bedroom, kitchen, garden and greenhouse. After merging two same objects, you will receive tools used to unlock and upgrade every piece of furniture and corner of rooms, renovate and paint homes or mansions. By complete the process of makeover or redesigning spaces, enjoy the relaxing time and reveal your dream houses.\n\nElena and Aria will meet many new friends- Handsome outgoing Phoenix, mystery Thorne will start show their stories. What happened to Thorne and Skytech? Also, there is still mystery of Elena and Aria: why do their parents suddenly leave? Wait for you to solve and discover .\n\n- Enjoy decoration and merge at the same time \n- Renovate furniture and walls by collect rewards from merging \n- Variety of room style and type of inn and mansion \n- explore characters stories and unlock hidden areas',
