    long_description:
      "Get tired of traditional match game? Match 3D-Triple Match Master has tons of challenging well-designed puzzle levels to train your brain, exercise your logical thinking and memory. It is the best time killer for you!\n\nHOW TO PLAY\n· Just tap to place the 3D objects into the box. Three of the same object will be collected.\n·Try to search for the hidden tiles by sweeping the screen.\n· When all objects are collected, you win!\n· When there are seven objects in the boxes, you fail!\n· Beware with the timer, you should tap to match objects quickly.\n· When you clear a level, you will find new objects to match.\n\n·All kinds of objects are included. Fruits, toys, instruments, letters, balls...Click and match them to win the game!\n·Along with the continous games, the levels become more challenging. Both good sight and good memory are needed. Try to sort of all things, match them and eliminate them!\n·Get interrupted when you enjoy the game? Don't worry, pause the game any time and resume it when you're back.\n·There're also different kinds of boosters helping you finish the level. Also, a cute piggy bank is waiting for you, a great deal to get the coin!\n\nDon't hesitate, get Match 3D-Triple Match Master now and enjoy the easy pleasure.",
