    long_description:
      "Block Puzzle Game is a classic addictive wooden style block puzzle game(also called Qblock). You should fit blocks of different shapes into a 10×10 grid. More wood blocks crush, more score you will get.\n\nBlock Puzzle Game is a real classic , no time limit and totally free game, play this game can relax and train your brain.\n\n\nWhy play this game?\n\n Block Puzzle designed for people who want to relax their brains and cultivate their brains at the same time. It includes various levels and difficulties, as well as a simple but fascinating game experience. Whether you feel tired or depressed, a few rounds of block puzzle can cheer you up and relax.\n\nIf you like wood puzzles and elimination games, or block puzzles,  Block Puzzle is the choice you can't miss. Immerse yourself in this mental game and get out of your daily anxiety and negative bad thoughts. You will find a lot of fun! Use a relaxed and challenging  Block Puzzle game to release pressure or train your brain, anytime, anywhere!",
