    long_description:
      "Looking for some fun and excitement? Dive into the world of Triple Match 3D, the ultimate puzzle matching game! Enjoy a wide array of thrilling levels and entertaining challenges that will keep you engaged for hours on end!\n\nExercise your brain and enhance your problem-solving skills by playing this addictive sorting goods and matching game. Test your sorting abilities as you become a master matcher thourgh sorting the shelves and make everything tidy again!\nIndulge in a relaxing and enjoyable experience as you discover and connect tiles, completing various missions along the way in matching and triple matching.\n\nLong car ride ahead? Why not make it more enjoyable by playing a cool match and organizing game? Sharpen your skills with unlimited offline gameplay, anytime, anywhere. Get your hands on this incredible matching and sorting goods puzzle from the store and embark on a hidden objects search today!\n\nHow to Play:\n* Tap on three identical tiles to connect them and form triples.\n* Keep sorting and matching objects until all tiles are cleared and make the shelves tidy again.\n* Complete the level's goal to become a 3D puzzles master!\n* Attention! Each level has a timer, so be swift and reach the goal in time!\n* Utilize boosters to help you sort through objects and overcome tricky levels.\n* Use Shuffle to rearrange items on the board.\n\nTap to play and uncover an addictive puzzle matching experience!\nEnjoy unique gameplay that will captivate you for hours. Put your logic and strategy to the test in this addicting Triple Match game.\nExciting Features:\n* Amazing boosters to assist you on your journey.\n* Beautifully designed 3D match levels.\n* Fun brain-training missions.\n* Easy and relaxing tile matching gameplay.\n* Play for free online or offline, no Wi-Fi or internet connection required.\n\nFans of mahjong games and goods sort will find endless excitement and pleasure through this remarkable 3D match game. Triple Match 3D is the perfect companion while waiting for appointments, enduring boring meetings, or standing in long queues.\n\n\nJoin the fun and start playing now!",
