    long_description:
      "Are you ready to become the next COIN CHEF?\n\nJoin your Facebook friends and thousands of players - Spin unique slots! attack & raid your friends and other players! Upgrade your restaurant and embark on a delicious journey around the world of cuisines!\n\nPlay for FREE with your friends! Get ready to spin the unique slots for every level and win coins! Attack & raid your Friends' village. Win Coins and Build your Restaurant in this social, interactive, and FUN experience.\n\n** Spin to Earn**\n\nSpin unique slots for every level to win coins, sabotage, heist, shield, and live events. Win HUGE loots and build the best villages and progress to see world cuisine. Shields will guard your restaurant from sabotage from your friends. Become the Coin Chef and get the most loot!\n\n** Sabotage and Heist! **\n\nAttack or raid friends and upgrade your restaurant with your golden coins. Revenge for heists to fill your piggy bank and prevail over competitors. Spin to win!\n\n** Play the Chef Wild Minigame! **\n\nCollect free spins and bonus rewards!\n\n** Play with friends! **\n\nMake sure you invite all your friends to sabotage & heist their restaurant and be the Coin Chef!\n\n● Join thousands of players from all over the world in this tasty clash for Coin Chef!\n\n->> Follow Coin Chef! on Facebook for exclusive offers & bonuses!\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/CuisineMasterGame\n\nHaving problems?\nPlease contact us via in-game Settings Menu > Support or email us at support@fortunemine.com\n\n● This game includes in-app purchases and in-app advertisements.\n● Winning at Coin Chef does not imply future success at real money gambling.\n● It is for amusement purposes only and is intended for those 18 or older.",
