      "Explore the new fairytale land after happy ending!\n\nHow's life going on after Princess married the Prince? Is it real that they live happily ever after?\nWelcome to the world of Fairyscapes. Join Sophia to travel between real world and the fairytale land. While there, you'll meet Cinderella,Princess Snowy,Little Mermaid,Bella and other fairy characters. Help them to solve their problems in fairy world. \n\nFeatures:\n- 📖 New Stories: Explore a new story after happy ending. Reveal Princess‘daily life in the fairy world.\n-💫Treasures: Collect all kinds of supplies and magical items to keep your fairyland happy and prosperous.\n- 🔍Explorations: Set on a mysterious adventure and explore the fairytale world: the enchanted Forest, the underwater Dungeon, the magic Palaze and many other fancy places in the fairyland. Save Fairytale land from unknown curse.🔥🔥🔥\n-👑Characters: Meet different fairytale characters - Cinderella,Snowy👸🏼,Little Mermaid🧜, Bella...... Help them solve daily problems. You can change their stories if you want!🍎🍎🍎\n-✨Chioces: Make different choices in the story.Experience the life of different fairy characters, all in one game!🤩\n\nEnjoy Fairyscapes Adventure? Learn more about the game on our Facebook Fan Page: \nhttps://www.facebook.com/Fairyscapes-Adventure-110208544506877",
