    long_description:
      '😺Block Cat Jam – Are you looking for a cute cat match puzzle game?😺\nRelax your brain solving puzzle with cute cats! Match same cats to solve the puzzle!\n\nWelcome to Box Cat Jam : Match, the cutest block puzzle game that you will enjoy! Use your brain to put the same three cats to release cats from the jam. \n\nBox Cat Jam : Match – Very addictive and Relaxing cat block game!\nChallenge yourself to pass the stages that might be hard and build cat towers for the cute cats! A variety of cute cats will stay in the cozy cat towers.\n\nHow to play Box Cat Jam: \n🌱Your goal is to match cats and clean the board.\n🌱 Tap lying cats to move them.\n🌱Match 3 same cats at the same time.\n🏆You will win when the board is clear!\n\n3D block match jam puzzle feature:\n😍Cute cats and challenging stages \n😍Cozy graphics and animation.\n😍Cat towers and competing system.\n😍Bus stages every month\n\nDownload Box Cat Jam : Match now and start playing it now!',
