    long_description:
      'Welcome to North Tower, a high-quality 3D tower defense game that combines merge and clicker gameplay with idle game features for endless fun!\n\nAs a player, your mission is to defend the central tower and surrounding turrets and heroes against a host of enemies. Merge weapons of the same level to power them up, grow your army, and become an unstoppable force that can clear all enemies in your path!\n\nExperience 5 explosive gameplay modes in one game!\n💥 MERGE – Merge weapons to boost your power, grow your army, and strengthen your arsenal!\n💥 SIMULATION - Conquer and develop your land, mine resources and accumulate wealth.\n💥 TOWER DEFENSE – Strategically place towers to defend against waves of enemies and bosses, and use limited resources strategically to maximize your power!\n💥 CLICK – Enjoy fast, easy, and addictive gameplay.\n💥 CASUAL - Play idle gameplay and have fun in the mini-arcade.\n\nUnlock heroes and unleash their special abilities, battle with other players to win honor and rewards, and choose from a variety of towers and enhanced skills to resist your enemies.\n\nExperience a thrilling strategy game! Defend your kingdom with merged troops! Download North Tower for free now and start your epic journey!\n\n========== 💬 Contact Us 💬 ========== \nLike us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/NorthTowerGame/ \nAny questions? Email us to support@northtowergame.com\nPrivacy Policy: https://epoch-game.com/policy-epochgame.html',
