    four_star_ratings: 248,
    five_star_ratings: 1394,
    long_description:
      'Welcome to Crazy SuperMarket, are you ready to get rich? Become the richest supermarket tycoon in the world!\n\nThe cute little hippo wants to open a supermarket, but it has no experience and needs help. You may be able to change the situation! At the beginning, the supermarket was short of goods and needed to use your talents to complete customer orders to earn gold coins. Use the gold coins you earn to decorate your supermarket and slowly build it into a global chain supermarket!\n\nLike casual business games & merge games? Crazy SuperMarket is the best choice!\n\nIn Crazy SuperMarket you can: \n• Manage supermarkets as store managers \n• Merge a variety of goods such as snacks, drinks, toys, cosmetics and more! \n• Relax and merge in your free time, exercise your fingers and test your skills and strategies. \n• Complete many tasks to achieve achievements and rewards • Use creativity to design & renovate your supermarket building and enjoy the joy of design! \n• Enjoy group activities with players from all over the world and enjoy addictive synthesis challenges together\n\nHow to play:\n\n1.Click on the fresh products with lightning symbols to produce various item elements for you to merge.\n2.Drag two identical item elements together to merge and upgrade them.\n3.Check the order bar at the top of the merge interface, merge the items they need to complete customer orders and earn gold coin rewards.\n4.Accumulate enough gold coins, complete construction tasks, build your exclusive supermarket, and unlock more interesting and fun new areas!\n\nIf you are a supermarket/merge game enthusiast? Want to experience the fun of running a supermarket and find some fun in your free time? This Crazy SuperMarket mobile game is tailored for you! Download now and play anytime, anywhere!',
