    long_description:
      "Bottle Water Sort Puzzle Games is here for you! It’s time to know how smart you all are. Test your intelligence by solving this bottle sort water puzzle. Sort them all. These puzzle games stimulates your brain in a very fun and challenging way. Enjoy the cup sort games challenge as you stack the tubes in this water bottle game. Let’s see how good you are at juggling the colors in different water tubes in this sorting games. \n\nThis color water sort 3D is a challenging color games. All you have to do in this whole color pouring bottle games is to use your brain and sort colors correctly in every tube. Guys, it's time to get your head in these types of games and sortpuz water puzzle. There are tubes filled with different colors. Quickly sort the colored waters in the tubes until all the same colors are together in each tube and become a champion of this water color puzzle games.\n\nThere is a fun rule of this water jigsaw puzzle games that you can only pour water of the same color at the top and the tube you are pouring has enough space in it. So be careful while filling up the cups in this water puzzle games. Accept the challenging levels of the color match master puzzle and solve the puzzle games for adults.\n\nThink, strategize, predict, and use sort puzzles at every move and look before pouring that the other tube has enough space or not. Be aware of the difficulties you will face in this water games 2021. Win jewels at the end of every level, use the jewels to unlock more and more hints in this color sort games. \n\nBe careful while solving the water sort puzzle jigsaw to make sure you don’t get stuck. Oh but it is perfectly alright you can restart your level at any time and play this addictive color sorting liquid games.. This water color switch game has single finger control, limitless unique levels, and no time limit. This amazing color water match master will hook you for hours. It is everybody’s favorite game to kill boredom. Enjoy the fun filled water color games.\n\nSo what are you waiting for? This liquid water sort game will make sure you enhance your IQ level as well as kill boredom. All in one, isn’t it cool? Download this free sort it 3D puzzle and color games and enjoy liquid sorting the whole day long. \n\nGet ready for more exciting levels of color water sortpuz and make it a perfect sort in this sorting games.\n\n\nFeatures: \nSort the jigsaw puzzle into respective tubes. \nCollect gems every time you complete a color games levels \nGet free hints in case you get stuck during water sorting\nColorful graphics & exciting water pour sounds\nEasy one finger control for the water pour.\nMultiple unique levels with amazing water games challenges\nExciting modes of puzzle for the color switch..",
