    four_star_ratings: 33908,
    five_star_ratings: 174278,
    long_description:
      'Welcome to Traffic Puzzle - The place where car games, Match-3 and Puzzle meet in one exciting experience. It’s a Match 3 puzzle revolution!\nTake your match-3 games skills to the next level and combine the cars with your quick thinking.\n\nThis fun match 3 puzzle game may look simple, but it’s a real challenge to master.\nWith limited moves for each level, it’s all up to your match-3 skills to make your dream come true and complete all the levels and get the high score you want.\n\nThe gameplay of the Traffic Puzzle match-3 game includes:\n- Clear the roads by matching three cars of the same color\n- Assist police, fire trucks and ambulances get to their destinations\n- Help helicopters and trains get through a blockade\n- Ensure people aren’t late for work by freeing up the tram\n- Enjoy an ever-growing collection of unique levels\n- Kick back and relax solving match-3 puzzle by clearing cars\n- Play by yourself or with your kids!\n\nTraffic Puzzle is the most innovative match 3 puzzle game that you can find. Instal now and try something new and fresh. It’s a Match 3 puzzle revolution!',
