    long_description:
      'Braindoku is one of the greatest free block puzzle games that will train your brain and test your IQ. Place blocks in the 9x9 board and fill rows, columns, or squares to clear the entire board and set a new high score.\n\nClear woody blocks on every turn to earn Streak points! Clear multiple rows, regions, or squares to earn Combo points! Earn as many points as you can to beat your high score!\n\nOur Features:\n- Quick to understand rules, easy to control.\n- Relaxing gameplay with no pressure or time limit.\n- Customizable backgrounds for every mood.\n- Your best score for tracking your progress.\n- Helpful features for your best result - hints, undo, flip figure.\n- Enjoy the fun of wooden block puzzles: Playable offline.\n- Small game size.\n\nHave fun with the wood block puzzle - a classic board game for all ages!\nReduce your stress or train your brain with a wooden block puzzle game of Braindoku anytime, anywhere. Eliminate All Blocks to Sharpen Your Mind!',
