    long_description:
      'Brains, beauty, and a legal career! Meet Elle Woods and some surprise guest stars as you enter the world of Legally Blonde! Just remember to bend - and snap!\n\nTake on a brilliant blend of addictive and challenging Match-3 puzzles and unlock a deep and engrossing choice-driven narrative adventure. Give your custom character a total makeover, renovate your apartment and make friends and love interests.\n\nClimb the legal ladder and earn your spot at the best law firm in town as you enter the world of Legally Blonde!\n\nGLAM IT UP:\nUnlock or buy new outfits, hairstyles, make-up, and accessory options and look the part as you take on the world.\n\nFLEX YOUR WIT:\nHundreds of Match-3 levels to beat, with awesome and unique bonus tiles, obstacles, and more! The more you play, the more you earn!\n\nLIFE OF LUXURY:\nLive the ultimate penthouse lifestyle as you upgrade and decorate your apartment and personal space!\n\nYOUR CHOICE:\nYou control your fate in the juicy and exciting narrative set in the Legally Blonde world! Love the world? Choose premium story options for more choices, clues, insights, and surprises!\n\nTHE NEXT ELLE WOODS:\nBalance a successful career, love life, and high-profile court cases - and do it in style! That’s the Elle Woods way!\n\nLegally Blonde: The Game is free to play, with some in-game items purchasable for real money.\n\nSupport: https://www.playsidestudios.com/support\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.playsidestudios.com/privacy-policy\n\nLEGALLY BLONDE © 2001 Metro - Goldwyn - Mayer Studios Inc. \nLEGALLY BLONDE 2: RED, WHITE &  BLONDE © 2003 Metro - Goldwyn - Mayer Pictures Inc. \nLEGALLY BLONDE: THE GAME © 2023 Metro - Goldwyn - Mayer Studios Inc. \nLEGALLY BLONDE & LEGALLY BLONDE: THE GAME are trademarks of Metro - Goldwyn - Mayer Studios Inc. All Rights Reserved.',
