    long_description:
      "Have you experienced the fun of merging and designing?Enter \"Merge Designer\", match the same items, design and decorate with Caroline, renovate the cat house, design the wedding and decorate the bakery and other scenes.During this time, many interesting stories happened to Caroline and her friends!\n\nCaroline and her good friends founded a decoration design studio. Caroline was shocked when she saw the housefor the first time. The house is as if no one has lived in it for decades, and everything needs to be renovated, which is out of Caroline expected,so Caroline decided to use her design talent and hands-on ability to renovate the house. Caroline's design journey began from then on.\n\nIn addition to the decoration of bedrooms, living rooms,bathrooms, etc. in the house, there will be various scenes such as cute cat houses, wedding scenes, baking workshops, etc. New scenes are still being developed! Every room can be decorated and designed the way you want. When the studio first started, it was full of surprises and challenges. However, Caroline made a lot of good friends. Although she encountered many difficulties, with the help of her friends, she spent this time happily.\n\nCaroline is very talented in design. With the help of her good friends, she released the vlog of decorating the apartment room. The results of Carolines design have been appreciated by many people. Many people hope that their houses or shops could be renovated. Their studio has gradually received more and more orders, not only luxury villas, but also restaurants, cafes,etc.!\n\nOn the road of starting a business, Caroline also had many ups and downs with her friends. Why did Ryan get into a car accident? Ryan's ex-girlfriend married? How many ups and downs are there on Caroline's design journey?\n\nMerge Designer by completing the task of merging with ease. Projects get a makeover. The house was also given a makeover. Unlock more decoration scenes!\nCaroline also has a hobby of cooking. In Caroline's dessert diary, she can merge fruits and milk, etc., and use a juicer to upgrade fruit and milk into milkshakes. In the dessert diary, she can also enter the food contest to win rich prizes.\nIn Merge Designer, not only decoration design, but also cooking gameplay, the game experience is more colorful!\n\nMerge Designer features:\n Fun Matching & Merging: Merge flowers, fruits, and more to solve matching puzzles!\n More than 1000 merge task puzzles to challenge your brain!\n Hidden mini-games: can you find and pass in limited time?\n Multiple designs: high degree of freedom in decoration design, various styles as you like! Show your design talent and creativity to the fullest.\n Various scenes: 15 scenes are waiting for you to decorate and design, and more houses are constantly being updated!\n Wonderful plot: All mysterious stories surround you, and you will continue to make new friends of different types, which will bring you a perfect experience!\n Easy experience: Anyone can play anytime and anywhere, whether it is a 5-minute fragment or a whole afternoon, you can open the game and enjoy the relaxing time.\n SIMPLE GAMEPLAY: You don't need a manual, just download the app and learn how to play in two minutes, and start enjoying this casual puzzle merge game!\n There are more interesting ways to play and challenges in Merge Designer, such as redemption activities, online challenges to get extra rewards, and participating in the trophy rankingto compete with other players for rewards. Complete cooking orders on special boards to participate in food contests!\nHappy merge. Have a relaxing time!\n\nYou may encounter unexpected problems during the game, please contact:\nEmail: yunbu_cs@outlook.com\nAdd us as friends:\nhttps://www.facebook.com/Merge-Designer-House-Makeover-102270299259074",
