    long_description:
      'If you are looking for different games, difficult games or fun games, then you will like Fused, which is brain teaser and numbers game. Fused exercises your brain with tremendous joy! This game is a new game and an offline game. Also one of the best games in the world.\n\nDrag the colorful blocks into the most logical locations. When the same valued tiles touch each other, they are combined. Then Enjoy watching your numbers! They will be fused and grow higher! The ultimate goal is to reach the highest tile value. You must be careful! If the board is full, the game is over! Brain games and iq games are for improving brain. You can play the best games offline.\n\nFeatures:\n Addicting & Endless Gameplay\n One of the best free games. Brain games for adults, puzzle games and new games. \n Play without internet\n Dots or pops are connected to blast the small numbers\n Easy to play, hard to master\n New games and free games are fun if they helps to imrove brain and mind.\n Special block colors and adaptive background\n Share your scores and dare your friends\n Leaderboards that lets you compete with everyone\n One of the best games in the world. Free offline games and nice games.\n Connect the pops or connect the dots for number blast\n Number clash game for fun\n Fun for all ages: The best game for family & friends gatherings!\n Download this funny game for free.\n Great exercise for the brain.\n Simple and highly addictive game play.\n Play without the internet.\n Play offline.\n\n Have fun!',
