    long_description:
      "In Merge Restaurant, Mina needs your help to reopen her mentor's former restaurant. What will the restaurant reveal about its past with a history of love and betrayal? This restaurant story is not something that you expect.\n\nPull off the covers, wipe off the dust and replace the restaurant with all new furniture, decorations, and menu by combining items. Design and watch as it goes from an old unattended mess to a Michelin-worthy restaurant. Ready for an exciting chef adventure? Lets get into the world of culinary arts together!\n\nBegin your journey by reopening the first restaurant and move on to open more restaurants around the world. Cafeteria, lounge, fast food, or a fine dining venue? Discover new tasty cuisine, dive into design and renovation and become a top chef of a successful restaurant chain! \n\nMain features in this cooking adventure:\n Unique gameplay: Help Mina restore the restaurant to its former glory and continue opening more restaurants worldwide!\n\n Exciting Merge: Combine interesting items from tools, kitchen equipment, decorations, and food. Merge to get what you need!\n\n Decorate: Decide how you want to design your dream restaurant; build with style!\n\n Combining and serving food: Prepare ingredients and serve exotic meals to your VIP guests for excellent rewards and recognition.\n\n Fantastic characters and story: Follow the journey of Mina as she overcomes challenges from rivals to open more restaurants.\n\n Relaxing: Anyone can pick up this game and play anytime. It's that easy.\n\n Dramatic: New episodes are regularly added to the game to progress the story with new restaurant areas and items to unlock.\n\nDownload this fantastic merging game today and experience an absolute chef blast! The cafe world is waiting for you!\n\nEnjoying Merge Restaurant? Learn more about the game!\nJoin our Facebook Community: https://www.facebook.com/groups/mergerestaurant\nFollow us on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/mergerestaurant/\n\nHaving problems or suggestions? \nContact our support team at support@mergerestaurant.com",
