    long_description:
      '2048 Blast: Merge Numbers Game is an addictive casual number puzzle and blast game that adds a new twist to the classic 2048 gameplay. The object of the game is to strategically combine adjacent numbers on a square grid by clicking on them.  Combine the same numbers strategically to create higher and higher numbers, such as 1024, 2048, 4096, and even millions. Reach the highest tile and get the highest score! Once you start playing, you will definitely be addicted to this twist on the classic 2248 game.\n\nThis number puzzle game is easy to learn and play, but requires strategic thinking to master. It improves your memory, concentration, and reflexes. Once you start playing, you will definitely be addicted to this twist on the classic 2048 game.\n\nHOW TO PLAY 2048 Blast: Merge Numbers\n Tap where you want the larger number to appear as a result of the combination.\n Combine the same adjacent numbers to create the highest possible number.\n Combine the numbers in order to reach higher and higher numbers, such as 1024, 2048, 4096, and beyond.\n\nWith its minimalist and elegantly designed graphics, 2048 Blast: Merge Numbers is a brain teaser and brain teaser for adults that improves your memory, concentration, and reflexes. Sharpen your mind and share your scores with your friends on social media as you compete worldwide on the leaderboards. Get ready to be the talk of the town at your next social gathering!\n\nFeatures of 2048 Blast: Merge Numbers\n Easy to play, hard to master.\n A minimalist and elegantly designed twist on the classic 2048 gameplay.\n Exclusive graphic design in this numbers game.\n Share your scores and challenge your friends.\n Sharpen your mind with this variation on the classic 2048 game.\n Leaderboards that allow you to compete globally.\n Brain teasers and puzzles for adults.\n Swipe the numbers up, down, left or right to combine the same numbers along the longer sides of adjacent squares.\n Search and connect the same numbers on the board.\n The game is over when there are no more connectable numbers.\n A cute, fun and thoughtful game design in this beautiful game about connecting numbers.\n Free to play for life.\n Play offline without internet.\n Connect and blast numbers in this numbers game.\n Smooth and simple controls.\n Autosave game.\n\nFollow us on Facebook, Twitter, Instagram, and YouTube for updates and more fun games. Download 2048 Blast: Merge Numbers Game now and get addicted to this new twist on the classic 2048 game!\nEnjoy,\n2048 Blast: Merge Numbers Game team.',
