    three_star_ratings: 0,
    four_star_ratings: 402,
    five_star_ratings: 2332,
    long_description:
      "Number Match: Ten Crush Puzzle is an addictive logic number puzzle game. You get thousands of challenging number match puzzles every day to train your brain, and we'll add more interesting levels frequently. A number match game for your brain, logical thinking, memory and a good time killer. \n\nThis innovative number match game is the best brain teaser for lovers of classic number puzzle games also known as Numberama, Ten Pair, Make Ten, Take Ten, Match Ten, Digits, 10 Seeds, Numberzilla. Whenever you want to relax, play number match puzzles. Solving logic puzzles and matching numbers will bring your brain great pleasure. Solving a puzzle a day will help you with logic, memory, and maths skills training! So if you like classic board games, try Number Match: Ten Crush Puzzle.\n\nWe have designed thousands of number match puzzles for you to beat. Different puzzles have different level targets. Level target consists of several elements such as GRASS, LILY, SLIME and MAGIC HATS etc. Unlike the classic number match games such as numberzilla and number match, you win once you reach the target instead of clearing the board. Number Match: Ten Crush Puzzle is a maths puzzle that is very easy to learn. Merge numbers to clear the elements on the board and you can enjoy this free number game. \n\nHow to Play:\n1. The goal is to reach the level target. \n2. Search for numbers with equal value (3 and 3, 7 and 7, etc) or numbers that add up to 10 (2 and 8, 4 and 6, etc). It will make a number match.\n3. Tap on the number pair one by one to cross them out.\n4. The elements are collected when numbers crush.\n5. Pairs can be horizontal, vertical or even diagonal as well as at the ending of one line on the right and the beginning of the following line on the left.\n6. Search for numbers that are separated by empty cells.\n7. Use various props to pass the level once you get stuck.\n8. You win once you reach the level target.\n\nFeatures:\n1. Good gameplay.\n2. Intuitive interface and clear layout.\n3. Easy to learn and quite addictive.\n4. No time limit, so no rush, just relax playing number games.\n5. Special props help you pass the level faster.\n6. Thousands of challenging levels for you to beat.\n7. Free to play and no wifi needed.\n\nWhen you first open our Number Match: Ten Crush Puzzle app, you see a guide tour teaching you how to play number match and when you open the puzzle game app for the 100th time, you can see yourself a number master and a good number match solver. You’d be able to play any web number match fast. Come to our Kingdom of Number Match and keep your mind sharp.\n\nMillions of people all over the world are in love with the Number Match: Ten Crush Puzzle. If you like Sudoku, Nonogram, numberzilla, crossword puzzles or any other number games, this game is perfect for you. Take the challenge, and train your brain NOW! Play this number game anywhere and anytime!\n\nThis is the Number match app for Number match lovers. If you like to play match ten games, you should download the ten pair game app. Download now and play Number Match: Ten Crush Puzzle everyday.\n\nJoin us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/number.match.ten.crush",
