    long_description:
      "Woodoku: a wood block puzzle game meets sudoku grid. Woodoku is a relaxing yet challenging wood-block-puzzle that you’ll be addicted to in no time!\n\nRelax & test your IQ with our logic puzzle games! Place wood blocks in the 9x9 board & fill rows, columns, or squares to clear blocks. Play the wood block puzzle for as long as you can without running out of space to beat your high score! Play hours of addictive games & woody puzzles with Woodoku! You can even play our addictive puzzle games for adults offline. Need an IQ boost? Play our wooden puzzle block games today!\n\nFeatures of Woodoku’s Addicting Games\nFeatures of Woodoku - the wood block puzzle game:\n* Beautiful graphics, addicting games & satisfying sound effects\n* Addictive block puzzle game experience with realistic woody puzzle tile design\n* Relaxing wood block puzzle with no time limit\n* A light, small woody puzzle game that won’t take up space on your device\n* Playable offline so you can enjoy hours of woody puzzle fun & IQ games with our wood block puzzle anywhere!\n* 100’s of new wood block puzzles & IQ games every week + the daily puzzle brings new challenges every day in fun, satisfying games!\n\nWoodoku is a highly addictive wood block puzzle game offering a unique twist on the classic Sudoku game. With beautiful graphics & challenging, endless wood block puzzle gameplay, Woodoku’s IQ games will keep you engaged & entertained for hours with fun wood puzzle challenges & satisfying games. Whether you're a sudoku expert or new to block puzzle games for adults, never get bored with block IQ puzzles & addicting games. Download Woodoku’s wood block puzzle now & see for yourself why millions love our woody puzzle challenges & IQ boost games!\n\nWoodoku is a quiet, wood block game that’s easy to learn, but a challenging puzzle game to master! Play this wood-block-puzzle game every day to sharpen your mind. Relax with Woodoku’s addictive block puzzle IQ games. Not familiar with our block IQ boost puzzle games for adults or addicting block games? \n\nHow to play Woodoku - the wood block puzzle game for adults:\n* Drag the wood block puzzle pieces onto the wooden grid\n* Play woody puzzle block games by filling a row, column, or square to clear wood blocks from the board\n* Clear rows, lines, or squares of wood blocks & earn Combo points in the addicting games\n* Merge the woody puzzle blocks on every turn to earn Streak points in block IQ games!\n* Earn as many points as you can to beat your highest block puzzle IQ games score!\n* Solve logic puzzles & block games for an IQ boost!\n*Relax with satisfying games & puzzles\n* Have yourself a woody good time by playing these addicting games & IQ boost games with beautiful woody puzzle pieces!\n\nWoodoku Woody Puzzle and Block Games Journey\nLove Woodoku’s endless block puzzle & addicting games? Enjoy new IQ games & block sudoku challenges? Play the journey-themed Woodoku block game with new endless block puzzle games for adults every week! Each Woodoku woody puzzle game has a different goal. Along the way, collect gems & amazing wood block awards! For more addicting games & an IQ boost try the daily puzzle! Woodoku is the best wood block puzzle game with simple addictive gameplay! Woodoku’s addictive block puzzle game levels will provide hours of fun in relaxing & satisfying games!\n\nDaily Puzzles & Block Games\nWant new woody puzzle challenges & addicting games? Try the daily puzzles & satisfying games! New wood block puzzles & IQ games added every day. Match the wood puzzle tiles & earn gems in block games to keep up your streak. Woodoku’s block IQ games for adults help train your brain with addictive games & endless block puzzles\n\nBlock puzzle games for adults are perfect to relax. If you’re looking for a new addictive puzzle game like sudoku or wood puzzle games you’ll love the block game Woodoku! With new woody puzzle levels out regularly, try this addictive woody block puzzle game today!",
