      'Pirates and Puzzles is a new Match-3 game with an amazing pirate setting and dynamic PvP battles. Anchors aweigh! \n \nAssemble the bravest and most reckless pirate crew under your banner and lead them through storms and trials.\n\nBuild, collect and modify fearsome ships, use unique skins and become the Master of the Seas!\n\nBe a pioneer and discover a new timekiller for you and your friends with Pirates and Puzzles. Create your mighty clan of fearless buccaneers, conquer lucrative territories from enemy brigands and consolidate your power.\n\nFeatures:\n\n• Fight online with pirates from around the world\n• Build, upgrade and customize your fleet\n• Become a legendary pirate\n• Assemble your crew\n• Find friends, join clans, fight for territory\n\nFollow us on Twitter: http://twitter.com/herocraft\nJoin our VKontakte group: http://vk.com/herocraft\nRate our games on Facebook: http://www.facebook.com/herocraft.games\nWatch videos and game trailers on Youtube: http://youtube.com/herocraft',
