    long_description:
      "Come play Mine Rescue mobile game, the mining tycoon game that will bring you on unforgettable adventure into the deep mines!\n\nA free to play and fun puzzle mining simulator for all digger games and mine games fans. \n\n⛏️Your gold miner tycoon is trapped in the mines! There is a lot of sand to dig down of there to pass a level & solve the puzzle, in the mines front of him! dig down with the pickaxe as your rescue machine and help mr mine find the way out by guiding him and help to escape of the unmineable mines. Dig corridors, avoid hot lava, move obstacles and make a path for the stone miner to get out of the cave. The mines are in deep and unmineable! Help him get through the sand like a rescue machine and dig down the holedown for gold like a true pickaxe mine games master⛏️ \n\n🔥 INTUITIVE GAMEPLAY AND FULL OF ACTION🔥\nUse your fingers to move obstacles to pass a level & solve the puzzle, work with your pickaxe & shovel, avoid hot lava and escape the traps in the deep mines, play with your mining game environment to create a path for your gold miner and enjoy one of the best mine games. These mine rescue gameplay is just as cool & challenging like screw pin puzzle, wood nuts, nuts and bolts and other tons of puzzle games!\n\n💎 INCREDIBLE REWARDS 💎\nThrough your way to the exit from the deep mines you dig in the holedown, escape the hot lava traps, collect incredible rewards and gold helping your favorite mr mine to progress and escape in his mining quest in the unmineable mines!\n\n🤩 HUNDREDS OF LEVELS 🤩\nWith more than 400 levels, you'll never get bored with the countless hours of gameplay available and the chance to become the best gold miner in mining brain teaser games!\n\n🌎 PLAY ANYWHERE, ANYTIME 🌎\nYou have hours to kill or you're just commuting? Take your pickaxe as your rescue machine, prepare your mr mine & play Mine rescue mobile game with your mining tycoon, there are mines that has to be dig down and out the holedown, so we can offer you a 5 minutes break as well as hours of fun mineing games gameplay. \n\n💡 CHALLENGE YOUR BRAIN WITH MINING SIMULATOR GAMES💡\nEasy to play, hard to master, play smart to pass a level in Mine rescue mobile game to save the miner in these brain teaser games. This game will challenge and evolve your logical skills in the mine games so you can solve the puzzle! Make the best strategy to pass a level for your mr mine to dig inn and out the holedown mines with your pickaxe as your rescue machine in front of you, so you won't be hit by a big rock or drown in a hot lava on your way playing one of the best brain teaser games! Mine rescue is just as cool & challenging like screw pin puzzle, wood nuts, nuts and bolts and other tons of puzzle games!\n\n 🏘️ CUSTOMIZE YOUR OWN CAVE 🏘️\nCollect furniture to transform your cold cave into a cozy home. All those fun features are available in your favorite deep tycoon rescue machine game. \n\nBecome the ultimate deep tycoon in Mine Rescue - Mining game! Dive into the perilous depths as you navigate through challenging mines, dodging hazardous traps and hot lava, solve the puzzle to tackle the formidable obstacles such as towering rocks, and rushing waters on your quest to discover the escape plan in one of the best digger games. As a stone miner in the deep mines, be an example and set new deep tycoon brain teaser games standard's! Our mine rescue game is just as cool & challenging like screw pin puzzle, wood nuts, nuts and bolts and other tons of puzzle games!\n\nFind inventive way to save the miner tycoon in the deep mines, Play Mine Rescue: Mining game Now !",
