    long_description:
      'If you love relaxing merge puzzles and calming music, you will love Bloom Sort Merge Puzzle!\n\nWelcome to Amy’s Flower Shop!\nEnter a world of zen with a beautiful merge sorting puzzle game. It’s free to play and has so many features that will get you addicted!\n\nEnjoy simple yet calming gameplay, beautiful graphics, and zen background music. Train your brain on the go and relax as you delve into the sweet fragrances of blooming flowers.\n\nHOW TO PLAY\n\n- Place the flower pots on the board\n- Merge six similar petals to form a flower\n- Try not to place odd pots\n- Unlock new flowers as you merge petals\n- Collect coins and bonuses\n-Watch out for the fluttering butterfly, tap on it to collect rewards\n\nFEATURES\n- Explore and unlock colorful and beautiful flowers to unlock: peonies, daffodils, sunflowers, and much more…\n-Enjoy numerous boosters\n- FREE & EASY TO PLAY\n\nA fun, addictive yet challenging merge puzzle to tease your brain, this puzzle can help you build focus skills!',
