      'Rotate and place, and order strategically, please enjoy the fantastic puzzle game----Merging Dice! Merge 3 dice with the same color to eliminate and upgrade dice. The game is all about keeping your board clean. Think seriously about upgrading which one dice is the best way to get a higher score. A cup of coffee, a breezy afternoon, challenge your brain with Merging Dice!\n\nHow to play\n--Tap to rotate dice that are in the ready zone\n--Tap to place dice on the board\n--Use a bomb to blow up a dice\n--Drag dice to the trash bin to get new dice\n\nFeatures\n--Clean and fresh user interface\n--Simple operation\n--Challenge your brain and break records\n--Pause or continue at anytime\n\nEnjoy Merging Dice at any time and anywhere. Don’t worry about losing your current progress in the game. Get a phone call, enjoy dinners, have a nice dream, and enjoy the game anytime, it’s always right here waiting.',
