    five_star_ratings: 3478,
    long_description:
      'Welcome to the addictive world of Epic Merge!  Do you want to be part of a world which is filled with legendary heroes, a mystery and monuments? \n\nMerge games are fun and addictive puzzle games. Nora will accompany you in this fun merge game journey! \n\nPlay these sandbox-style merge games! Solve the mystery and meet historical figures like Caesar, Cleopetra, King Arthur, Gandhi. Then build legendary monuments like the Colosseum, Hanging garden, Taj Mahal, Eiffel Tower etc.\n\nHelp our huntress protagonist from early ages to list the cursed fog and save the human civilization by building again!\n\nBuild each civilization by merging items. Collect mine stuff for resources. Resources will help you discover new heroes!\n\nMerge items to meet historical characters and build their cultural monuments. Become a master of the art of match and Epic Merge 3!\n\n\nFeatures of the Game:\n\nMake Historical Characters:\nMatch and merge pieces to make historical characters like Caesar, Gandhi, Lincoln, Einstein etc. And see their reaction in the new world you’re building in this Epic Merge games!\n\nCreate Historical Monuments:\nMerge 3 or 5 pieces and build historical and famous monuments and monoliths like the Colosseum, Forbidden City, Eiffel Tower, Taj Mahal and much more!\n\nDiscover & Solve the Mystery:\nUnlock new areas as you level up in the Epic Merge game, and gain access to new characters, islands and other exciting merging stuff. Also, help Nora to solve the big mystery!\n\n\nMine for Resources:\nMine for resources to build a new, bigger and better merge world.\n\nTrade with Ship:\nShip will come with a new order! Fulfilling the order will give you unique items to merge.\n\nEpic Merge takes the Merge Puzzle genre to the next level and also gives you the feeling of creating a piece of history on your mobile!\n\nEpic Merge game has amazing graphics and story! Download the game now and be a part of this story! \n\nSurprises waiting for you in the Epic Merge adventure! If you are curious about surprises, merge the items and keep playing!\n\nHelp young Nora to explore, build and save civilization by merging items!',
