    user_ratings_count: 19113,
    privacy_policy_url: '',
    content_rating: 'Everyone',
    one_star_ratings: 1803,
    two_star_ratings: 651,
    three_star_ratings: 745,
    four_star_ratings: 932,
    five_star_ratings: 14970,
    long_description:
      '🔮Nonogram is a popular brain relaxing game to solve logic number puzzles by matching blank cells and numbers at the side of the grid to reveal the hidden pixel picture, as known as Hanjie, Picross, Griddlers, Japanese Crosswords, Paint by Numbers, Pic-a-Pix 🔢. A pleasant game to train and exercise your brain, also keep your mind active with the basic rules and logic behind the picture cross puzzle🍭. \n\nJust need to follow the basic rules and logic thinking to reveal the pictogram 🎠. Squares on the board must be filled by number or left blank. Words show how many squares to fill. The numbers above the column are read from top-to-bottom. Numbers to the left of the rows are read from left-to-right. According to the numbers, color a square or mark it with an X💡.\n\nYou can get a piece of Jigsaw shard in each passed puzzle🧩. You can discover a world of over 4,000 amazing beautiful images with different themes. This is the first nonogram game where you can solve the puzzle and play jigsaw at the same time!\n\nIn the game, there is not only Nonogram to play, but also unique jigsaw puzzles for players to play! Players will get a piece of puzzle pieces every time they pass the Nonogram game, which can be used to complete a large stitch🍀! A lots of beautiful pictogram are waiting for you to explore and collect! (P.S: The probability of falling puzzle pieces is different in different chapters. If you do not get the puzzle pieces after winning a certain level, it is normal.)🌺\n\n●Massive Themed puzzle packs in the game⭐\n●Relax in a special jigsaw puzzles by filling jigsaw pieces to gain beautiful photos have same game experience like stitch🎨\n●There are intuitive and effective novice tutorials in the game, easy to learn and quite addictive once you start playing⚓\n●Choose the difficulty level from Very Easy, Easy, Medium, Hard or Very hard that best for you and become the expert! 🌈\n●There are many auxiliary functions in the game, such as return to the previous step, get hints, and reset the game 🎇\n●Autosave every puzzle, if you stuck you can try another puzzle and come back later ✨\n●Challenge different brand-new missions every week and get generous rewards for game items 🎈\n●Special nonogram pro section will offer puzzles with large size 20x20, 25x25, 30x30, 35x35 to bring unique experience. 👑\n\nTake the challenge and enjoy the endless fun of puzzles!\n\nAbout the auto-renewable subscription of Nonogram Puzzles: VIP Bonus Subscription for 2.99 USD that offers a weekly subscription for getting Multiple Rewards of coins and diamonds, and removing ADS. Links to our Terms of Service and Privacy Policy can be found below: Privacy Policy: http://www.yunbu.me/ios/privacy_policy.html Terms of Use: http://www.yunbu.me/ios/Terms_of_sevrice.html If you have any questions, feel free to contact us at yunbudraw@gmail.com',
