    long_description:
      'Play new match 3 games for adults and jewel games to renovate the city! Over a thousand bejeweled match three games (3 in a row) & jewel puzzle games.\n\nEnjoy the jewel mania and quest with our 3-match game! Match 3 jewels and use special boosters to beat thousands of levels in these games adults. Download now and play these match-3 puzzle games for adults! Play “Clockmaker: Jewel Match 3 Game” online or offline.\n\nFeatures of “Clockmaker: Jewel Match 3 Game”:\n\n💎 Match 3 games! Addicting new match three games (3 in a row) with a touch of science fiction and puzzle games for free.\n💎 Secrets and bejeweled classic games for adults! Solve the riddles of mystery objects & match 3 puzzles to get boosters and multiply your 3-match game points.\n💎 Travel with match three games! Play puzzle games for adults and go on with your favorite heroes to match adventure.\n💎 Mystery match 3 in a row atmosphere in our games for adults! Team up with Uncle to stop the treacherous Clockmaker and lift the curse from the town of Clocksville by playing free match-3 games for adults.\n💎 Jewel puzzle & match-3 games for adults! Play match 3 games for adults and collect 3-in-a-row combinations, matching beautiful jewels.\n💎 New events every week in 3 match game! Take a break from jewel blast puzzle games for free and take part in unique events: ride a ghost train, grow magical plants, make cakes, play bingo, free games match 3 puzzles and more.\n💎 Unique tournaments in match three games! Participate in tourneys with other players and get prizes in our free puzzle games for adults.\n💎 3 in a row online and offline puzzle games! You can enjoy our puzzle games for adults offline (new match 3 games with no wifi connection required), but if you want to participate in online tournaments, be sure to check your internet or wifi.\n\nPeople all over the world are playing these amazing match three games and jewel games. Relax and enjoy these match3 puzzle games for with jewel quest.\n\n“Clockmaker: Jewel Match 3 Game” is a to play game but some optional in-app items will require payment in our jewel games.\n\nVisit our community and discuss the hardest jewel quest and match-3 puzzle games you have encountered. Watch the walkthroughs of the jewel adventure match 3 games for adults. Enjoy daily and weekly bonuses when offline, online in our puzzle free match 3 games for adults.\n\nFollow us to get news and updates:\nfacebook.com/clockmaker.game\n\nDownload our other amazing top free games for adults!\nSolitaire Cruise:\nhttps://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.belkagames.solitaire\nBermuda Adventures:\nhttps://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.samfinaco.paradise',
