    long_description:
      "We still keep the signature mechanic of the number merging game simple and fun, but in Number Merging Master, we have amazing upgrade points.\n\nExciting game modes, catchy-color blocks, various backgrounds, etc. All in one Number Merging Master game. Enjoy the feeling when the puzzle blocks are merged with new ASMR sounds that help you feel satisfied. Just think about it: after a long day at work, you go home, lie on the sofa, and enjoy an exciting merging puzzle game. That would be a great way to relieve stress. \n\nWe have blocks from 2 to infinity. It create the highest landmark you can get compared to other games. In this game, your task is merging the number to make the higher-numbered block. \n\nWhat's special about this game:\n- Relax and enjoyable number merging game. \n- Exciting mode developed for you. \n- Catchy-color of numbered-blocks.\n- ASMR sound effects. \n- Train your brain.\n\nHow to play this game:\n- Be clever when you decide to merge the numbered block.\n- Clear the numbered blocks by merging them, and keep your board not being full.\n- You will lose when your board is full of numbered blocks.\n\nTerm of Service: https://halfpint-studio.com/terms.html\nPrivacy Policy: https://halfpint-studio.com/privacy.html",
