    long_description:
      "Welcome to Block Crush- a challenging and addictive block elimination game that can bring you endless joy!\n\nWelcome to the world of Block Crush! This is an easy to use, but also contains thousands of changes in the puzzle game. Here, you only keep a clear mind and clear thinking, in order to win the challenge, constantly refresh their peak record!\n\nBreak the dimensional wall of traditional box elimination, inject new elements on the basis of traditional gameplay, let you experience the joy of classic gameplay elimination, and bring you unprecedented fresh gameplay and excitement!\n\nMain features:\n\n✔ Simple rules, very easy to use\n\n✔ Smooth dynamic effect and exquisite user interface design, bring visual enjoyment\n\n✔ With challenge mode and level mode two kinds of play, let you can't stop\n\n✔ A variety of levels, including different levels of difficulty, board size (plate), etc.\n\n✔ Provide a variety of props to make you efficient clearance\n\n✔ Continue to challenge the limit, refresh their own record\n\n✔ Constantly updated daily challenges to satisfy your thirst for challenge\n\nGame Play:\n\n✔ Need to drag the squares off the conveyor belt into the board\n\n✔ When the squares form a straight line or horizontal line, the blocks will be eliminated\n\n✔ Once a square is placed on the board, it cannot be moved.\n\n✔ If there is no place on the board, the game is over.",
