    long_description:
      "Play and receive real life prizes at your home...\n\nAhoy Captain! \nAre ye ready to set sail on a swashbuckling adventure with a twist? \nWelcome aboard Prize Blast, where the treasure hunt is real, and the rewards are bountiful.\n\nEmbark on a journey to find the treasure, outsmart landlubbers, and blow stuff up... And the best part, all the treasure you plunder will be delivered straight to your doorstep for free. *\n\nNavigate treacherous waters, avoid those darned crabs that like to pinch ye in the... well, ye know. But fear not, there's also friendly pirates, sensual pirates, and even some very ugly ones too.\n\nAnd when ye finally reach that mysterious Treasure Island, ye'll have the opportunity to blow it all up and claim yer riches. So, what are ye waiting for? Try Prize Blast now and let's get plunderin'!\n\nDon't miss this opportunity to win real treasure:\nand choose your favorite high-end gifts delivered to your doorstep for free. *\nJoin the adventure today!\n\n*The more you play, the more gifts you can win: Loyalty program available to all users over 18 years of age and legal residents of eligible countries.  Please read our terms of service to check your eligibility. \n\nImportant: Please note that this game is not a form of gambling. Prizes are awarded as part of a gamified loyalty program, in accordance with the Google Play Store's terms of service, and are not based on chance or wagering.",
