    long_description:
      "Build it up, break it down!\nIn Color Wall, your goal is to stack blocks to form a perfect brick ring and smash the tower. Each time you match and complete a ring, the blocks break apart in a satisfying crash, giving you a sense of achievement and paving the way for more challenging levels.\n\nKey Features\n\n- Innovative 3D Gameplay: Experience a unique twist on classic block-stacking games with a 3D tower that adds a new dimension to your puzzle-solving strategies.\n\n- Challenging Levels: Test your skills with progressively difficult levels that will keep you engaged and entertained as you stack blocks higher and higher.\n\n- Satisfying Breaks: Enjoy the satisfying crash and break effects each time you complete a ring of blocks. The more you stack, the more thrilling the break!\n\n- Simple Controls: Easy-to-learn controls make it accessible for players of all ages, but the challenge will keep even the most seasoned gamers on their toes as they stack and break blocks.\n\n- Village Building: Beyond the tower's challenges, construct lively villages for the adorable cube characters, introducing a personal touch of progression and creativity by using your block-stacking skills.\n\nNew Villages Feature\n\nWith the newly added Villages feature, your gameplay directly influences the world of the adorable cube characters. Stack blocks and complete rings to build and nurture thriving communities atop the spiraling towers, and enjoy the added layer of strategy and fun as you break barriers and construct new environments.\n\nGet ready to immerse yourself in a world where every block you stack and match brings you closer to the ultimate goal: breaking the ring!\n\nFor more details, check our privacy policy: https://ciao.games/index.php/privacy-policy/ \nIf you need assistance, feel free to email us at info@ciao.games.",
