    five_star_ratings: 0,
    long_description:
      "Enter the world of Pack & Match 3D and hail the new king of Match 3D games! Solve challenging puzzles and match cozy objects to help Audrey, James and Molly and. Hop on this new adventure with a unique ethereal feel!\n\nWe bring you a brand-new approach to the Match 3D games, in which you’ll learn about our characters' stories as you play challenging levels. Collect coins as you train and develop your skills, and unlock exciting power-ups and boosters as you progress to make your journey easier! You can discover character items and fill up their backpacks to get to know them better and unlock new secrets about their past and their personality. Our never-ending challenges will make sure Pack & Match 3D provides you with unlimited fun, tapping and choosing all the way to the top!\n\nYou can count on continuous updates with novel game modes, exhilarating secrets and new immersive levels. Do not miss out on the adventure and jump into one of the hottest match games for free!\n\nFeaturing:\nMatch 3D gameplay: Tap on three identical objects and pack them up until you reach your goals\nBoosters: Get a head start with our powerful boosters to ease your journey\nPower-ups: Let the flashy power-ups match the objects for you and reach higher combos\nPiggy bank: Rack up coins through successive matches and get even better rewards\nCozy feel: A unique aesthetic in line with Infinity Games’ past catalog, providing you the cozy and ethereal feel our games feature\nCharacters and character items: Your Match 3D experience now features lovely characters you can get acquainted with and find out more about their lives\nFill up backpacks: Unlock secrets and match objects to enrich each character’s backpack and build towards the story\n\nDownload the hottest new Match objects game on the market and discover a challenging new immersive experience with brain-training and relaxing puzzle-solving. Challenge yourself, pack it up and get ready to meet your new friends in Pack & Match 3D!\n\nJoin now and master a unique Match-3D game!\n\nIn trouble? Reach out to us through the app or at https://infinitygames.io.",
