    long_description:
      "🪸 Dive into the depths of the ocean with 'Jewel Tears of the Abyss’! 🪸\n 🧜‍♀️ Match dazzling gems, uncover secrets, and discover exotic marine life in this captivating puzzle adventure! 🧜‍♀️  \n\n[ 👑  Features  ]\n⚓  Mesmerizing Puzzles  : Match jewels to create stunning cascades and unlock new levels.\n🐬  Exotic Marine Life  : Encounter a variety of marine creatures as you explore the abyss.\n💎  Unravel Secrets  : Solve puzzles to uncover ancient relics and mythical treasures.\n🐳  Immersive Experience  : Stunning visuals and captivating soundscapes bring the ocean to life.\n\n💚 Don't worry about Wi-Fi! Internet connection not required\n💛 There's no limit to games like life hearts\n💙 Receive a free daily bonus and gift!\n\n✨💦   Dive into adventure with 'Jewel Tears of the Abyss' and experience the wonder of the ocean depths!   💦✨\n\n[ 📌  NOTICE  ]\nIf in-game does not save, the data will be initialized when the application is deleted.\nThe data is also initialized when the device is replaced.\nIt's a free app, but it includes in-game currency, items, and paid products such as removing advertisements.\nFront, banner, and visual advertising.\n\n✉️ Customer Service:  [enp_cs@enpgames.co.kr](mailto:enp_cs@enpgames.co.kr)",
