    four_star_ratings: 0,
    five_star_ratings: 0,
    long_description:
      "Tile Tap Master - Match 3 is a new free tile matching game.🧩 In the game, you need to turn your brain and match triple tiles. When all blocks are matched, you can pass the current level!🏆 Our free tile match game includes 3000 colorful levels. Matching might be hard. Challenge your mind and solve the triple tile match puzzles, and then you will find them easy and exciting!\n\nHere's what makes Tile Tap Master stand out:\n🎨 Diverse Tile Styles: Enjoy over 30 styles of adorable tiles, ranging from fruits and cakes to fishes. Each tile board presents a unique and charming experience. You can switch between styles daily to keep the game fresh and exciting.\n\n🔓 Unlockable Skins and Themes: Explore various environments like beaches, mountains, and countries as you progress through levels and unlock maps. With over 10 skins and themes available, you can personalize your gameplay experience to your liking.\n\n💡 Abundance of Layouts and Tips: Dive into thousands of layouts accompanied by helpful tips, undo options, and powerful boosters to aid you in your puzzle-solving journey.\n\n🌟 Challenging Levels: Test your skills with a variety of interesting levels, striving to collect more stars, unlock additional world maps, and enjoy some brain-teasing challenges.\n\nTile Tap Master is designed for accessibility and convenience:\n📱 Availability: Playable on both mobile and tablet devices, tile-match game lets you enjoy the game whenever and wherever you want.\n\n😌 Tile Match Gameplay: Featuring easy fun tile match gameplay mechanics, Tile Tap Master offers a relaxed and open-minded gaming experience suitable for players of all skill levels.\n\nOverall, Tile Tap Master offers a perfect blend of relaxation and challenge, making it the ideal choice for players seeking a match puzzle experience. Download now and embark on your tile-matching journey!",
