    five_star_ratings: 0,
    long_description:
      'With a unexpected twist on the well-known puzzle-block game, Kawaii Block Puzzle will overwhelm you with the over the top cuteness of the most "kawaii" block ever exist. \nYou\'ll be drown in the sea of adorable creatures quite enjoying the soothing gameplay. This adorable edition will bring you a burst of happiness when you arrange them in a place, making for a relaxing gaming experience.\n\nThe ageless mechanisms of the well-known block puzzle games continue to provide an addictive experience. Fill the lines in either vertically or horizontally to clear the line and get experience points. Plan your moves to create as many line combinations as you can to earn bonus points. As you complete the level, collect coin to go toward the purchase of beneficial Rotate prop. The props will be a huge assistance when you get stuck! But be caution! The game will end if you are unable to add any more blocks to the board. As you leveling up, the puzzles will get trickier, demanding fast thinking and careful preparation to maneuver through the more complicated block structure.\n\nHow to play Kawaii Block Puzzle:\n- Use cute animal block pieces to create an explosive queue.\n- In order to advance to next level, keep clearing the lines to get experience.\n- Be flexible in using the rotate props to help you in the difficult situation.\n- Take your time and relish the experience of piecing together the adorable block.\n- Keep clearing all blocks from the grid, earn experience and advance to higher level.\n\nFeatures of the Kawaii Block Puzzle:\n- Extremely adorable theme and block shape.\n- Coin to help with the prop\'s expense. \n- A simple gameplay yet challenging puzzle.\n- Increase in difficulty of block structure as you advance to the further level\n\nTerm of Service: https://tripleclickstudio.net/terms.html\nPrivacy Policy: https://tripleclickstudio.net/privacy.html',
