    long_description:
      'Digiment is a fresh take on number merge games, blending the fun of number-match puzzles with the excitement of 2048 and 2248. \nGet ready for a brain-teasing yet relaxing experience.\n\nHow to Play\n\n1. Tap to Increase Numbers: Tap on blocks to boost their numbers.\n2. Merge Matching Numbers: Align three or more matching numbers to merge them.\n3. Limited Taps: You only have so many taps, so think carefully about each move.\n4. Earn Extra Taps: Merge three or more numbers to earn extra taps.\n5. Unlock New Numbers: Each merge unlocks higher numbers for you to work with.\n\nPush yourself to reach new high scores and challenge your friends to beat your record.\n\nHighlights\n\n• Inspired by Popular Games: Enjoy a unique twist on favorites like 2048, 2248, and 1024.\n• Relaxing and Addictive: Get lost in the soothing yet addictive gameplay.\n• Endless Fun: Experience infinite gameplay with continuous number drops.\n• Brain-Stimulating: Sharpen your mind with strategic moves and clever merges.\n\nTap, match, and merge your way through this engaging number puzzle game.\nPerfect for fans of 2048, 2248, and number match puzzles.\n\nFor more details, check our privacy policy: https://ciao.games/index.php/privacy-policy/ \nIf you need assistance, feel free to email us at info@ciao.games.',
