    long_description:
      "Help Jenny's Old Bakery!\n\nJenny's grandmother is in the hospital, and she has left her old bakery to Jenny.\nThe bakery is run down, and is in desperate need of care.\nFix the shop with Jenny by selling bread and purchasing new equipment!\n\nSatisfy various customers by Merge bread and fruit.\nIt is your objective to stabilize the business and evolve the bakery.\n\nTired of running things alone? Hire managers to increase profit and expand and evolve the building. Your neighbors and friends help you to discover various stores and they support to run the store life!\nHelp Jenny to expand and evolve the building she inherited from her grandmother!\n\nFeatures:\n\n- Merge items and expand the old bakery!\n\n- Solve Match puzzles by merge bread, fruit, and jewels!\n\n- Add new floors and discover various stores!\n\n- Feed the cute cats, they will reward you!\n\n- Level up to unlock the additional board game area!\n\n- Merge Sweets is a casual building expansion Match puzzle game set in an old bakery. It's for anyone and everyone to play Fun!\n\n- Merge Sweets can also be played offline.\n\n- Looking for a fun match puzzle game? Here's a fun and cute merge games!\nExpand and evolve your buildings by completing orders and increasing your profits!\n\n- Do you want to discover the mystery to making your store a success?\nHire employees to help you with your work and expand your buildings by increasing your profits!\nKeep unlocking new shops and making your bakery the best! An eventful life awaits you!\n\n- Fun and Cute merge game!\n\nReach us at help@spcomes. com for any inquiries regarding the game.",
