    long_description:
      'Discover the enchantment of nature with Garden Block, a captivating twist on the classic puzzle-block game. Immerse yourself in a serene garden setting, filled with vibrant floral blocks and lush greenery that promise a refreshing and engaging gameplay experience.\nGarden Block retains the traditional mechanics of popular wood block puzzle games, offering a familiar yet unique gameplay. Arrange the blocks to form complete lines vertically or horizontally to clear them from the board and earn points. If the board fills up and no more blocks can be placed, the game ends, challenging you to strategize and plan ahead. Collect gems as you progress through the levels to purchase powerful boosters. Use these boosters in challenging stages to gain specialized support and overcome obstacles.\nHow to Play Garden Block:\n- Arrange the garden-themed puzzle blocks to complete lines.\n- Clear all the blocks from the grid to advance through the levels.\n- Strategically use boosters to help you in difficult stages.\n- Take your time and enjoy assembling the garden block puzzles.\n\nFeatures of Garden Block:\n- Multiple difficulty levels from Beginner to Master as your score increases.\n- A fresh take on the classic block puzzle that keeps you hooked.\n- Earn gems to buy boosters and enhance your gameplay.\n- A simple yet engaging game that combines relaxation with challenge.\n\nTerm of Service: https://halfpint-studio.com/terms.html\nPrivacy Policy: https://halfpint-studio.com/privacy.html',
