      'Officially licensed by Gravity Korea, and a continuation of the classic RO, the 3D MMORPG mobile game Ragnarok X: Next Generation will be arriving soon! Dear Adventurers, start a new generation of your dream journey!\n\n======Game Features====== \n\n?Travel with Cute Pets\nPet catching system available, increase Favor and unlock more skills\nCute pets travel with you throughout your adventure!\n\n?Rekindle Old Flames, The Rebirth of a Story\nGo on a romantic journey with your loved one via the Wedding System\nEnjoy exclusive couples quests that bring you closer together!\n\n?GVG Guild Wars\nNot only a tactical competition, but a test of your teamwork!\nWork together, form your strategy, and fight for the glory of the Guild!\n\n?Return to Old Adventures\nFreely explore a huge 3D world - storylines abound!\nFrom the capital of Prontera to the small sea islands, Midgard is waiting to be explored by you!\n\n?Adventure With Your Friends\nJoin with likeminded players to form a Guild\nEnjoy instance events as you adventure together\n\n?Develop & Personalize Your Class\nThe melee Knight, ranged Archer, AOE Mage...\nClassic classes with multiple styles to develop, record a new chapter of a new generation!\n\n?Capture Precious Memories\nUse all kinds of bubble sticker emoticons in your photos\nAdjust the camera angle and snap the perfect photo to record your adventure!\n\n?Ride Cool Mounts\nA pink Poring or cute Alpaca? Or perhaps the lovable Pecopeco!\nTravel on your mount as you protect your fantasy adventure!\n\n? This game is free, but has an in-game purchase service, to buy things such as virtual game currency and items. Please make purchases within your economic means. \n\n======Contact Us======\nOfficial Site: http://www.ragnarokx.com\nFB Fanpage: https://www.facebook.com/RagnarokXNextGeneration \nEmail: cs@roxnextgeneration.com',
