    four_star_ratings: 14539,
    five_star_ratings: 87825,
    long_description:
      'The most entertaining game of the year is already here! It is your time to shine, dress well to impress everyone, race against to win this clash of fashion war! The game has already been viewed millions of times on TikTok and has become a popular trend. Dress well according to a specific concept to toast your opponent on the runway. Ever wondered how it is like to be under the spotlights and do a catwalk as fashion icon celebrity Naomi Campbell at a Met gala? Now is your chance to show your fashion taste and shine! You will be selecting realistic shoes for girls, high heels, clothes, bikinis, date night dresses, even accessories like vintage sunglasses and designer bags. Some concepts and genres will be about casual clothing while some will be all about luxury. Styling is all on you!\n\nThe greatest thing about the game is you can be a super stylist! Now it is your time to become a part of this fashion makeover project for your model. You will feel like the lights are on you. You can be a model, dancer, or cover girl. No matter if you are teen or adult, you are the designer and the game is your sketchbook! Dress up your fashion super model and become the fashion stylist ever. Find the most stylish possible fashion dress clothes that will rock your high heels or complete your style with a designer bag, all of these are up to you! Join this highly addictive 3D fashion model adventure and be a part of this luxurious game!\n\nFor feedback: https://discord.gg/3GRWE2k',
