    long_description:
      'SilkRoad is the mobile version of Silkroad Online.\nThere are two main classes, Tang and Roman. Each 2 class includes 3 sub-class. Tang includes: Bicheon, Heuksal and Pacheon. Roman includes: Warrior, Mage, and Priest. The 2 main classes’ born place is different and have individual grow tasks.\n·Special identify gameplay mode \nPlayer reaches certain level will unlock Identity gameplay mode. There are 3 identities: merchant, hunter and ranger. Player can perfectly experience the ancient Rome merchant silk road. \n·Abundant dungeon events\nGo deep in the dark cave, and explore the intricate underground city to slay the evils. Go through the ancient path and wander on the jungle to search for the treasure. Pass through the deep and serene temple to vanish the monster and get powerful equipment, etc.\n·Fulfilling guild system\nPlayer can fight the enemies with allies, win domain for the guild and gain rare resources . Player can also individually join multiple guild events and get rich rewards. \n·Perfect social system\n The journey in the SilkRoad, a long way off, and play with friends will take a little to do a lot. Make real friends and leave unforgettable memorieshere.\n·Liberal rank battle\nPlayer can enjoy PK with other players here, and win special title! \n·Gorgeous Skin\nSpecial fashion outfits, cook wing and mount. Match them to make your style. \nThe fast-paced action, gorgeous special effects and wonderful music will make you unwilling to leave~Come and experience it!\nFacebook?https://www.facebook.com/officialmobilegame',
