    preview_url: 'https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.plarium.raidlegends&hl=en&gl=US',
    app_title: 'RAID: Shadow Legends',
    short_description: 'Lead your Champions in combat &amp; conquer the PvP arena in this dark fantasy RPG!',
    thumbnail:
      'https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/E449C2KMKI1YiAUoFr_aD2WJQNZeRAWc8XfiDwHboqDqGrYo5e7lDBkaD3mlaZ7VxwI',
    rating: 4.56272,
    downloads_min: 50000000,
    downloads_max: 50217752,
    website: 'http://www.plarium.com',
    app_size_kb: 0,
    contains_ads: 0,
    iap_min: 0,
    iap_max: 0,
    user_ratings_count: 1827646,
    privacy_policy_url: 'http://plarium.com/en/privacy-and-cookie-policy/',
    content_rating: 'Teen',
    one_star_ratings: 78422,
    two_star_ratings: 27860,
    three_star_ratings: 52120,
    four_star_ratings: 297670,
    five_star_ratings: 1371562,
    long_description:
      'Play for 7 days by Feb 20 to add Ronda Rousey’s new Legendary Champion to your team for free. \n\nBattle your way through a visually-stunning fantasy RPG realm with hundreds of Champions from 15 playable factions.\n\nTo save the world of Teleria, you will need to recruit its most legendary warriors from the forces of Light and Darkness. You must train them for team combat, mold them into living weapons, and assemble the greatest raiding party ever seen.\n\nWith 1+ million possible Champion builds, RAID is a role-playing game you can play your way. Explore your options and build the perfect team to take on all challengers. \n\nOur player community has been growing for over three years, fighting more than 10 million battles every day. Join the fight by downloading now, and show everyone that you are a worthy nemesis!\n\n| ENJOY DEEP RPG FEATURES |\n\nCOLLECT POWERFUL CHAMPIONS\nSummon 650+ warriors from 15 factions through gacha collection. Assemble balanced teams of Sorcerers, Knights, Elves, and more to defeat any nemesis that stands in your way. Then, convince them to join your cause!\n\nFIGHT EPIC BOSS BATTLES\t\nDo you dare take on the Magma Dragon, the Fire Knight, the Eternal Dragon, or the Ice Golem? Vanquish dozens of challenging bosses for loot, XP, and special Champion drops. Then, in classic RPG style, go beat them again for more powerful gear!\n\nFACE THE MULTIPLAYER PVP ARENA\nGo head-to-head with other players in fierce combat to unlock special gear and climb the arena tiers. Two teams go in – only one comes out.\n\nFEEL THE VISCERAL 3D ARTWORK\nBeautiful, fully-rendered 3D heroes offer stunning detail down to the cracks in their armor. Watch friend and nemesis alike battle through a vivid fantasy world with thousands of unique skill and attack animations.\n\nDEVELOP AND MANAGE YOUR BASTION\nUpgrade your own personal fortress to manage your Shards and ready your Champions for dungeon runs, multiplayer arena combat, and the story campaign. \n\nENJOY REWARDING STRATEGIC RPG GAMEPLAY\nMake tough decisions and equip your Champions with powerful artifacts to aid them in their quest. Rank them up to unleash devastating special skills, AOE attacks, healing powers and more as you lead them in combat.\n\nCLEAR OUR MASSIVE PVE CAMPAIGN MAP\nExperience epic dark fantasy done right through 12 spectacular RPG locations spread over a sprawling, fully-voiced story campaign. Dragons, Orcs, and Undead Knights are just a few of the many beasts and beings that await you.\n\nEXPERIENCE HASSLE-FREE AUTOPLAY\nGacha role-playing games shouldn’t be a slog! Autoplay levels to spend less time grinding and more time exploring.\n\nPLEASE NOTE:\n\n* Items are available for purchase in this fantasy gacha RPG. Some paid items may not be refundable depending on the type of item.\n* RAID is available in English, German, French, Spanish, Italian, Ukrainian, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Turkish, Russian, Japanese, and Portuguese. We understand that role-playing games are always more immersive in your native language!\n\nRAID Official Website: https://plarium.com/\nRAID Support: raid.support@plarium.com\nOur RPG Community: https://plarium.com/forum/en/raid-shadow-legends/\nPrivacy Policy: https://plarium.com/en/legal/privacy-and-cookie-policy/\nTerms of Use: https://plarium.com/en/legal/terms-of-use/\nCCPA Employee and Applicant Notice: https://plarium.com/en/legal/ccpa/',
