    long_description:
      "A new chapter of Seven Knights unfolds!\nMeet new heroes, as well as familiar faces from other Seven Knights games, and join them on their exciting adventure!\n\n▶ Power up when you are away!\nFight and get stronger with ease!\nAuto-battle allows you to obtain EXP and Gold, even when you aren't logged in!\n\n▶ Form your very own team of heroes!\nMeet the lovable heroes of Seven Knights!\nMake your team shine with unique characters!\n\n▶ Strategic 10 vs 10 combat!\nEnjoy spectacular battles featuring up to 10 characters!\nShow off what your heroes can do in the field, dungeons, and arena!\n\n▶ Look fresh with pets and costumes!\n\n▶ Get tons of Rubies in the Big Login Event!\nRapid power up support!\nGet tons of login rewards and power up your heroes quickly! \n\n※ This app offers in-app purchases. You can disable this feature by adjusting your device’s settings.\n※ By downloading this game, you are agreeing to our Terms of Service and Privacy Policy.\n \n - Terms of Service: https://help.netmarble.com/terms/terms_of_service_en\n - Privacy Policy: https://help.netmarble.com/privacy_policy/skiagb",
