    long_description:
      "Primon Legion will officially launch on February 29th！\n\nFollow us and get more informations and rewards:\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/primonlegion/\nDiscord: https://discord.com/invite/gRuEm8AhK8\n\nStep back in time... Collect and train your monsters, and conquer other tribes!\n\nPrimon Legion opens a portal to a primal world where monsters await your incubations. As you collect and train your monsters, become the Ultimate Master of the Stone Age!\n\nGame Features:\n\nPrimon Legion, a Stone Age-themed card collection game, combines charming monster collection with effortless gameplay, perfect for playing anytime and anywhere.\n\n【Primal World Adventure】\nEmbark on a cross-time journey venture deep into the Stone Age world. Rise from a Monster Trainer to the Ultimate Monster Master!\n\nInterworld Warrior, are you ready to this journey?\n\n【Monster Collection & Evolution】\nIncubate adorable monsters and unlock new powers and abilities through evolution to enhance your strategic gameplay. From cuddly pets to fierce beasts, your monsters will define your legacy!\n\n【Team Battle Tactics】\nMastermind the ideal monster packs,  and harness each creature's innate abilities for domination. Your victories are odes to your strategic prowess!\n\n【Idle Rewards While Sleeping】\nYour monsters never rest! Reap idle resources and accrue riches while you sleep, awakening to newfound power and loot for your relentless ascent.\n\n【Tribal Syndicates & Camaraderie】\nJoin forces with friends to build a thriving tribe. Forge alliances that extend beyond the battlefield and create lifelong friendships!",
