    long_description:
      'Welcome to Valhalla!\n\nCollect, train, ascend, evolve, and awaken your Heroes to change the fate of the world.\nForm the best raid party by pairing Legendary Heroes and Absolute Gods together.\n\nDownload now to experience the epic tale of Gods and Heroes in their quest to stop the Final Battle!\n\n▼ Meet mythical beings from all over world!\nLead your team to victory with the help of Gods!\nAbsolute beings from Greek, Roman, Norse, and Egyptian mythology will help you on your journey.\n\n▼ Explore Valhalla with Legendary Heroes!\nCollect Human, Orc, Beast, Demon, and Undead Heroes.\nBestow them with weapons and equipment to unleash their power on the battlefield!\n\n▼ Form Valhalla\'s ultimate team by combining Gods and Heroes!\nCreate a raid party with synergy between Heroes and Gods.\nUtilize Tactics to complete your own unique composition.\n\n▼ Form a clan to join forces and prepare for the Final Battle!\nFight alongside your clan members to eliminate foes that threaten Valhalla from deep within the dungeons.\nAlso, don\'t forget about the special perks that are only available at the Clan Shop.\n\n▼ Explore various regions in the Campaign and gather resources for your adventure!\nExperience the epic tale that unfolds in numerous stages, such as the "Frozen Plains" and the "Arid Desert."\nPerform divine miracles to get yourself out of harm\'s way.\n\n▼ Prove to everyone who the strongest warrior in the Arena is!\nFight other warriors in PvP battles to show your worth.\nReach Diamond tier to participate in the Legendary Arena.\n\n▼ Overcome the Gods\' trials in Challenge mode and become even stronger!\nSee how far you can go in this PvE challenge.\nMarvelous rewards await at the end of arduous trials.\n\nGet the latest news by subscribing to the Gods Raid community server!\n\n· Official Community Server: https://community.withhive.com/godsraid\n· YouTube Channel: https://www.youtube.com/@GodsRaid?sub_confirmation=1\n· Support: https://customer.withhive.com/thumbage\n\n· Terms of Service: https://terms.withhive.com/terms/policy/view/M464/T321#T321\n· Privacy Policy: https://terms.withhive.com/terms/policy/view/M464/T321#T322',
