    long_description:
      'Come and enjoy our Mobile Fantasy Idle RPG Ever Legion! \nThe army of "Deathless" spread the horrors to every corner of the Nevria, growing amid mutual hostility and suspicion between humans, orcs, and elves.\nTo save your family from being turned into undead monsters, you embark on an adventure. But as your journey progresses, you discover that thousands of "Deathless" are just pawns in the hands of the Necromancer Balor...\nYou can summon epic hero combinations from all races and faiths to form your team, take on powerful foes, and discover another dark force cloaked in the shadows as the campaign continues.\n\nBeautiful Fully 3D Fantasy World\nSeveral years of research and development, ultra-realistic 3D graphics and models, and a grand worldview are all packed into this amazing fantasy RPG! \n\nUnique Heroes & Strategic Game-Play\nForm a party by recruiting thousands of Heroes from seven different factions, including Illuminated, Ardent, Vitalus, Eternal, Euda-Anointed, Daeva-Anointed, and Elemental. \nLevel up your Heroes, unlock ultimate skills, learn your factional strengths and weaknesses, develop a strategy... and you will crush all the enemies in Ever Legion!\n\nOffline Rewards & Various Side Quests\nAre you fed up with overly time-consuming gameplay? Come and enjoy our Mobile Fantasy Idle RPG! Each time you come back to the game, you\'ll find yourself better able to face the challenges!\nWith many side quests like the Spirit Realm and the Isle of Mists, you can enjoy epic adventures with Rogue-like elements. \nMore fun challenges and rewards are on the way!\n\nPVP Combat & Global Coliseum \nForm a Guild with players from all over the world and defeat Guild Boss to earn great rewards. Compete with adventurers in the global Coliseum to earn a place in the Rankings. \nFighting for glory! Fight for the champion!\n\nOfficial Customer Support Email: everlegion@carolgames.com\nOfficial Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/everlegionEN',
