    long_description:
      "Superheroes Idle RPG\" invites you into an enthralling world where you assemble a formidable team of superheroes to face the evil Doctor Cruel. With each hero's unique abilities, strategize your way to victory in this immersive idle RPG.\n\n- Hero Collection: Dive into a universe filled with diverse superheroes. Unlock new heroes with the gacha system, each equipped with special skills and a backstory that enriches your gameplay.\n\n- Epic Battles: Engage in strategic battles against Doctor Cruel's minions. Adapt your lineup and tactics as you progress through challenging levels, ensuring your team's supremacy.\n\n- Idle Progression: Your heroes continue to fight and grow stronger even when you're not playing. Enjoy a game that progresses with you, offering new challenges and rewards upon your return.\n\n- Community & Rewards: Connect with fellow players, climb the leaderboards, and earn rewards as you showcase your strategic prowess.\n\nJoin \"Superheroes Idle RPG\" today and lead your team of heroes to victory, proving your might in the quest for peace and justice.",
