      "Double Fortune Casino is an amusing online casino, provides a number of engaging fishing games.\n[FIsh Hunter], the top-rated online fishing game throughout Asia is in the game. Don't hesitate to come and enjoy being King of the Oceans and experience the thrill of winning super coin rewards.\nHere you’ll find many casino games based on real machines from casinos all around Asia - including Taiwan, Hong Kong, Macau, Malaysia, and more!\nThere are a variety of high-quality arcade fish games from classic to state of the art releases. There's no better choice than to enjoy a rich fish hunting experience in Double Fortune Casino!\nThe game allows you to play real casino fishing games in your home! Fish hunting lovers like you can't miss this classic game! You can also play these fun games with players all around the world.\n\n\nSpecial Features in Double Fortune Casino:\n? Striking graphics, dynamic effects and realistic gameplay.\n? Adventurous journeys to take you on a trip around the world.\n? Log in every day to receive lots of coins.\n? No level-based restriction in fish hunter gameplay.\n? User-oriented development and updates.\n? Level up and coins rewards.\n? Enjoy the game whenever and wherever you want to.\n\n- This game is intended for an adult audience (18+) for amusement purposes only and does not offer ‘real money’ gambling, or an opportunity to gamble or win real money, cash or prizes based on gameplay. Playing or success in this game does not imply future success at ‘real money’ gambling or any gamble-related venture, online or offline.",
