    long_description:
      "Chibi Planet: the MMORPG game that allows you to simulate life in an adorable Chibi world!\n\nYour new life begins in Sunny Town. Here, you'll be able to pick your profession, apply for jobs in companies, save up some money and move into your dream house, or start your own company and hire talented staff to help boost your sales. Who knows? Your company might become top-notch in town!\n\nTired of working? You could take a break by having a night out in pubs, travel to the Southern Island for your holiday, play mini-games with your friends, have yourself a shopping spree, fishing, harvesting, set out for your adventures fighting with dangerous monsters in search for the treasures or more, you name it!\nDownload now!\n\nFor more information, please visit our website:\nhttps://www.facebook.com/ChibiPlanetInternational",
