    four_star_ratings: 1867,
    five_star_ratings: 11693,
    long_description:
      '?????????Hey Chefs! Are you ready to cook some delicious dishes at your restaurant? Indulge in some playtime, growing veggies on the farm & cook a variety of exquisite cuisines from all over the world at your hotel and serve it to your customers. With your creativity and our state of art tools, build the restaurant of your dreams!????\n\n????Unleash the cooking fever by becoming a part of the chef community. Meet top chefs and visit their restaurants, join them, farm and cook & get the chance to win the title of Master Chef by participating in cooking competitions & tournaments.????\n\n????Cook, bake and grill your finest meals catered to the needs of diners at your hotel. Compelling simulations like live music, celebrity appearances, pool parties, farm and much more outside the restaurant kitchen are stirred up for your fun. This cooking mania will drive your entrepreneurial spirit to farm veggies, build restaurant, run hotel and manage your restaurant.?????????\n\n???? Enhance your cooking city, farm and cook your creative meals with our restaurant game. In this chef world, you get a chance to compete to secure the Ultimate Title of Star Chef! in your hotel ????\n\nWhy Install Star Chef 2 game?\n\n? Easy to use & stimulating interface \n\n? Fun, addictive & action-packed cooking tycoon management\n\n? Showcase your chef skills, farm veggies and prepare a variety of cuisines in your hotel\n\n? Make your restaurant vibrant with distinctive decors & designs\n\n? Grow your own produce on a farm with backyard farming!\nHere’s what we got for you:\n\n\nIntriguing Storylines????\n80+ story-based quests and live the absolute chef life! Hone your management skills, farm and keep growing in the hotel kitchen of cooking madness!\n\n200+ Delicious Recipes????\nRanging from pizzas & burgers to frittatas and even waffles! Bring out the chef in you and have loads of fun with our online hotel food game. \n\nPersonalisation????\nDecorate your restaurant with unique design patterns ranging from wall decals & floor decors along with exceptional props! Revamp and renovate your restaurant with our lavish decorations.\n\nHire International Chefs?????????\nEnhance your cooking diary with skilled international chefs. Grow your culinary skills & take part in cooking battles.\n\nChef Teams????\nChat and team up with your super chefs. Explore the well-knit community play features and team-up to collaborate & participate in tournaments.\n\nChef Masters????\nTop the leaderboard by competing with real chefs in skill-based PVP tournaments. \n\nTrivia???????\nGrasp surprising and fun historical facts about cuisines and dishes as you keep growing as a restaurant tycoon.\n\nVegetable Garden?????????\nBegin your cooking adventure by growing fresh farm produce in your backyard.\n\nChef’s Store & Food Truck???? \nTrade your dishes, veggies, and even unthinkable cookbook secrets!\n\nPLEASE NOTE! \nStar Chef 2 is a cooking simulator game to download and play. Although some fascinating game items can be purchased for real money.\n\nPrivacy Policy: http://www.99games.in/privacypolicy.html\nTerms of Service: http://www.99games.in/termsofservice.html\n\nHave queries about the game?\nReach out to us at: support@99games.in\n\nStart your culinary journey, farm & live the chef life. Download Star Chef 2 now to get cooking!',
