    long_description:
      "Let's Design Awesome Sneakers!????\n\nBecome a PRO sneaker artist! Grab your paint brush and design DIY custom sneakers in art games. Show your coloring games skills, paint shoes to create artistic designs in DIY Games. Make Custom designs, place the sneaker art on display and sell them in your sneaker shop! \n\nFun and addictive design games, work as a sneaker artist, and show your hidden art skills! Start with painting the sneaker just like coloring games and create the perfect design. Do a DIY custom paint job, create unique designs in sneaker art games. Match the design perfectly, or make your own in shoes games!\n\nMake DIY custom shoe designs using different brushes and color in art games. Next step is to lace up, Choose from dozens of laces in a sneaker shop. Pack your designed sneakers in a box and put them on display in shoes games. \n\nStock up your shoe store with your awesome designs. Make money selling the designed shoes and grow your sneaker shop. \n\nGet rich from your awesome sneakers in DIY games!\n\nSneaker Art Features:\n????Design sneakers using different paint colors \n????Match the design perfectly\n????Choose from dozens of laces and tie up!\n????Get rewards!\n????Pick a box and drop in shoes!\n????Stock up your shop with your cool designs\n????Get rich selling awesome DIY sneakers!\n????Easy and intuitive touch controls\n\nWhether you’re a sneaker art fan, love art games, or just want to play ASMR relaxing coloring games you’ll love Sneaker Art!\n\nOfficial Facebook Link: https://m.facebook.com/TapNation-235177097407717/\nOfficial Instagram Link: https://www.instagram.com/tapnation.io/\nOfficial Twitter Link: https://twitter.com/TapNationGames\nSupport: contact@tap-nation.io\n\nPrivacy and Cookie Policy Link: https://www.tap-nation.io/legal-notice/\nVisit https Link: //www.tap-nation.io/",
