    long_description:
      'Run your own Idle Bank games, Print money games, serve clients, give out loans and get Rich in the newest Idle Business Tycoon Games. Take care of the finances just like in cashier games, handle cash flow like Money Games and Grow your Bank Games Business to become a Billionaire in Tycoon Games.\n\nBank Simulator Tycoon Games\nThe Board gave you full control of the Idle Bank branch, Work as a bank manager to increase the capital and get promoted in cash games. Serve clients, increase the inflow of cash games, upgrade the premises to grow business in Bank Games.\n\nManage Staff\nManage the Idle Bank staff, Hire consultants, Banker, Cashier, customer service and security staff in Idle Business Tycoon Games. Handle your finances, pay the Idle Bank expenses and staff salaries like in Bank Job Simulator.  \n\nGrow Business Tycoon Games\nUpgrade the equipment to increase efficiency and make sure the operations run smoothly in Idle Business Cash Games. Make right financial decisions and use money wisely to expand the Idle Bank Games. Unlock Money Games vault and cash printing department to Grow your Business & become a Billionaire Tycoon Games.\n\nGet Rich Money Games!\nExperience how it feels to make financial decisions like a Billionaire in Idle Business Tycoon. Serve the clients, increase the Cash inflow, make more Money Games and Get Rich in Bank Games.\n\nBank Heist Idle Games\nUse Money games to upgrade your premises and hire security staff to prevent heist bank games. The security staff will counter the Bank robbers in case of Idle Bank Heist.\n\nIdle Bank Games Features:\n????Manage your Bank Games\n????Serve The Clients Idle Games\n????Hire Banking Staff Money Games\n????Manage Finances Tycoon Games\n????Upgrade Equipment Idle Bank\n????Unlock New Areas Cashier Games\n????Print Money Games\n????Prevent Bank Heist\n\n---\nOfficial Facebook Link: https://m.facebook.com/TapNation-235177097407717\nOfficial Instagram Link: https://www.instagram.com/tapnation.io\nOfficial Twitter Link: https://twitter.com/TapNationGames\nSupport: contact@tap-nation.io\nPrivacy and Cookie Policy Link: https://www.tap-nation.io/legal-notice\nVisit https Link: //www.tap-nation.io',
