    long_description:
      'Embark on your journey to YouTuber stardom in PewDiePies Tuber Simulator! In this Idle Vlogger, use our YouTuber Simulator to create videos and get views and subscriptions. Unlock new items and turn your empty studio into amazing rooms and memes. Compete with others and vote on the best creations! \n\nCatch up to YouTubers like Markiplier, Jacksepticeye and PewDiePie to become the biggest YouTuber in the world and live a true YouTubers life. What masterpieces will you create? Find out now by downloading the game and exploring our multiple features:\n\n CREATE YOUR SPACE\nWith more than 3000 items and creatures like cats, dogs, Bob and many more, the possibilities for personalization are all but limitless. With this much freedom for originality, your room can be anything you want it to be, from an understated space filled with cardboard boxes, to a simulation of your real-life room, to a highly thematic creation of epic proportions.\n\n ROOM EVENTS\nEvery 3 days, a new thematic room event begins. Put your talents to the test to create the most amazing room. Express your creativity, shatter boundaries, and build a display to outdo thousands of contestants. Gather votes, get ranked and earn amazing prizes. \n\n CELEBRATIONS\nJoin in on the multiple Celebrations scattered throughout the year! Whether they take place during real holidays like New Years or Halloween, or at random times to celebrate random stuff we enjoy like Sci-Fi or Dinosaurs, these 10-day events feature a whole other look for the game, thematic room events, a special reward system, and celebration items available at the store and as prizes in mini games.\n\n MAKE A MEME\nImmortalize funny moments with our Meme Maker! Use our patented stickers and customizable text prompts to tell your story! Share your memes on social media directly through the game! Express yourself and show the world how funny you are! Use kittens to optimize your chances.\n\n MEME EVENTS\nDuring these three day-long competitions, you can share your best memes and vote for your favorites. Gather the most votes and claim glory on the front page to earn limited-time prizes.\n\n AWESOME MINIGAMES\nAs if that wasnt enough, we have multiple mini-games to help you along your journey. \nIn Craniac, lower the claw to get special items, eggs, and gather bonus views and subscriptions. \nIn Gobble, help tiny pets get food to gather views and subscriptions faster. \nIn Puggle, drop cute puppies down a Plunko board to get faster shipping on your items and get bonus special buffs.\n\n  CONNECT WITH FRIENDS\nJoin our amazing community and connect with millions of players. Create or join a Network to make new friends. Contribute to your Network to gain special network perks. Add friends to send and receive gifts like premium currencies, views and subs and progress even faster.\n\n  STORY TIME\nLet PewDiePie guide you on your journey to becoming the best YouTuber with our immersive story! Complete daily quests to level up, gain subscribers and views, and reach the top rankings. Surpass all other YouTubers and bring your journey to its full potential!\n\n  CUSTOMIZE YOUR TUBER\nYour room is not the only thing you can customize! Hair, eyes, glasses, chair, desk You can change anything about your avatar at any time you want! \n\n  FEEL THE GROOVE\nOur game features exclusive music by RushJet1 with a retro chip-tune feel thats sure to make you nostalgic for the golden age of video games.\n\n  ONE OF US!\nJoin our community to get the most recent updates:\n\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/outerminds/\nYoutube: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCQusOzwwyXsHoDuyvqcbwjQ\nTikTok: OutermindsGames\nTwitch: https://m.twitch.tv/outerminds/home\nTwitter: https://twitter.com/Outerminds\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/OutermindsCreations/\n\nPrivacy Policy & Terms of Use: https://outerminds.com/legal/\n\n 2016 Outerminds Inc. Revelmode  2016 PXM Network Ltd. All Rights Reserved.',
