    long_description:
      '🔫 Fight for survival, are you ready to face the challenge?\n\nAre you looking for such a fun tower defense shooting game: easy to play, but has the magical power to keep people watching, can bring you tactical challenges with real guns? "Tower Rush - TD" is an exciting tower defense game. In the game, you will be a fun shooter. You can accumulate gold coins in battle and distribute them reasonably to upgrade your defense towers and weapons. The game is divided into levels with different difficulties. There are thousands of waves of stealth master waiting for you to annihilate in the levels, with a smooth and long-lasting game experience.\nPlace defensive towers, heavy machine guns, rocket launchers, cannon towers, and flame towers in multiple locations on the map, kill multiple targets, enjoy thrilling conflict scenes, complete endless levels, and get exciting and rich rewards 🎖️ Use these rewards again Come and upgrade weapons and towers to build stronger elite troops!\n\n🔥 The pinnacle of mobile shooting games 🔥\n★Strategic game – "Tower Rush - TD" is a minimalist shooting game with a top-down perspective, intuitive gameplay, super simple controls, and automatic aiming, making it easy to play. But you must not think that you can easily win with those randomly placed defensive towers. Sophisticated game mechanics, coupled with increasingly difficult level waves, mean you can\'t just sit back and enjoy the rewards. You have to plan your every move and seize every fleeting opportunity in order to wipe out the enemies and clear more and more challenging levels.\n★ Play roles with different identities. In the world of war, it is duty-bound to protect the national peace As the level progresses, you will unlock more different identities, farmers, firefighters, pirates, they all have their own best weapons, switch Use your identity to deal with different levels of levels!\n★ Diverse Weapon Sets – Over thirty different weapons to unlock, star and upgrade, including pistols, shotguns, submachine guns and more. Kill enemies in various levels to earn cash, complete various requirements in the game, constantly fill your arsenal, find the gun that suits your identity, and then carefully upgrade and build it, Let the enemy die in a hurry without taking a few steps.\n★ Leaderboard – The game sets different cycle leaderboard surprise diamonds and cash rewards, come on and be a famous master on the leaderboard! Not only can you aim to be the top player on the list, I believe that you who are on the list will also attract a lot of attention.\n★ On the rage road —what a killer should do is to remind the monsters in the helicopter that only by constantly improving themselves can the family be safe.\n★​​​​​​Like Jonny trigger, a real gunslinger never leaves his finger on the trigger, it\'s not difficult, go and have a go.\n★Guns, towers, conflict,and your strategy... 💡\nIn order to resist the attacks of other countries, the magical  squad alpha formed in the America, create miracles!\n\nDownload "Tower Rush - TD" now and enjoy the fun of strategic tower defense.',
