    long_description:
      'Are you bored with so-called life simulation games in which the choices you make has no point? Then give Life Choices a try! From the creators of Brain Test Tricky Puzzles, Brain Test 2 Tricky Stories and Who Is? Tricky Riddles! A little bit life a little bit choices. This game is more about the decisions.\n\nUnicoville needs your help as the town needs repairs and restoration. Bring new people to the town, play their lives, complete objectives and see the town reborn before your eyes. Life simulator game is a free offline game. Life is a game! Play adorable angel and devil girls. It is little bit simulator but mostly story of heaven and hell.\n\nBecome anyone and express yourself freely in this game of life simulation. Create dozens of characters, live their whole life from birth to death, and make difficult choices along the way. Live all the bits of life. Hell heaven game is one of the best game in the world.\n\nLife Choices is a fun, interactive and interesting life simulation game filled with surprises. There are more than 1000 choices for you to make as you shape your characters’ lives and decide their fates. Start from the beginning as a baby and grow into an old person. Life game and judgement day features.\n\nBUILD YOUR SKILLS!\nWork on your intelligence, strength and art as you fight the hardships of life. Each choice affects your skills and your skills affect the outcome of your choices. If you like simulator games and story games this good girl bad girl game is very adorable.\n\nBUILD A TOWN!\nRebuild the houses of Unicoville and see the town flourish again. Pick from different house variations and establish your style. Enjoy the gorgeous 3D rendered town graphics. Choose your life and make your decision on your life. angel and devil games in an adorable life simulator.\n\nBUILD A HOUSE!\nStart with a small house and unlock bigger ones as you play. Customize dozens of rooms to your liking and pick furniture from a vast library of selections. All objects are beautifully rendered in 3D.\n\nCHOOSE A JOB!\nThere are several jobs and career paths to choose from. Work as a doctor, police, scientist, president, mafioso or cook. You can even go into crazy careers and become a superhero or a monarch. If you don’t like working, you can live as an unemployed and earn money through some side hustles.\n\nHAVE A FAMILY!\nYou can find love with your character and get married. As you develop your bond, you will have opportunities to make a child as well. See your child grow in front of your eyes. Make extremely hard parenting choices.\n\nBECOME GOOD or EVIL!\nThis game is not a stairway to heaven. You are not forced to be a good person. You can choose to become evil as well. Fight your way up into the top spots at Karma Leaderboards as someone who is good or evil.\n\nMAKE TOUGH CHOICES!\nWith the dilemma system, your characters will be faced with tough choices from time to time. You need to decide carefully, as the consequences are serious and effective.\n\nPLAY STORY LIVES!\nLife Choices allows you to create your own unique characters, but you can also play the story characters and help them achieve their life goals. Help Meredith to become an astronaut, or help Jeff to take his revenge. Live all the bits of life with interesting stories.\n\nFeatures:\n● Free to download, free to play, and free to enjoy. No hidden fees.\n● More than 1000 choices to make.\n● Dozens of different character sets.\n● Family friendly gameplay with no explicit content.\n● Customize the town to your liking. Design your own houses.\n● Customize your house with lots of options.\n● Play the story lives filled with exciting events.\n● Humorous situations and surprising events.\n● Create unlimited amount of characters.\n● Fight for the Karma Leaderboards.\n● Find your romance.\n● Get rich with the wealth system.\n● Dozens of different endings.\n● Addictive and relaxing gameplay.\n● Play without the internet.\n● Simple and highly addictive game play.\n● Play offline.\n\nHave fun!',
