    long_description:
      'Love Sparks is the newest dating sim & love chat that will become your getaway to the world of romantic stories where your choices matter. Play the perfect girlfriend & boyfriend simulator to immerse yourself in our virtual stories, find your perfect love matches and chat.\n\n- Romantic stories based on YOUR choices and decisions\n- Exciting game filled with romantic secrets, unexpected twists and revelations\n- Diverse characters too hot to handle \n- Real selfies and emojis: the ultimate chat story \n \nHow to play Love Sparks: Dating Sim:\n\nCUSTOMIZE your profile, choose your Zodiac sign and personal interests\nBROWSE through profiles of matching singles ready to chat with you.\nSWIPE right to connect and find your crush.\nCHAT with your virtual friend.\nFALL IN LOVE AGAIN… and again. Your perfect match is waiting in this chat.\nDEVELOP and level up your in-game relationship. Remember: you are talking to fictional characters, not real people. \n\nWho is your perfect match or crush in this boyfriend & girlfriend simulator? A fearless street racer, a stunning travel blogger, a rising music star, or maybe even a royalty? Every character in our chat stories is exciting, unique, single... Make your choices and see what is going to be next in the dating sim… You never know, but we’re pretty sure that in these chapters there’s going to be a lot of messages, crushes too hot to handle, adventures, and drama. \n\nIt’s time to dive right into the all-new chapters. Swipe to find your dream crush, feel the sparks fly and explore the chemistry with your dream match in this dating sim! Are you into love chats? Are you looking for some easy fun romance relationship or are you ready to make a commitment and build a serious relationship? It’s your choice! No judgment in this virtual chat & girlfriend simulator!\n\nIf you are into romance spicy games - Love Sparks is the perfect choice for you! Play the passion game to discover and live our gripping stories, where you make choices that matter. This relationship game is waiting for you!\n\nDownload Love Sparks: Dating Sim now and start a new chapter in your life! This app is not a real chat messenger, so if you enjoy dating sims and spicy games like Winked, Lovelink, Lovematch, MeChat or Love Sick, you’ll appreciate Love Sparks. Whether you’re looking for a relationship, or some easy fun: anything is possible! Make decisions, find your crush and enjoy the game! \n\nSUBSCRIPTION PRICING AND TERMS\n\nLove Sparks offers auto-renewing subscription options for "Premium Features":\n$14.99 - per month. No trial period offered.\n\nPremium Features:\nDaily bonus x10 multiply daily\nSuper boost feature for 12 hours daily\nUnique avatars\n\nAnother type of auto-renewable subscription is the "BOUNTY BOOST"\nCost: $7.99 per month. No trial period offered.\n\nBounty Boost features:\nMultiplies your daily calendar gift by 7\nAllows users to reclaim a missed calendar gift without having to watch ads\n\nThese prices are for United States customers. Pricing in other countries may vary and actual charges may be converted to your local currency depending on the country of residence.\nPayment will be charged to iTunes Account at confirmation of purchase.\nSubscription automatically renews unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24-hours before the end of the current period.\nAccount will be charged for renewal within 24-hours prior to the end of the current period, and identify the cost of the renewal.\nSubscriptions may be managed by the user and auto-renewal may be turned off by going to the user’s Account Settings after purchase.\nAny unused portion of a free trial period, if offered, will be forfeited when the user purchases a subscription to that publication, where applicable.\n\nRead more:\nLicense agreement: https://swagmasha.org/eula\nTerms of service: https://swagmasha.org/terms\nPrivacy policy: https://swagmasha.org/privacypolicy\n\nFind somebody who winked at you! Play spicy games and find your crush!',
