    long_description:
      "❤️ Do you like crazy cooking fun and want to become a world chef in cooking games? ❤️\n\n⏰ Are you looking for chef games? ⏰\n\n😍 Welcome to the world of cooking --- cooking simulator of cooking games and kitchen games 😍\n\nJoin Cooking World, a complete cooking game and fast food game to satisfy your cooking mania and craziness. Prepare, cook and serve delicious food like burgers 🍔 cakes 🍰 delicious pizza 🍕 and more with your cooking mom in this cooking simulator of cooking games for girls. Earn achievements, expand your cooking skills and write your own cooking diary by playing time management games and cooking cake games.\n\nPlay this ⏰ fast and fun 😍 gourmet cooking game anytime, anywhere. Install this chef game's cooking simulator for the first time and start cooking burgers, BBQ and seafood directly without the need for internet.\n\nTime Management of Meets Strategy of Cooking Simulator!\n\n➡️ Solve special time challenges & 1050+ of Casual Cooking levels of cake games and hamburger games.\n\n➡️ Earn fantastic customer reviews that will help you become a famous world chef in time management games and baking games.\n\nCreate a Restaurant Chain in the Cooking World!\n\n➡️ You can create a restaurant empire in this cooking game!\n\n➡️ From bakeries to burger joints, to five-star restaurants - cook and serve your way to the top of the food chain in this cooking simulator of eating games.\n\n➡️ Earn golden comment cards to unlock new restaurants and cafes in cafe games and chef games!\n\nLevel Up with Cooking Quests in Kitchen Games and Fast Food Games\n\n➡️ Win achievements by completing combos, cooking perfect meals & earning big tips as a cooking master chef.\n\n➡️ Complete all difficulty levels of the cooking restaurant game and baking games and earn more stars and coins.\n\nMaster a Massive Menu Among Cooking Games!\n\n➡️ A variety of foodies with different flavors are waiting in the cooking cake games and burger games!\n\n➡️ Explore and serve customers in cooking simulator of cook games\n\n➡️ Looking for a cooking game with an expansive menu? With the help of your cooking fashion, make hundreds of dishes including burgers, good BBQ and more...\n\nTravel & Cook Around The Cooking World\n\n➡️ Conquer the food scene around the world in time management games\n\n➡️ Satisfy cooking craze in different crazy cooking cuisine",
