    long_description:
      "Supermarket manager simulator game, play the role of a manager! Gameplay: Run your own supermarket. Place shelves, set prices to your liking, accept payments, hire staff, expand and design your store. Start your entrepreneurial journey by creating your own store and gradually transforming it into the ultimate supermarket. Take up the challenge and become a famous manager simulator and elevate your store to greatness.\n\nMake sure all products in your store are always available - keep stock checks to ensure your supermarket is always stocked. Place orders, negotiate prices and stay informed about market trends to attract customers.\n\nPersonalize your supermarket: Customize the look of your supermarket to your liking, choosing themes, colors and décor that reflect your unique style.\n\nTo grow your supermarket quickly, let us enrich your product range by unlocking new items, events and services to cater to the most discerning customers.\n\nPrioritize customer satisfaction: Focus on customer needs and address their feedback promptly. Adhere to high standards of service and cultivate a loyal customer base. As a result, your supermarket will become more and more successful.\n\nSupermarket Manager Simulator is more than just a game - it's a challenge that helps you test your management and strategy skills.",
