    five_star_ratings: 54181,
    long_description:
      'This is not the common fairy tale you read before. Enjoy the incremental mobile game of Dark Fairy Tales!\n\nYou, a Dreamer, begin your own story in the Land of Oz. Go adventure with heroes living in the Land of Oz and explore the secrets hidden behind the dark. \n\n[Free Up Your Hands]\nSet your hero formation and wait for victories with your hands away from phones. Your heroes won’t stop fighting, so don’t forget to harvest generous rewards when you come back. Say goodbye to all those redundant clicks and swipes and winy our battle with only several taps.\n\n[Train Your Hero Easier]\nExperience the exhilaration of upgrading heroes. Equip treasures for your heroes and grow stronger minute by minute.\n[Explore More Story] \nIn the Land of Oz, there are lots of secrets hidden in inconspicuous corners, waiting for Dreamers to explore. Play various modes to find out more stories about the natives of the Land of Oz.\n[Fight For Your Honor]\nRemember, you are not the only one who is summoned here. Adjust and discover your best hero formations and compete with other dreamers in PVP Arena. Win rewards and honors with your heroes!',
    screenshots:
      'https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/vCVPiCtZvwOm7zSr2OA64qLxMOlQMQHm1OzlWjE0UymEhT1Wys3SW-gSq9hKsfmxcA,https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/GQwwl4bveKsmIPXPOGNrPCrCuKiNi0nbZDqnIA5vfvJiYKKxm5YdGiIBi9bIPIaBMs0,https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/RZHl8fhgZi35d1DKvuS2KVGLvRxMWRZ152W_FwfMNOEZ6XzTAqe8-Rm009lA_P2n3Q,https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ETVRmOcoXWOrF7hx_o0SefhtqV70YpNUbynwQooq0mEJEGb7IQthCCK3bgZYjGKd-bA,https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/BEVOAoYKmZ1QlDiZgD33PepXVyjKu6jHRFc1aC6lUNvVXz52y3YqH1sG94qf_2Q7XsdZ,https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/sdO5laAAOwaDFnkrbup9Hu9VQ7hjSNI6b_P4GiRkGwwqC5baBmGU5CebaLMK6HIdVQ,https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/MU61OFMSVbxAhDmwQoiJL4GUGedt9BqtaWLeLQMVdiqEQ4T0nEEfsm0hXMYxj589OTY,https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ZdNiVHIMRbLdfkFv66GF_84rvDnFQh1aWr7HIOtyMF76KGNmpNu6Lj6t_bDG37pNOQ,https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/xaV22kX_y_70TQYUQ9LEV9AwIP_0eyqZkq0wjwSbC4l5QAZk5vEEzfCixtqUlUqBog,https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/u-BV2ZIJeUsCtifGdCTi1bQT42erjaokQ3DwIYzhlI072qSu6taky_CoDJduO8cO6f_Y,https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/0Y9W9zFbF2j-PUTRg_GndV1LfeAuTH7BtmL5iEFFPL5wv48cM0dXTTSkiKCJR4SS8JLi,https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OFkT5ihgFDe7EdA4d35cMTgdouiSPc5JPMB8rtYqVgH0HDHX-AXkM2aD7eZyDUGHbrim,https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/zuQtYK9CndX3VBaNFt9bVnws5Vvast0WrQ2m_5drD4tpFgeHNfoM3eXrEwgs10t1rjk,https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/2w8cbqpiap7EK9vGDjJYVYee84TSdhxXV4s2vNPgOcqxx4RjETy7wI88Q-71ZjREZg,https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/0JcuE0jkCyCyCKitUENBPvJmKd27DPcSDpysekQLlWx3croxX1STW8b_xOxemmE9nevh,https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/siXKdmxISAIxeEzQe-O3JpYDTu14oNqdeIk3NfcaK4pbgqSkPueH6xyUBn4pxy6VK-M,https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/YBFs0GPMpHsAAkK5lSn28HvcdZuMoAe_zvCgLVokbJVh1flINZXp-sO7uWHUL8q41w,https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a_oP6yqCN72PLFJTXMLoRVIHi21QCds-eLgE_gJuj_UymJRiDxE8RfxgqPJG_I-lWTs',
