    long_description:
      '🚀 Fascinating mechanics of opening new beautiful worlds, collecting and combining resources, building weapons, defense systems, dragging weapons along the path of the invaders. Only in your power to save the last tree on Earth!\n\n🕹 Simple and easy control of a character who is able to build, collect, defend! Try it now!\n\n🌎 Collect and combine resources, build factories and explore the whole universe, build protective weapons, fences, produce ammo, and choose a defense strategy! An amazing game in which you have to fight the invaders who encroach on the most sacred thing that remains with you. Open all possible paths, explore the world, look for resources, and may the force be with you!',
