      'Lead your stickmen to victory by drawing the most efficient path through various obstacles and multiplication gates\n\nStrategize your moves to outsmart the enemy and emerge victorious. \nBe careful though, some paths are more dangerous than others! choose wisely. \n\nCan you master the art of pathfinding and triumph over your enemy?',
