    four_star_ratings: 3096,
    five_star_ratings: 10683,
    long_description:
      'Welcome to a thrilling journey back in time with "Stone Age Survival," an immersive strategy game that challenges your survival instincts and strategic prowess. Set in a prehistoric world teeming with untamed wilderness and primitive challenges, your goal is to build a thriving settlement, mine valuable resources, and navigate the harsh realities of the Stone Age.\n\nKey Features:\n\nSettlement Building:\n\nBegin with a small tribe and expand your settlement to establish a flourishing community.\nConstruct primitive structures, gather essential resources, and strategically plan the layout of your village for optimal survival.\nResource Management:\n\nMine essential resources, including stone, wood, and gold, to advance your civilization.\nHunt wild animals, fish in nearby rivers, and gather plants to feed your growing population.\nLivestock Care:\n\nDomesticate and raise various types of livestock, such as goats, chickens, and cows, to ensure a sustainable source of food, leather, and other valuable materials.\nUnique Heroes:\n\nRecruit and command unique heroes with their own special abilities, strengths, and weaknesses.\nHeroes play a crucial role in your settlement\'s development, leading expeditions, defending against threats, and contributing to overall prosperity.\nHeroic Kitties:\n\nDiscover and unlock adorable hero kitties, each with its own endearing characteristics.\nThese feline companions provide bonuses, support, and a touch of charm to your settlement.\nMini-Games:\n\nEngage in a variety of mini-games that test your skills and decision-making abilities.\nFrom hunting challenges to resource gathering tasks, these mini-games offer a refreshing break from the strategic depth of the main gameplay.\nDynamic Challenges:\n\nFace evolving challenges as your settlement grows, including natural disasters, hostile tribes, and unpredictable events that will test your adaptability and leadership.\nTechnology Tree:\n\nResearch and unlock new technologies, allowing your tribe to progress from primitive tools to advanced implements.\nUpgrade your infrastructure and unlock new possibilities for expansion and survival.',
