    four_star_ratings: 23855,
    five_star_ratings: 112001,
    long_description:
      "Experience the intense thrills of the Jurassic era as you dive into a clash of fire, beasts, and stone to become the Chief Almighty. Venture back to when colossal dinosaurs ruled the earth, forming alliances with rival Chiefs to ensure your tribe's survival. Immerse yourself in the captivating ways of Dino kind, feeding and nurturing dinosaurs to thrive. Form an unmatched dinosaur army and establish your dominance. Hunt legendary creatures and prove your might in this enthralling world. Are you ready for the nerve-wracking test of survival?\n\n★★An Epic Strategy Mobile Game Engrossing the Stone Ages. Explore Global Continents with Players Worldwide!★★\n☆Embark on a hunt for archaic beasts, revel in a savage and primeval hunting frenzy!\n☆Harvest plentiful resources, build strategic alliances with Chiefs, and fortify your tribe!\n☆Alliances, raids, territorial expansion, occupancy. Augment your influence and power with mighty allies, steadfast, and ready to face the most worthy of Chiefs in head-to-head battles!\n☆Will diplomacy or domination reign supreme? Trust in your primal instincts, only the courageous and ingenious will rule the continent!\n☆Experience the grand inauguration of the world's unrivalled server.\n\n★★Legendary Features★★\n☆☆Real-Time Strategic Ralliesy☆☆\nMobilize your Clan comrades, marshal primordial behemoths, awaken your preeminent leadership skills and lead courageous warriors and ally Chiefs to claim the title of the Almighty Chief!\n☆☆HD Unity3D Game Engine. Extraordinary Graphics☆☆\nExperience a wide-angle panoramic map zoom set in lifelike detail. Players can wholly visualize each nuance of the vibrant map.\n☆☆Global Server! Players from diverse cultures compete fiercely for revered Relics, in pursuit of the exalted Arch-Chief’s honour! ☆☆\nMystic ancient relics, treasures of immeasurable wealth. No matter if you originate from the expansive Eastern lands or the sprawling West, join a Clan to experience primal, compelling battles!\n\n☆☆Epic Clash of Warriors and Dinosaurs☆☆\nCommand formidable warriors and Jurassic dinosaurs!\n✔Barbarians, the Clan's glory, these furious warriors hunger for combat. With their unyielding courage, even formidable Behemoths tremble in their tracks!\n✔Javelineers, invaluable pawns in our grand war game, they strike fear into enemy ranks, wielding damaging force with extraordinary precision and agility!\n✔War Riders, mounted on carnivorous, swift dinosaurs, they descend like a storm, wreaking chaos and destruction on foes with their mighty pole arms and lethal arrows!\n✔Behemoths, mighty creatures born of a time long past. From agile wild boars, enormous mammoths, triceratops, and a host of other prehistoric beasts, you have an imposing army at your command!\n☆☆Explore More Dino Features☆☆\nUnearth more functions: dine your Dinos, boost their well-being, train them, and establish your own dinosaur army. Become a Dino savant and gain ultimate dominance in the mesmerizing Jurassic world!\n\nTerms of Service: https://mhome.phantixgames.com/en/article/terms_of_use\nPrivacy Policy: https://mhome.phantixgames.com/en/article/privacy_policy\n\n\nChief Almighty Studio\n\nOfficial Customer Service Email: support.chiefalmighty@phantixgames.com\n\nOfficial Facebook Fans Page: https://www.facebook.com/ChiefAlmightyGlobal/\nCustomer Service- Assistant (Assistant always at your side)",
