    three_star_ratings: 13513,
    four_star_ratings: 31532,
    five_star_ratings: 175548,
    long_description:
      "Qureka lets you test your knowledge and earn coins by doing some real fun brain led activities:\n1. Playing daily live quiz shows (15+ shows daily)\n2. Playing hourly quiz every hour across categories like GK, Sports and more \n3. Playing cricket quiz & exam prep quizzes\n\n*Qureka Live Quiz:*\nYou can play live quizzes on Qureka starting from 9AM to 9PM. The live quizzes are available in English & Hindi as of now. The live quiz show has 10 questions (might vary) and you get 10 seconds to answer each question. Our daily prize gets split amongst all the winners equally, and in case there is no winner the prize gets added to the prize for the next show. Qureka also gives you opportunity to earn coins that help you from elimination in live quiz. In any live quiz show, 30 coins get applied automatically on your 1st wrong answer (not applicable on last question). You can earn coins in multiple ways. There are multiple mini quizzes running few times a day, where you can play & earn coins. \n\n*Hourly Quizzes:*\nApart from live quizzes, you can also come and play hourly quizzes on Qureka to test your knowledge across categories & also win coins. These quizzes are live throughout the day and you can come and play them anytime. You get 90 seconds to play each hourly quiz, tr & answer as many questions as you can in these 90 seconds to get a good score. You get 20 points for every right answer, (-)10 points for every wrong answer and you also get a bonus 10 points every time you answer 3 questions correctly in a row. Your score at the end of 90 seconds determines your rank and your rank determines how much coins you win from the quiz. Hourly quizzes on Qureka are available in many categories, some of them are:\n- GK Quiz\n- Sports Quiz\n- Math Quiz\n- Flim & Celeb Quiz\n- World Quiz\n- Business Quiz\n- History Quiz\n- Geography Quiz\n- Literature Quiz\n- Politics Quiz\n\n*Cricket Quiz:*\nQureka offers a seperate section to play quizzes around cricket. Cricket quizzes can be played across categories and you can win coins by playing these quizzes as well. Categories available under cricket quiz are:\n1. IPL Quiz\n2. Cricket World Cup Quiz\n3. Indian Cricketers Quiz\n4. Quizzes Around Cricketing Records\n5. Cricket Knowledge Quiz\n\nAll these quizzes let you test your cricketing knowledge. There are multiple quizzes running throughout the day in this section, you can come and play them anytime of your choice.\n\n*Exam Prep Quiz:*\nYou can also come and play quizzes to prepare for a competitive exam. Qureka offers the 'Exam Prep' section where you can come and answer questions that appeared in the last few years in multiple competitive exams in India, and you can also win coins in this section, categories of quzzies in this section are:\n- UPSC Exam Quiz\n- SSC Exam Quiz\n- Bank PO Exam Quiz\n- 10+2 Entrance Exam Quiz\n- Management Exam Quiz\n\nQureka is completely free and at no point do we ask users to pay us for playing a game, there is no gambling involved when you play games on Qureka. Generally, all the quizzes will be free to join, but there will be special quiz games which will require coins to join the game. So keeping sufficient coins in your wallet is recommended at all times.",
