    five_star_ratings: 0,
    long_description:
      'Charge up your brain cells by playing math games on Math Quiz Master. Can you solve all the mind-boggling quizzes?\n\nIf you are a maths enthusiast, you will enjoy the fantastic collection of maths puzzles. Be ready to sharpen your calculation skills and score high to become one of the top rankers.\n\nCompete by solving addition, subtraction, multiplication, or pick a cool math trick from a pool of blazing-hot math puzzles.????\n\nNow pop out the fear of Math with the hints curated specifically for you. Pick the correct answer from the four options under each question. Don’t be shy in using the hints to crack the quiz.\n\nYou don’t need to be in a specific age group to enjoy the app. From children to adults, we have quiz games for everyone out there.????\n\nCheck out the benefits of attempting our entertaining math quiz below!\n\n# Mathematical quizzes eliminate blurred thinking\n\n# Enhance creative problem-solving skills\n\n# Build concrete, logical, spatial, and critical thinking skills\n\nHey, if you think you are a maths expert, then you are in for some shocks! Hop on and board the #mathexpress on Math Quiz Master.\n\nShow off your math skills to your friends and family through our constantly updated leaderboard.\n\nCheck out the main features of the Math Quiz Master app below!\n\nMain Features\n• Easy to understand language\n• Colourful scoreboard with ranks\n• Vibrant app display to soothe your eyes\n• Latest and updated math games \n• No subscriptions involved\n• Questions under the following patterns:\n- MCQ\n- Image-based\n- True and False\n- Rearrangement\n• Different difficulty levels of questions (Easy, Medium, and Hard)\n• Get extra points for choosing the correct options in a streak\n• Hints curated specifically for each question\nMath Quiz Master lets you roam through a sea of maths puzzles!\n\nWhat’s new?\n\n# Faster game performance\n# Colourful graphics\n# UI / UX Changes',
