    long_description:
      "Entertainment-packed cricket based trivia under the categories IPL, Test cricket, World Cup, Indian cricketers, etc, on CricQ - Cricket Quiz 2022.\nIf you are a big cricket buff, this is your go-to platform for all the latest quizzes. CricQ offers a variety of cricket quiz questions under various categories on an hourly basis. \nPlay, test your knowledge, and win coins on the app. You can also compete with your friends to show off your knowledge about your favorite sport. Check out your rank after each cricket trivia quiz.\n \nHow to play a cricket quiz on CricQ?\n1) Open the app from the play store\n2) Watch videos and collect your coins to play various cricket trivia quizzes\n3) Choose any hourly quiz from IPL to Test cricket\n4) Check out the rules\n5) Press the 'start quiz' button to play\n \nKnow the rules of the app\n- Attempt maximum cricket quiz questions from the set of 25 questions under 90 seconds\n- Each question will have 3 options including 2 wrong and 1 correct option\n- Collect 20 points for each right answer and -(10) for each wrong answer\n- Get 10 points extra if you answer 3 questions correctly in a row\n- Check your name in the winners' list, declared at a predefined time\n \nMain features\n- Participate in hourly quizzes to play sports quiz\n- Challenge and invite your friends on the app to level up the fun!\n- Cricket trivia quiz based on easy to hard level\n- Win coins to play the quizzes by watching the video too\n- You can also play some quizzes without any coins as they are free\n \nCategories of quizzes on CricQ:\n- Cricket records\n- Test cricket\n- Cricket knowledge\n- IPL\n- World Cup\n- Indian Cricketers",
