      'Get ready to increase your science knowledge with our thrilling trivia sets.\n\nScience Quiz Master is a clean and simple app designed for entertainment purposes where you will get all the latest and updated science trivia.\n\nEveryone from a teen, or adult is welcome on Science Quiz Master. Your age cannot stop you from learning science concepts and having a good time.\n\nWe have kept Science Quiz Master without any subscription to give a flawless experience to our users. \n\nWe will armor you with the power of hints curated specifically for each question. Crack trivia quiz sets with flying colors and do not fear negative markings because we have none.\n\nThe users can even create their own trivia through the mix ‘n’ match feature. Simply choose your topics and start cracking the science trivia out of them.\n\nCheck out the app features below\n\n• Trivia in user-friendly language\n• Scoreboard and leaderboard to increase the fun quotient\n• Vibrant app display to soothe your eyes\n• Latest and updated science games \n• No subscriptions involved\n• Questions under a variety of patterns\n• Different difficulty levels of questions (Easy, Medium, and Hard)\n• Get extra points for choosing the correct options in a streak\n• ‘My stats’ section for details about the trivia set\n• Hints curated specifically for each question\n\nScience trivia is not just for fun but for your overall development too. A quick trivia set can improve the following skills\n\n# Attention\n# Long-term and short-term memory\n# Visual processing\n# Logical reasoning\n# Overall processing speed\n\n!! Your search for a perfect science quiz ends here !!',
