    long_description:
      "Board the IQ-express if you feel you are smarter than a 6th grader. A brain game curated for all age groups to test your IQ.\n\nYou don’t need to be of any specific age to enjoy this light-hearted exciting quiz game!\n\nAttempt an endless streak of general knowledge quizzes and challenge yourself to become the ultimate king of trivia games.\n\nDo not worry as the quiz sets are curated in your ever-friendly English language. The fun doesn't ends here, all the quiz sets are latest & updated on a regular basis. \nIf you are stumped on any trivia question just unlock the hint that is closely related to it.\n\nTo enhance the fun experience we have given you 3 different levels of quiz sets (Easy, Medium, and Hard). Choose your level in whichever way you like.\nAttempt all the quizzes without any second thoughts, do you know why? Because we don’t believe in negative markings!\n\nWe have a leaderboard section for all our zealous users, feel free to check your name at the end of each quiz.\n\nA specifically curated ‘My stats’ section represents the number of played quizzes, the total number of questions played by you, and the number of right answers. \nMix ‘n’ Match is one of the app's coolest features. It allows the user to mix quizzes from different topics.\n\nCan you crack all the quizzes and prove to be smarter than a 6th grader? If yes, then join the thrill now!\n\n*App features*\n- Hints available with each question\n- There is no negative marking for wrong answers\n- Latest and updated trivia questions\n- Multiple levels (easy, medium, and hard) among quiz sets\n- +2 points for every consecutive right answer\n- +5 points if the question is answered under 2 seconds\n- Mix ‘n’ Match feature for a plethora of topics",
