    long_description:
      'Welcome to the ultimate entertainment quiz where you can find trivia on all Bollywood, Hollywood, celebrities, and OTT shows.\n\nIf you are a movie lover, then Movieflix Quiz is the perfect one-stop destination. Don’t hold yourself back because we don’t have any age bar!\n\nCheck out our latest and updated movie quizzes on various Bollywood and Hollywood movies. \n\nThe Bollywood quiz will have questions on both new and veteran celebrities. The movie trivia doesn’t end here, you will also find questions on famous Hollywood celebrities and movies.\n\nMovieflix Quiz offers you access without any subscription to the world of entertainment quizzes! If you are a lover of OTT shows then dive right into the trivia sets to check out your entertainment IQ.\n\nWhether you are a fan of Bollywood stars or Hollywood stars, this app is the perfect spot to play questions on your favorite celebrities as well.\n\nPlay quizzes based on a movie clip or a picture of a famous star.\n\nEnjoy the daily updated quizzes in our movies section! Earn your badges and collect your points to prove that you are a true movie buff.\n\nCheck out our share with friends feature where you can give an open challenge to your friends on Movieflix Quiz.\n\n*** Features ***\n\n- Movie based trivia\n- Extra points for choosing the correct options\n- Crack questions from a ton of different movies and OTT shows\n- Check out the leaderboard feature to show off your score and rank\n- User-friendly language across all the trivia sets\n\nLove and relish the movie quiz on the Movieflix app!',
