    four_star_ratings: 0,
    five_star_ratings: 0,
    long_description:
      'You will have the most amusing time of your life by participating in this exciting maths quiz especially made for players who love to explore, gain knowledge and have fun.\n\nMaths Quiz Adda is a simple app in Hindi, designed solely for entertainment purposes. You will not only have a fun time playing it but an engaging experience as well.\n\nKnowledge se bharpoor and overflowing with interesting hints, this app has quizzes that will make you think a little extra hard. \n\nSo apne idle aur aalsi brain ko laayein istemaal mein and get ready to be challenged with questions of your liking. \n\nThe app comes without any subscription and is open to each and everyone of you who is thrilled by numbers and excited by equations.\n\nOffering math games in the simplest Hindi and the three categorizations of the quiz into easy, medium and hard is sure to make you have a fun time playing it. \n\nYou will also be given a range of questions to choose from. Bored of playing multiple choice questions, we have image based ones as well! \n\nDo not want true and false questions? Then try arrange-rearrange questions! You are sure to never run out of options to explore.\n\nTo keep the spirit of mukabala alive, we also display scoreboards at the end of every maths puzzles. Now, you would know exactly where you stand. \n\nInvite your dost and dushmans to play along or be your own competitor, the choice is all yours! Eventually, you are going to have fun either way.\n\nFeatures of the app:\n-Easy to use\n-Quizzes framed in an easy to understand and simple Hindi\n-Interesting hints with every question\n-Distribution of quiz in an interesting pattern (Multiple Choice Questions, True and False, Image based and Arrange rearrange)\n-Availability of three categories (Easy, Medium, Hard)\n-Displays scoreboard after every quiz\n-Allows sharing your leaderboard with friends and even inviting them\n\nMaths Quiz Adda is literally the fun adda if you want to add some excitement and subtract boredom from your life! Dimaag lagao and knowledge badhao!',
