    long_description:
      'Immerse yourself in this thrilling physics quiz by challenging yourself to tackle fun and tricky questions that come your way.\n\nPhysics Quiz Wale is a straightforward app built simply to quench the thirst of your physics knowledge.\n\nIf your fascination for the world of physics is deep and never ending, the platform Physics Quiz Wale will totally ensure that your curiosities are satisfied.  \n\nOpen and accessible to everyone, the app comes without subscription and is super easy to use and participate in the science quizzes. \n\nBy offering numerous questions, distributed in easy, medium and hard categories, your quiz experience is not only made engaging but more refreshing and fun as well. \n\nWhat makes it even more intriguing is the format of the quiz made available to you. \n\nWith MCQs, Image based, True/False and Rearrange questions, we have ensured that boredom does not seep in your quizzing experience. \n\nCheck out the features of the app:\n- Easy to use and understand science trivia\n- Every question comes with hints to make the quiz experience enriching\n- Availability of different patterns (MCQs, Image based, etc.) keeps the user interested\n- Categorization of questions into Easy, Medium and Hard helps navigate the difficulty level \n- Questions framed in an easy to grasp way to ensure a smooth experience\n- No subscription involved and open to all interested users\n- Leaderboard and scoreboard helps determine ranks and scores\n\nIf you love to challenge yourself by testing your awareness, common sense and logic, Physics Quiz Wale is the go-to-platform for you. \n\nJust by participating, you will end up increasing your attention span, visual processing speed, and logical reasoning. \n\nThe joy of learning while playing and having fun is what this mind-boggling app has turned into a reality - a reality you would surely love to be a part of!',
