    long_description:
      'Now is the time to dive deep into the ocean of time by answering questions and testing your knowledge of the events related to the past.\n\nQuiz Dynasty is a fun platform to keep you engaged for hours by providing you with questions that range from the simplest to the most difficult. \n\nFor all the quiz lovers out there, of any age or gender, this simple app without any subscription will give you an engaging quiz experience.\n\nThe myriad questions available on this app are also backed with hints to further enhance the horizon of your intellectual curiosity. \n\nThe division of quizzes into easy, medium, and hard categories provides the user with the ease to distinguish where they stand in terms of their knowledge regarding history. \n\nNot only that, the formatting of the history quiz games is put in a way to ensure that you never get bored of a repetitive pattern. The freedom of choice regarding the type of questions users want is also available.\n\nFeatures of the app:\n- User friendly and easy navigation\n- Specific hints added to every question\n- Categorisation of questions into Easy, Medium, and Hard\n- Stats feature lands you to your score and overall performance\n- Comprehensible curation of questions to provide a smooth quiz experience\n- Scoreboard allows you to compare your stand with fellow players\n- An enriching and vast question bank which gives the opportunity to gain in-depth knowledge\n- Varied format of fun trivia\n\nFrom inducing you to rack your brains in dealing with multiple choice questions to thinking hard in attempting to identify famous historical images, we have a plethora of grounds to keep you immersed in this quiz. \n\nIf you are brave enough to tackle these questions, brace yourself because the battleground of history is totally prepared!',
