    long_description:
      'Charged with intriguing questions, Naukri Exam Prep is a wonderful platform where you can have fun and learn.\n\nThe app is quite simple to use and comes with no subscription. It’s packed with various quizzes catering to your different interests and needs. \n\nOccupying and engaging, the questions are bound to get you hooked for hours as you rack your brain to choose the most suitable option.\n\nPeople of all gender and age can access and play Naukri Exam Prep. This app is equipped with quizzes like SSC Exam, Management Exam, UPSC Exam, Bank PO and Clerk Exam. \n\nIf you are looking to practice for your upcoming exams, this is the most suitable platform that you can think of!\n\nAfter you are done playing the quizzes, at the end, the app displays your rank and score. In this way, it helps you immensely to know where you stand in terms of your competitors.\n\nThe questions of the quizzes are framed in simple English, which conveys the meaning easily to the users. \n\nWith four options along with every question, you will get a chance to test the horizon of your knowledge.\n\nMerely playing the quizzes will enhance your capacity to understand and tackle the trickiest of questions in a limited time frame. \n\nOnce you have acquired a mastery over this crucial aspect of competition, you will be acing not just one but all exams! \n\nFeatures of the app:\n- Easy to use\n- A rich question bank dealing with various competitive exams such as sarkari examination, ssc jobs, upsc exam, bank exam.\n- No subscription requirement\n- Scoreboard displayed after every quiz\n- Simple and easy framing of questions\n\nIf you are idling your hours away by procrastinating, Naukri Exam Prep ensures that your focus is back on track by showering you with a plethora of interesting questions.\n\nYour preparation for all kinds of job exams is right under the umbrella of this fun app.',
