    long_description:
      'Get ready as the ultimate quiz to test your knowledge is here.\n\nQuiztopia is a simple and entertaining app that is specifically designed in a way that makes learning fun.\n\nIf you are a hard core fan of quizzes in general, who loves to answer questions on all kinds of intriguing topics, be assured that you are going to have the best quizzing experience.\n\nOpen and accessible to people of all ages, without any subscription, Quiztopia has a bank of engaging questions that will keep you engrossed for as long as you want. \n\nWith plenty of questions to choose from, the best part about these is the hints accompanied by each. \n\nThe accessibility of hints provides further information about the questions. This, in turn, helps you gain a deeper insight into the related concepts.\n\nWhat makes the world geography quiz experience more appealing for the users is its categorization into Easy, Medium, and Hard. \n\nWith the view to ensure that there’s no repetition in geography quiz questions pattern, they are arranged in four formats: Multiple Choice Questions, True and False, Arrange Rearranged, and Image based. \n\nWith this refreshing quiz pattern, you are sure to turn into a zealous player.\n\nFeatures of the app:\n-Easy to use\n-Friendly user interface\n-Interesting hints with every question\n-Easy and comprehensible framing of questions \n-Scoreboard at the end of quizzes is good for performance evaluation\nand comparison\n-Distribution of questions into easy, medium, and hard categories, arranged in four different formats keeps the user engaged.\n\nParticipating in this fun geography quiz is definitely going to provide you with all the experiences at just one platform!\n\nBe it a challenging question regarding the physical features of a particular place, arranging the population of a specific country to identifying the map of your own country, this app will satisfy all your world geography wonders and curiosities!',
