    long_description:
      'Filled with exciting quizzes, Quizology is a refreshing app to help you have fun and become smarter in the long run.\n\nBuilt in a simple and user-friendly way, this app is infused with interesting and enthralling questions that make it the perfect playground for your brain’s potential to learn, grow and have fun. \n\nQuizology is open for everyone! This means that users of all gender and age are equally welcome to participate in this quiz.\n\nChallenge yourself at every step of the game by participating in this quiz that ensures you are more aware by the end of every game. \n\nWith a leaderboard and scoreboard, you will constantly be reminded of your scores. \n\nRecharged with this spirit of competition, you are sure to have a mind-boggling experience while playing and cracking the trickiest to the easiest biology quizzes.\n\nWith suitable categorization and a varied pattern of enriching questions, the players will get a chance to explore the world of Biology with ease. \n\nEvery question comes with an interesting and related hint which enhances the knowledge while adding the element of entertainment to it simultaneously. \n\nKeep your doubts aside and head on straight to playing Quizology by attempting as many quiz questions as you can! \n\nFeatures of the app:\n-Easy to use quiz games\n-Every question comes with hints\n-No subscription required\n-Division of questions into Easy, Medium and Hard categories\n-Distribution of questions in an interesting pattern (Multiple Choice Questions, True and False, Image Based, Arrange Rearrange)\n-Framing of questions in simple English to ensure a smooth quiz experience\n\nQuizology is the suitable app for you if you love to engage your mind enthusiastically in challenging biology quizzes.\n\nShoo the boredom away and play this fun quiz, anytime, anywhere, during the night or day!',
