    long_description:
      'The irresistible quiz you would totally be thrilled with is here to ensure you have an amazing time playing it.\n\nOpen to all, Quiz Lab is a simple to use and entertaining to play app. It is a highly recommended app for you if you love to increase your awareness through a fun game of intriguing questions.\n\nQuiz Lab is packed with questions ranging from the easiest to the most difficult. Through mere participation in this chemistry quiz, your mind will be churning with thrill and vigor. \n\nFramed in an easy to understand and plain English, the experience will be one of the smoothest quizzing experiences of your life. \n\nIn order to give you a clear idea of your scores and position with respect to your fellow players, the app also has the cool feature of a scoreboard displayed after every quiz you participate in.\n\nOne of the best parts about this quiz is that you can even share your scorecard with your friends and invite them to play as well! \n\nYou would be presented with a variety of question patterns to tackle. This will ensure that boredom never kicks in whilst you get engrossed in the world of equations and experiments of chemistry quiz.\n\nFeatures of the app:\n-User friendly fun trivia \n-Easy to use and navigate fun quizzes\n-Division of questions into three categories (Easy, Medium and Hard)\n-Questions distributed in different patterns (Multiple Choice Questions, True and False, Image Based and Arrange Rearrange)\n-Availability of leaderboard displays the rank and score of the user\n-Option to share your scorecard and invite fellow players\n\nQuiz Lab is the ideal app if you love brainstorming with challenging formulas and equations of chemistry. \n\nIf you consider yourself an all-rounder, then dive into the sea of questions using your mind as the sole lifeboat!',
