    five_star_ratings: 0,
    long_description:
      "An exciting quiz offering a challenging playground for your mind is here to enthrall you.\n\nEasy to use and understand, Mathetes app has been designed to help users of all ages and skill levels test their math abilities through a series of fun and engaging quizzes. \n\nWhether you're just starting out with basic arithmetic or looking to take on more advanced topics like algebra and geometry, we've got you covered.\n\nOpen and available to all interested users, Mathletes app comes without subscription. \n\nRanging from the most complex of arithmetical equations to the easiest sum, the quizzes on this platform keeps your mind engaged while ensuring you have fun in the entire process.\n\nThe quizzes are categorized into Easy, Medium and Hard. With this, you’ll be informed of the difficulty level of each question you answer. \n\nEvery question comes with an interesting hint to make sure you’re not just playing the quiz but expanding your mathematical knowledge as well.\n\nMathletes isn't just about competition – it's also about learning and having fun.\n\nEach quiz is carefully crafted to include a range of different question types, from multiple choice to true-false, image based and more. \n\nBy offering a scoreboard at the end of each quiz, the app not only displays your score but also provides insight into how you measure up against other participants. \n\nThis valuable feature enables you to assess your performance and identify areas for improvement, ultimately enhancing your quizzing skills.\n\nFeatures of the app:\n-The quizzes are designed with the user in mind, prioritizing ease-of-use and enjoyment\n-Questions are thoughtfully organized into three levels - Easy, Medium, and Hard \n-Multiple formats are utilized to present questions, including Multiple Choice, True and False, Image-Based, and Arrange Rearrange, providing an engaging and stimulating experience\n-A leaderboard is featured within the app, displaying the user's rank and score, allowing for a clear understanding of their performance relative to others\n-The app includes a social aspect, allowing players to share their scorecards and invite friends to participate, transforming it into a fun and competitive activity.\n\nIf the world of numbers fascinates you and solving complex math problems excite you, then the Mathletes app is just what you need! \n\nRoll up your sleeves and get ready to rack your brains in this Math quiz buzzing with mind-boggling and fun questions from Geometry, Arithmetic and Algebra.",
