    long_description:
      "Quiz Scientist is the perfect platform for all the quiz enthusiasts who are constantly seeking to widen their knowledge.\n\nWith a wide range of interesting science topics, the app provides the playground to learn new things through a fun quizzing experience.\n\nOpen to all and without subscription, Quiz Scientist is extremely simple to use. If you enjoy expanding your knowledge through an entertaining game of thought-provoking questions with a scientific edge to it, this app is highly recommended for you. \n\nQuiz Scientist contains a vast range of questions, spanning from effortless to challenging. By engaging in this science quiz, your mind will be energized and stimulated with excitement.\n\nThe quiz is presented in simple and straightforward language, ensuring a seamless quizzing experience. \n\nAdditionally, the app provides a scoreboard after each quiz, allowing you to track your progress and compare with other players.\n\nWhat's more, you can share your scorecard with friends and invite them to join the fun! This makes the quiz even more enjoyable, interactive and exciting.\n\nThe science quiz provides a multitude of question formats to keep you captivated in the fascinating and groundbreaking world of science. \n\nWith a wide range of discoveries, theories, and facts to explore, you'll never experience boredom while tackling various question patterns.  \n\nFeatures of the app: \n- The trivia is designed to be user-friendly and fun.\n- The quizzes are easy to use and navigate.\n- Questions are divided into three categories: Easy, Medium, and Hard to cater to different skill levels.\n-Each question comes with an interesting hint.\n- The questions are distributed in different patterns, including Multiple Choice Questions, True and False, Image Based and Arrange Rearrange.\n-A leaderboard is available to display the rank and score of the user, encouraging friendly competition.\n-Players can share their scorecard and invite fellow players to join in on the fun.\n\nEmbrace your perpetual fascination with science by challenging yourself to tackle a diverse range of questions and putting your mind to an enjoyable test.",
