    four_star_ratings: 0,
    five_star_ratings: 0,
    long_description:
      "A fun and engaging food quiz app, Quizlicious has been designed to test your knowledge of various foods from all around the world. \n\nYou can challenge yourself and your friends to see who has the most extensive knowledge of all things culinary.\n\nUpon opening the app, you will be greeted with a simple and intuitive user interface that allows you to choose from a wide variety of quiz categories. \n\nEach category features multiple levels of difficulty, ranging from easy to hard, which will not only keep you engaged but interested as well. \n\nOnce you have selected your preferred quiz category and difficulty level, Quizlicious will present you with a series of multiple-choice questions that test your knowledge of the chosen topic. \n\nYou will have a limited amount of time to answer each question, and the faster you answer correctly, the higher your score will be.\n\nWithout subscription and open to all enthusiastic players, Quizlicious is a fantastic app for foodies and anyone who enjoys testing their knowledge of all things culinary. \n\nWith its intuitive user interface, interesting quiz questions, multiple game modes, and extensive database of trivia, Quizlicious is sure to keep you entertained and challenged for hours on end.\n\nIn addition to its extensive quiz questions, Quizlicious also offers a social aspect that allows you to connect with other food lovers from around the world. \n\nYou can create a profile, compete in leaderboards, and share your quiz results with friends on social media platforms like Facebook and Twitter. \n\nAnother great feature of Quizlicious is its educational aspect. You can expand your knowledge of different cuisines, ingredients, and cooking techniques while having fun with Quizlicious.\n\nFeatures of the app:\n-Simple user interface\n-Features a leaderboard that displays the user's score and rank, offering an evaluation of their performance\n-With the ability to share scorecards and invite friends, it offers a fun and competitive pastime for players to enjoy together\n-Carefully chosen set of interesting questions designed to offer an immersive experience to the players\n\nAll the foodies who think their knowledge regarding food is unbeatable or anyone who is a food enthusiast, can come together to play this Quizlicious quiz and enjoy the taste of fun!",
