    five_star_ratings: 2466,
    long_description:
      'Have you ever engaged in word association games with your friends? Now, get ready to experience the thrill of playing such word games right on your mobile device! Introducing Word Match: Association Puzzle; a premier word association game that offers a new and immersive way to enjoy word challenges with your friends and family.\n\nImmerse yourself in the game by finding associated words from a vast selection and progress through the levels. While Word Match: Association Puzzle is easy to pick up and play, mastering it is a true test of your skills. Expand your language abilities as you explore the meanings of hundreds of words and connect them through associations.\n\nHow to Play:\n Tap on a word to start connecting associated words.\n Continue tapping until all associated words are selected.\n Complete levels by finishing all the words.\n Be mindful of avoiding extra words.\n\nEnthusiasts of word puzzle games will discover a new haven in Word Match: Association Puzzle, as we offer hundreds of levels with varying degrees of difficulty. From Hard to Antonym, our game provides a wide range of level modes for you to enjoy. Word Match: Association Puzzle breathes fresh life into the word association genre with innovative gameplay modes.\n\nWord Match: Association Puzzle serves as a relaxing word game that enhances your logical thinking, memory skills, intelligence, and vocabulary. This free casual word game brings joy to the whole family, offering safe themes and entertaining association groups for all family members to solve.\n \nOur puzzle game levels are meticulously designed to help you build logical word chains and enhance your spelling skills. The word association challenges in Word Match: Association Puzzle are unique to the expanding word games genre, and its mind-bending puzzles will keep you engaged and entertained.\n\n Features:\n Hundreds of levels with four different game modes\n Relaxing gameplay with no limitations or countdowns\n A fantastic way to expand your vocabulary\n Colorful visuals and engaging sound effects\n Tricky levels with mind-bending puzzles\n Extensive word library\n A good variety of boosters for assisted gameplay\n Play with one hand for added convenience\n Play offline anytime, anywhere\n Completely free to play',
