    four_star_ratings: 15,
    five_star_ratings: 180,
    long_description:
      '✨ Project Match 3, an immersive and joyful matching game! ✨\nProject Match 3 is an immersive and fun matching game that takes you on a mysterious and exciting adventure world!\n🔮🔮🔮🔮🔮🔮🔮🔮🔮🔮🔮🔮🔮\nIn this world, you need to collect buttons to earn coins through levels. After successfully completing a level, you will have the opportunity to unlock super rewards and become the top champion in the design world.\nNow, accept the invitation of Project Match 3 and start an immersive and exciting adventure!\nGameplay is simple:\n🔹 Arrange 3 or more identical buttons together to eliminate them.\n🔹 When you arrange 4 buttons in a row, a special rocket will be created. The special rocket can eliminate the buttons in a whole row or column.\n🔹 When you match 5 T-shaped or L-shaped buttons, a bomb will be created. The bomb can eliminate all the surrounding buttons.\n🔹 When you match 5 buttons in a line, a rotating button will be created. The rotating gem can eliminate all the buttons it selects.\n🔹 By combining 2 special buttons, you will create various magical effects to help you pass the level smoothly.\n🔹 As long as you eliminate all obstacles in the level and reach the goal, you can keep moving forward.\nFeatures of Project Match 3:\n💎 Diversified game modes. Three different elimination game modes for you to choose from.\n💎 Treasure Levels. Complete time-limited challenges to unlock super treasures.\n💎 Daily free gifts. Provide surprise gifts every day to make you happier.\n💎 Collect stars. After perfecting a level, you will receive rich rewards.\n💎 Easy and fun. Relaxing and challenging at the same time.\nA simple and fun game experience:\n💡 Simple controls, enjoyable gameplay, and beautiful interface!\n💡 Just tap the screen to swap gems!\nNo internet? No problem!\n✨ This game is completely free and can be played offline at any time.\nProject Match 3 is a popular matching game in the app store. It is unique, simple, fun, and challenging. After completing level challenges, you will receive star rewards. These stars can be used to collect valuable treasures.\nThis is the perfect matching game for you. It is completely free, but some in-game items require payment, such as purchasing extra steps and super props.\n🌟 Eliminate 3 buttons, endless fun! We look forward to your participation! 🌟',
