    five_star_ratings: 0,
    long_description:
      'Brain Test: Legacy offers players a new set of original brain teasers using the fan-favorite puzzle brain games formula. On top of the new levels, Legacy combines the best levels from the previous titles and presents them in a re-mastered way.\n\nIt has been a long journey for the Brain Test brand as we’ve published 6 different installments within the franchise in several years. Legacy comes as a culmination of years of experience and tricky puzzle fun!\n\nBrain Test: Legacy’s huge level trove includes mind games, iq games, puzzle solving games, and brain teasers all at once.  Test your brain with this ultimate free brain games experience. \n\nThis new iteration of the most successful brain puzzle game provides a new way of challenge for the veteran players. Test your brain with a highly difficult set of hard puzzles. Only the accomplished players of Brain Test 1, 2, 3, and 4 will have a chance of completing these brain test tricky puzzles.\n\nWhether you call it mind games, smart games or riddle games, the 5th version of Brain Test satisfies every player with a diverse selection of brain teaser games and brain out scenarios. Use your smart games skills to overcome this free brain test and become a champion of brain games. \n\nFor the daily active brain masters, we offer daily challenges that provide a unique experience every single day. Completing these daily brain puzzle tests offer both a sense of accomplishment and material rewards in the form of lots of bulbs. Use these bulbs to unlock hints and face the puzzle brain games with a wider arsenal.\n\nRevisit your dear Brain Test friends such as Agent Smith, Monster Hunter Joe, Uncle Bubba, Doctor Worry, and Tom the Cat. Their adventures are even trickier this time to boost your iq and develop your thinking game skills. Puzzle solving games genre has never been so rich before as we will offer at least 1000 levels in the updated version of Brain Test: Legacy.\n\nEnjoy an improved brain test experience with smoother controls, fluid animations, colorful graphics, and enhanced sound effects. Our team of experts worked meticulously to make every technical part of this free brain teaser game experience perfect. Riddles and brain quiz levels have never been so immersive before in the history of problem solving games.\n\nChallenging games are off-putting for some players. That is why Brain Test: Legacy puts forward intuitive hint and skip systems that allow everyone regardless of their age and education level to play it easily. After all, brain-teaser games are there to test your brain, not your patience. \n\nFree brain games should never require payment and internet. That is the exact case with the latest brain test iteration named Brain Test: Legacy. Puzzle solving game lovers can enjoy the mind games filled with brain teasers anywhere and anytime. Take your phone and play this at a park, library or even during a flight! Free brain games are something you can find here.\n\nFeatures:\n● More than 1000 tricky puzzle levels\n● Frequent updates that add new levels\n● Hard challenge levels for the veteran players\n● Daily levels for active players\n● Free brain training\n● Provides mindfulness \n● Improved hint and skip systems\n● Enhanced graphics and visuals\n● Smooth controls and flawless gameplay\n● Can be played with one hand\n● Can be played offline\n● No WIFI required\n● Completely free, no hidden fees\n● All levels are free to play',
