    long_description:
      'Wordelicious - fun and addicting word search food puzzle game that trains your brain!\n\nChallenge yourself by connecting the letters to find words and expand your vocabulary! \nCollect cookies and discover cuisines of different countries. Why not try to make food or bake something after getting your recipe? ???? Or even get the title of pizza maker among your friends."\n\nHighlights:\n???? Simplicious! Enjoy a classic word search puzzle game, like a crossword.\n???? Offlinelicious! Play free, play offline, play anywhere, play anytime.\n???? Challengicious! Train your brain, improve IQ and vocabulary.\n????Travelicious! Visit different countries while you connect letters to create words.\n???? Recipelicious! Learn the recipes for the amazing food you unlock by finishing puzzles.\n\n???? Travel the world, unlock new countries and get their prizes ????.\nSo, why wait? Install Wordelicious and start your amazing word game journey right now!\n\nBy downloading this application, you are accepting Terms of Service & Privacy Policy:\nhttp://murka.com/#terms-of-service\nhttp://murka.com/#privacy-policy',
