    long_description:
      "Word City: Connect Word Game is a combination of creative crossword puzzle, word connect, word searches and word puzzles, which can inspire your passion for brain challenges. If you like word games, sudoku and new games, you need to find all the words hidden in the crossword and find the words story. Challenge yourself and train your brain. If you enjoy free word puzzles play this free word connect and addictive word search game. Word calm games are fun but this word collect game is much better. This free word game without internet is just wow! It is a new game with free offline game features.\n\nBesides word collect games, if you also enjoy difficult games and fun games for free than play most popular nice games with hundreds of unique levels and city themes. There are many of free word scramble games on android but this unique word connect is a mix of word search and crossword. Play with your family, guess word, life relaxing game. The best game to relax when you don't have internet. It is free and brain training for adults. It is one of the best games in the world.\n\nHOW TO PLAY\n- Swipe the letters to line up words to fill up the blanks horizontally and vertically on the board\n- Tap the Hint buttons to get clues\n- Tap the Shuffle button to change the order of letters\n- Get more hints with coins by purchasing or watching videos\n\nFEATURES\n• Hundreds of unique challenges in this word connect and word escape.\n• Free Daily bonus rewards.\n• You will say wow with amazing themes.\n• Find words with bonus to collect more coins.\n• Simple & easy to play, hard to beat gameplay.\n• Suitable for both kids and adults to train word search skills.\n• Great exercise for the brain with word escape games.\n• Play OFFLINE in anytime and anywhere.\n• Play brain teasers games without internet. \n• Travel Theme with unique cities from all over the world.\n• You will find many similar word games but this word connect will standout.\n• Word game offline and nice games.\n• Thanks for playing word connect! Good times in the word games!\n• Word puzzle games improve your memory and word puzzle games great to play in spare time.\n• Enjoy word escape games for kids and brain games for adults. \n\nGame musics and sounds are from zapsplat.com, freemusicarchive.org, www.bensound.com, www.purple-planet.com",
