    long_description:
      'Do you love to travel and taste delicious food, but you never have free time? Do you want to improve your vocabulary and sharpen your mind, but at the same time want to relax a little? We have a way out! Wordelicious: Food & Travel - is the best choice for your goals!\n\nTravel to the most touristic countries and take great photos. Explore the culture of the country by solving word puzzles and get delicious recipes.\nComplete daily challenges to get the daily reward.\n\nGame features:\nThe game is easy to play. Enjoy a classic word search puzzle game, like a crossword;\nChallenge yourself. Train your brain, improve vocabulary and sharpen your mind;\nExpand your horizons. Visit different countries while you connect letters to create words;\nExpand your food knowledge and recipe book. Unlock the dishes by solving word puzzles;\nPlay without connection to the Internet.\n\n Travel the world, unlock new countries, and get their prizes .\nSo, why wait? Install Wordelicious: Food & Travel and start your amazing word game journey right now!\n\nBy downloading this application, you are accepting Terms of Service & Privacy Policy:\nhttp://murka.com/#terms-of-service\nhttp://murka.com/#privacy-policy',
